window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4901,"title":"Chapter 4901: Attaining Dao again","paragraphs":["Wh had he attained Dao?","Ling Han found this extremely strange. He had clearly advanced into the position of Great Emperor long ago, and had even become an invincible Great Emperor. Then, what was this attaining Dao about?","Return to sixth tier?","However, the fortune of heaven and earth rolled out in waves. The Nine Star Regulations materialized in front of him, clear and distinct. This could not be clearer. The fortune of heaven and earth wanted him to become the Great Emperor.","Er, did he have to lower his own status to accommodate for this?","Fine then, he would prove his identity as a Great Emperor again.","Ling Han couldn’t refuse. This was the will of heaven and earth. Even if he deliberately didn’t break through, heaven and earth wouldn’t favor a second person.","To the people of the universe, no matter what, they would have to wait for at least another ten million years, before heaven and earth would allow the birth of a new Emperor again.","Xiu, Ling Han stepped out, and entered into the galaxy. At this time, the empress, the large black dog, Brother Monkey and the others also came over.","Seeing the golden lotuses bloom beside Ling Han, they were all surprised.","Attaining Dao?","Ling Han was about to attain Dao?","However, he had clearly become an invincible Great Emperor long ago.","What the hell was this?","Everyone was speechless. Why did all kinds of strange things happen to Ling Han?","But upon further thought, it was true that Ling Han had not attained Dao in the outside world yet, and had not even participated in the battle for the fortune of the Great Emperor. He directly went to the Primitive Abyss, leaving the chance to Pu Jingtian.","Thus, it didn’t seem strange for heaven and earth to favor him now.","You see, among the Great Emperors that had not \"attained Dao\", who was more outstanding than Ling Han?","Furthermore, Ling Han was born in the Stone of Life, having a closer affinity to the heaven and earth, so it was only natural that he would be favoured by the heaven and earth.","\"Hehe, it’s not strange for anything to happen to Little Han,\" the large black dog said proudly. As someone who had watched Ling Han grow step by step, the large black dog felt a great sense of accomplishment.","\"Niu’s Ling Han is the strongest!\" Hu Niu also said delicately.","Though the others did not speak, they had tacitly agreed on this point.","Ling Han was indeed freakish, creating who knew how many impossible feats along the way.","It was also because of this that he had become the only Great Emperor that had stepped into the first tier in this Stacked Era.","However, everyone was curious. Ling Han was clearly already an invincible Great Emperor. If the heavens allowed him to attain Dao again, would that increase his strength?","Er, a Great Emperor of the zero tier?","Or would it be adding another tier to the current level of Great Emperors? The original first tier Great Emperors would be reduced to second tier, and Ling Han would be occupying the first tier all by himself?","Boom!","In the inner world of Ling Han’s body, an intense change was taking place.","The heaven and earth in his body had long since formed, and possessed the complete four elements. Stars densely covered the universe, and vitality was exuberant. However, there were also birth, aging, sickness, and death, forming a cycle.","However, he kept feeling like there was something missing.","Only at this moment did Ling Han realize that he hadn’t constructed Regulations for his internal world.","The four elements only created a world, allowing the world to possess a model of the cycle. However, to allow a world to flourish, the support of Regulations was indispensable.","Realization dawned on him. Referring to the Nine Star Regulations in front of him, he began to add Regulations to his inner world.","Life and death, Five Elements and Lightning, Light and Darkness... after adding Regulations, Ling Han discovered that the heaven and earth in his body was more orderly.","Boom, his body connected with this heaven and earth, and the four elements surged madly, as if they wanted to drown him.","Ling Han suddenly realized that he had truly become the embodiment of heaven and earth in this moment.","Attaining Dao this time, what was proven was not cultivation, but rather the Dao of heaven and earth.","After three days, the four elements in Ling Han’s body finally stopped increasing violently. Instead, they increased and depleted, forming a balance.","He suddenly opened his eyes. Golden lotuses bloomed fiercely in the heaven and earth, and there were murmurs that could not be heard clearly, as if they were blessings.","His attaining Dao had come to an end.","\"Er, should we say congratulations?\" the large black dog said with a smile.","Ling Han had long since become invincible. There didn’t seem to be anything to congratulate him on this attaining of Dao.","Adding onto invincibility, wouldn’t that still be Invincibility?","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"You’re the cheeky one!\"","When the news spread out, all those in the world who were determined to break through to the throne all beat their chests and stamped their feet.","Heavens, just how unjust was this?","Ling Han had long since attained Dao, and was more so a Great Emperor among Great Emperors. He was revered as the Heavenly Emperor Han, but the heavens actually allowed him to attain Dao once more. What was going on here!","It could only be said that the heavens were blind.","However, everyone only dared to mumble in their hearts. Who would dare say it out loud?","By now, Ling Han had already ruled over the entire galaxy, and was undoubtedly an overlord. Everyone was living under the rules that he had set. If one dared to insult the Heavenly Emperor in public, he would definitely be chopped into mush.","The entire galaxy returned to order. After three to four generations, ruthlessness was no longer the greatest instinct that was deeply ingrained in everyone’s hearts. Everything had returned to how it had once been.","However, the silence of the Star Moon Empress and the others made Ling Han feel like there would be endless troubles in the future.","Another 200 years had passed, and the heaven and earth had welcomed a golden age of cultivation. Though it was impossible for any new Emperor to attain Dao, Saints appeared endlessly. It was very possible that this was the highest point in history.","\"Boundless Great EMperor!\" A loud voice reverberated in the skies above the Four Origin Planet. \"Ling Han, come out and meet me!\"","At this moment, the Four Origin Planet had already become the Holy Land of martial arts in the entire universe. The invincible Heavenly Emperor was overseer here, and under the Heavenly Emperor, there were also a great many Great Emperors, who all held the responsibility of maintaining order in this heaven and earth.","Thus, hearing someone actually dare to directly address Ling Han by his name, a great many people were instantly enraged, and began to rebuke him in unison.","\"Who are you? How dare you directly address the Heavenly Emperor by his name!\"","\"This is treason!\"","\"Though the Heavenly Emperor is benevolent, tolerant and magnanimous, we will definitely not allow anyone to insult the Heavenly Emperor!\"","\"Which b@stard is it?\"","Weng, a terrifying Imperial Might descended, wanting to suppress and eliminate all life on the Four Origin Planet. This could even insta-kill Great Emperors, because this was the attack of an invincible Great Emperor. Even second tier was not enough.","However, the Imperial Might had just descended, and Ling Han had already moved. With a casual press of his hand, this Imperial Might had disappeared without a trace.","\"What is it?\" Ling Han asked. This person was naturally the Boundless Great Emperor.","After lying low for so long, the other party had finally appeared.","\"You’ve played for so long, and now that the heaven and earth has reached its most prosperous period, you can destroy it and play again, right?\" The Boundless Great Emperor’s voice traveled over, yet he was nowhere to be seen.","In the eyes of the Boundless Great Emperor, whether it was the previous battles or the re-establishment of order, that was all a game.","Thus, Ling Han had already played, and now it was his turn.","In his eyes, there was no hierarchy among all living things. They were all his playthings.","The Great Emperors, Saints, Cauldron Forging Tiers, Meridian Opening Tiers and so on were all the same.","Ling Han shook his head: \"Sorry, I can’t agree.\"","\"Junior, previously, seeing that you have become our fourth companion, I gave you face and allowed you to play around for a while. However, you can’t be ungrateful and monopolize these toys,\" the Boundless Great Emperor said in a baleful voice.","This person was truly temperamental.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"I’m the Heavenly Emperor, and I’m responsible for safeguarding the order of heaven and earth. If you disobey, I’ll erase you.\"","\"Hahahaha, Boundless Great Emperor.\" The Boundless Great Emperor smirked menacingly. Xiu, a divine sword suddenly tore a rip into the Void and slashed over."]},{"number":4902,"title":"Chapter 4902: Battling Boundless","paragraphs":["This strike was hundreds of times larger than Four Origin Planet. Not only could it shatter Four Origin Planet into pieces, but it could even sever more than half of the nearby galaxy.","How could the Boundless Emperor care?","The heavens were born because of them, and naturally, could also be destroyed because of their mood.","No matter how prosperous this world was, and no matter how it wilted, when heaven and earth collapsed to the extreme, nothing could escape that inherent fate.","Ling Han moved. He stretched out a hand and grabbed. Pa, that divine sword turned into millions and millions of shards. Then, the Void split apart, and swallowed these shards, which instantly disappeared without a trace.","\"Junior, you’re so helpless, so how are you going to fight against me?\" The Boundless Emperor smiled, and said, \"We can create these ants with a single thought. Is there any need to care about their lives?\"","\"Thus, we are different,\" Ling Han said darkly.","\"No, there is not much difference between us. When one has reached the height that we have, they would ultimately be the same type of person.\" The Boundless Emperor said calmly, \"You have just experienced too little. When your spiritual mark has been sealed for a few Stacked Eras, you would no longer have this kind of unnecessary mercy.\"","\"No one can say for sure what will happen in the future,\" Ling Han said calmly. \"If you disrespect life and order, I’ll kill you! In the future, if I also disregard life, someone will naturally kill me.\"","\"Hahahaha!\" The Boundless Great Emperor laughed madly, \"Junior, I am about to go crazy laughing at you. You are actually so naive?\"","\"We have grasped four key elements, and possess an undying and indestructible body. Who would be able to kill us?\"","\"You won’t be able to kill me, and even if a fifth or sixth person appears, they won’t be able to kill you either.\"","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Can’t be killed?\"","In the past, he indeed wouldn’t have been able to kill an invincible Great Emperor. However, now that he had achieved dao again, his strength had increased by who knew how many times. He was now confident that he could send an invincible Great Emperor into his heaven and earth.","In his heaven and earth, he was the only ruler, and his words were law.","\"Junior, come and stop me!\" The Boundless Great Emperor laughed loudly. He began to attack. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple divine swords slashed out, slashing towards every corner of the universe.","Being strong to this extent, he really could destroy the whole universe with a single thought.","However, Ling Han was even stronger than him. He stretched out a hand and pressed down, and all the divine swords shattered, unable to cause the slightest bit of damage.","\"Hmm?\" A hint of surprise appeared on the Boundless Great Emperor’s face.","When one had reached their height, there was actually no longer any difference in strength. They were all invincible beings. At most, there would be some difference in proficiency in grasping the four key elements. It would indeed affect battle prowess, but it was definitely impossible to decide the outcome of a battle.","However, Ling Han casually erased his attack, causing him to feel shocked.","He could not do it!","He wasn’t the only one who couldn’t do it. The Star Moon Empress and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor couldn’t do it either.","This attacker could do as he liked, but the defender had too many considerations. Furthermore, defending would always be a step slower.","With the strength of their battle prowess, could they afford such a step?","Thus, he was astonished that Ling Han had so easily blocked his attack.","\"I am coming to find you!\" Ling Han said softly. He took a step forward, and four ribbons of great dao spread out into the boundless distance. In a flash, he had arrived in front of a massive sun in a single step.","\"Are you going to come out on your own, or should I beat you out?\"","As his words fell, a figure walked out of the sun. The raging flames couldn’t even burn the corner of his clothes.","\"Junior, you’re really strange!\" the Boundless Great Emperor said. He pondered for a moment, before continuing, \"A few years ago, the person who became a Great Emperor was you, right?\"","Previously?","It had been tens of thousands of years, all right?","However, he was easily suppressed for one or two Stacked Eras, so tens of thousands of years was indeed nothing. It was more or less as long as the blink of an eye for him.","This was an insignificant detail.","\"That’s right.\" Ling Han nodded.","\"Strange, how can you attain Dao twice?\" The Boundless Emperor was extremely confused. Although he had invincible power, there was no way for the heaven and earth to allow him to attain Dao again.","\"Because I’m strong!\" Ling Han said calmly.","\"What an idiotic answer.\" The Boundless Great Emperor shook his head, and stopped thinking about this problem. In any case, he was already invincible, and could not make any further progress in cultivation.","\"You want to battle with me?\" he asked.","Ling Han shook his head and said, \"I will be the one to suppress you.\"","\"Hahaha!\" The Boundless Great Emperor laughed in spite of himself.","\"This isn’t funny at all,\" Ling Han said seriously.","The Boundless Great Emperor slowly withdrew his smile, and said, \"You’re really not a likable person!\"","\"Same to you,\" Ling Han said.","\"I have also witnessed your battle with Mysterious Clouds.\" The Boundless Great Emperor continued, \"You do indeed have a slight advantage, but it is still impossible for you to suppress us.\"","Ling Han sighed, \"Are you fighting or not? Don’t just keep spouting nonsense. This will make the spectators think that we are wasting time.\"","At a very far location, the Great Emperors were indeed watching the battle, but they did not dare to approach.","In a clash between invincible Great Emperors, even ordinary Great Emperors could not stand close enough to watch the battle. Otherwise, that would only be courting death.","The Boundless Great Emperor humphed, and said, \"Your mouth is truly restless. However, when all that’s left is your soul imprint, you won’t be able to speak at all. It won’t be long before you go crazy.\"","Ling Han did not speak further. He stretched out a hand towards the Boundless Great Emperor. Boom, his hand blotted out the skies.","\"How dare you!\" The Boundless Great Emperor sneered. ’You’re underestimating me far too much.’","He moved. Shua, a silvery river slashed over.","Peng!","The silver river crashed into the giant hand, yet it directly crumbled. It was unable to affect Ling Han in the slightest, and the giant hand was still pressing down.","The Boundless Great Emperor frowned upon seeing this. He had already known that Ling Han’s battle prowess was slightly powerful. However, after exchanging blows, he finally understood just how powerful Ling Han was.","How was this possible!","They were clearly both Great Emperors, and even if there was a gap, it was only in terms of proficiency in using the four elements, but in terms of level, they should be equal.","—At the time, it was the same when this brat battled against Mysterious Clouds. At the beginning, he was at a disadvantage because he was not proficient enough, but once he became familiar with it, he exploded with battle prowess that surpassed Mysterious Clouds.","What was going on here?","Ling Han’s palm slammed down, instantly sending the Boundless Great Emperor flying. Peng, peng, peng! The Boundless Great Emperor shattered over a hundred planets along the way, and the living beings on them were naturally all killed.","Ling Han was aloof.","Once he made up his mind, he would be decisive and resolute, and would not have any reservations.","To suppress an invincible Great Emperor, there would definitely be sacrifices. It was impossible that he would continue to leave them be just because of various concerns. That would only cause even greater damage.","\"Young, junior!\" The Boundless Great Emperor immediately charged back. His face was filled with rage. Ever since he had become an invincible Great Emperor, he had never suffered like this before.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han remained silent, and continued to attack.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Hundreds of iron fists that had four elements wrapped around them immediately materialized above the Boundless Great Emperor’s head and slammed down at him."]},{"number":4903,"title":"Chapter 4903: My heaven and earth","paragraphs":["The Boundless Great Emperor’s expression finally changed slightly.","That was because the four fundamental elements wrapped around these fists were a hundred times more powerful than him!","How was this possible?","Even for an invincible Great Emperor, there was still a limit to how far he could draw on the four elements. However, the volume of each punch from Ling Han exceeded the limit by a hundred times, and he could deliver several hundred punches in a single go. What kind of concept was that?","He did not dare to parry, fearing that he would be directly blasted into a state of severe injury. Though severe injury was nothing to him, as an elite, this was an instinctive reaction.","He rapidly retreated, but Ling Han had shot out too many fists, so he was still hit by a few fists head-on, instantly causing him to bleed madly.","’Holy f*ck! It hurts!’","The Boundless Great Emperor gritted his teeth, but there was actually a hint of enjoyment on his face.","This was pain, a real feeling. He had not experienced it for a very, very long time.","However, the element of life channelled on its own, and quickly healed the severely injured areas, as if nothing had happened.","This was the freakish trait of an invincible Great Emperor. He couldn’t be killed at all, not even severely wounded.","\"Gagaga, junior, you are indeed very strange. However, we are all undying and indestructible beings, so no matter how strong you are, so what?\" The Boundless Great Emperor laughed. Though he was mocking Ling Han, there was a sliver of defiance in his words.","When he had become an invincible Great Emperor, it was who knew how much earlier than Ling Han. Yet now, Ling Han had surpassed him in terms of battle prowess.","How could he accept this?","Ling Han ignored him, and merely shot out another punch.","Boom! Another barrage of iron fists rained down. Each punch could kill thousands of Great Emperors, yet right now, they were only targeting one.","The Boundless Great Emperor blocked these attacks, yet he was still struck a few times. Although he immediately healed, this still caused him to yell in anger.","This was an indescribable fury.","Compared to Ling Han, he was a senior, but now, the senior was being beaten down on. What face would he have left?","However, no matter what he did, he was still no match for Ling Han.","In terms of quantity of the four elements, he was really, really too far behind Ling Han. He was completely unable to face him head-on.","He did not dare believe it, and was unwilling to accept it, but the truth was so. He had been suppressed all this while, and with every attack that landed on him, he would be severely injured.","Moreover, what was even more terrifying was the fact that he was sustaining more and more punches.","What did this mean? Ling Han was familiarizing himself with this kind of battle technique, and also had a comprehensive grasp of his battle style. Only then would he be more targeted, making his attacks even more destructive.","Peng, peng, peng! Iron fists rained down.","The nearby galaxy had already been completely turned into smithereens. Countless living beings had died, but Ling Han’s expression was cold. When it was time to make a decision, he would definitely not show mercy.","The Boundless Great Emperor deliberately fled, guiding Ling Han to another galaxy. He wanted to use this to make Ling Han wary.","However, if he stopped now, it would be equivalent to those people who had died previously dying for nothing.","Ling Han didn’t show any mercy at all, and his iron fists continued to attack madly.","Five punches, ten punches, 20 punches. The Boundless Great Emperor suffered more and more punches at the same time, and his injuries also became heavier and heavier. Even if there was the element of life that could heal him immediately, this time of recovery was still being extended.","Of course, even if it was extended, it would only be a negligible instant.","Ling Han grabbed this instant, allowing him to draw the other into the heaven and earth of his inner world.","He didn’t act rashly, as he didn’t want to alert the Boundless Great Emperor. Otherwise, if this old b@stard battled to the death, he might destroy the entire universe.","Now, he still had some sense of propriety, because for him, the prosperous age that he had painstakingly created was the beginning of a good game. It had not even been played, and it had already ended. He would feel that it was a pity.","30 punches, 50 punches... The Boundless Great Emperor was severely wounded, and the surrounding galaxies were all filled with blood that he spat out. Each drop of blood possessed a terrifying destructive power, or a copious amount of the elements of life and creation.","It was about time.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly turned cold. He unleashed his full power, and after severely wounding the Boundless Emperor with a single strike, he attempted to draw him into the heaven and earth of his Inner world.","The Boundless Great Emperor instinctively resisted this pulling force. However, he was severely injured, and this was the time when his abilities were at their weakest. Furthermore, a large amount of element of life was presently healing him, so he couldn’t free himself to engage in a full-scale resistance.","Xiu! Ling Han drew him into the heaven and earth of his inner world.","In just an instant, the Boundless Great Emperor’s wounds had already healed.","His chance had passed just like that.","This was the power of Great Emperors!","However, since he had entered into his inner heaven and earth, everything would be up to Ling Han to decide.","\"What is this place?\" The Boundless Great Emperor was also astonished. He quickly discovered that this was also a colossal world, yet it wasn’t the heaven and earth that he was familiar with.","In fact, an expression of shock appeared on his face. His communication with the four elements had actually been cut off!","How was this possible!","The invincibility and indestructibility of the first tier was built on communicating with the four elements. Without the replenishment of the four elements, how much stronger could he be than an ordinary Great Emperor?","Though there was no problem of lifespan, as he had grasped the four fundamental elements, and was no longer under the control of the heaven and earth, this feeling of anxiety could not be dismissed.","\"This is my world.\" Ling Han appeared, but he was in the form of a soul.","The Boundless Great Emperorr’s eyes turned, and he immediately came to a realization. \"You actually constructed your own heaven and earth!\"","This was too inconceivable.","In fact, it wasn’t that he, the Star Moon Empress, and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor hadn’t tried this before. However, they were completely unable to do so.","Even an invincible Great Emperor like them could not do it, so there was naturally no one else in this world that could.","However, Ling Han gave him a \"surprise\".","\"How did you do it?\" the Boundless Great Emperor asked in a solemn voice.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Firstly, you have to be born from the Stone of Life.\"","He kindly told him about the Genesis World.","After hearing this, the Boundless Great Emperor frowned deeply, and a pensive expression appeared on his face.","After a long while, he shook his head and said, \"Even if you were born from the Stone of Life, this is still an impossible feat. Absolutely impossible!\"","With his understanding of the heaven and earth, he was sure that this was an impossible feat.","Because they had done similar experiments many times.","Ling Han didn’t care what he thought. He simply smiled faintly, and said, \"Alright, can you die now?","The Boundless Great Emperor pondered for a moment, and didn’t reprimand Ling Han for boasting shamelessly. After all, Ling Han was genuinely capable of killing him right now.","This was already another heaven and earth, and Ling Han was the overlord of this heaven and earth.","However, he was also confident that there were still some of the four elements in his body. He still possessed the power to destroy the heaven and earth, and was completely capable of breaking through the heaven and earth and returning to his original great world.","With this in mind, his confidence increased a hundredfold.","No matter how strong Ling Han was, he definitely could not compare to a great world.","\"Junior, you are indeed a lucky person, but to kill me, don’t even think about it!\" He shouted loudly, and shot out a punch, forcibly tearing a rip into space.","However, though there were ripples in the space, it was not damaged at all."]},{"number":4904,"title":"Chapter 4904: Killed","paragraphs":["The Boundless Great Emperor didn’t believe it, and he continued to attack. However, the result was the same. There were only ripples in space, yet there were no signs of it breaking apart at all.","This time, he was finally panicking.","In the endless years, this was the first time that he had felt this kind of emotion.","This refreshed him, and he reminisced for a moment. However, he was immediately enveloped by fear.","Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth was sturdier than he had imagined.","Could it be that it was actually comparable to the heaven and earth of the outside world?","Hiss!","He couldn’t help but think that Ling Han could easily wound him. This kind of strength was abnormal in the first place.","An invincible Great Emperor was just like them.","As for Ling Han... he was already a different heaven and earth.","It had to be admitted that this was the ultimate direction of the evolution of life. Everyone could form their own heaven and earth, and even if the heaven and earth outside collapsed, they would not be afraid. They themselves would be able to stand against it.","Would he die?","The Boundless Great Emperor’s mind was filled with thoughts. When he had first been trapped, he had once thought of death.","As a Great Emperor, they were naturally all heroes of their generation. Moreover, he had forged an invincible body, and there were only a mere four people among the dozens of Stacked Eras, which showed how outstanding he was.","However, he could not commit suicide. When he was trapped, this was an indescribable grief.","As time passed, he no longer wanted to die, and his ideas also became radical and ruthless.","If one wanted to die but couldn’t, they would definitely become crazy.","However, now that it was time to truly face death, fear rose up in the Boundless Great Emperor’s heart.","\"Break!\" He increased the power of his attack and fired out all his remaining stores of the four elements. If he couldn’t open an opening as soon as possible, he would be trapped here. Even if Ling Han didn’t kill him, he would still be trapped for several Stacked Eras, or even dozens or even hundreds of Stacked Eras like how he had been suppressed by heaven and earth before.","However, no matter how much havoc he wreaked, it was useless.","This was Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth, and now his inner heaven and earth was no longer inferior to the outer world’s heaven and earth.","Could the Boundless Great Emperor be capable of forcibly tearing apart the heaven and earth of the outside world, and venture into an unknown territory?","No.","Since that was the case, it was naturally impossible for him to tear open Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth. Furthermore, Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth was channeled by his will.","\"Are you done yet?\" Ling Han asked calmly. \"The era that belongs to you has already ended, so it’s time for you to accept your fate.\"","\"No!\" the Boundless Great Emperor roared in fury. \"I’m an invincible being! No one in the world can kill me!\"","\"Since that’s the case, I’ll allow you to completely awaken from your dream.\" Ling Han moved, and shot out a punch at the Boundless Emperor.","The Boundless Great Emperor wanted to dodge, but this heaven and earth puppet represented Ling Han’s will, so how could he dodge?","This punch directly landed in front of him, without any reason, ignoring distance.","In my world, I am naturally the one in charge.","Peng!","The Boundless Great Emperor spat out blood like mad. This time, though his injuries were still healing on their own, the speed was extremely slow.","—There was not much element of life left in his body.","Ling Han threw another punch. Pu! The Boundless Great Emperor spat out blood madly again, and he felt as if his organs were all over the place.","\"Impossible! Impossible!\" He was still exclaiming in shock, \"How could you possibly construct an inner heaven and earth? This is absolutely impossible!\"","Ling Han shook his head. Things had already come to this, and he was still unwilling to face reality?","\"Goodbye!\" he said softly, and delivered another punch with his iron fists.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After a dozen over punches, the Boundless Great Emperor broke bones and shattered flesh.","The essence of life had already been exhausted, and he could no longer heal himself in an instant. However, the strength of a Great Emperor was still present, and he was still recovering with great difficulty.","Ling Han also gritted his teeth. First tier Great Emperors were truly difficult to kill. Even second tier Great Emperors would be blasted into smithereens with a single strike from him. However, just how many times had he attacked?","And this was still within the heaven and earth of his inner world. Otherwise, in the outside world, if the vitality was not exhausted, a first tier Great Emperor could not be killed at all.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han attacked continuously, and finally, the Boundless Great Emperor couldn’t hold on any longer. His life force began to rapidly decline.","Great Emperors all had their pride, and the Boundless Emperor naturally had his pride as well. He no longer defended passively, nor did he tear open space. Instead, he launched a counterattack at Ling Han.","This was a futile attempt, but even if a Great Emperor died, he would die with honour.","After several hundred attacks, the Boundless Great Emperor finally stumbled back. His body was covered with wounds, and his vitality had already been severed.","\"This day... has finally come!\" A relieved smile appeared on the Boundless Great Emperor’s face. Being undying and indestructible was also a kind of curse for him, and now that he had finally cast off the curse, it was naturally a form of relief for him.","As his words fell, his life force had completely disappeared, but his body was still standing upright.","Ling Han sighed. After all, he was a Great Emperor, so he still had the grace that he should have.","With a swipe of his hand, the spiritual mark of the Boundless Great Emperor was also completely shattered. Even if the corpse was placed in the heaven and earth outside, it could not possibly be revived.","Ling Han’s divine sense returned. He sighed softly. The death of an invincible Great Emperor made him feel that it was a pity.","\"Ling Han!\" The large black dog and the others all gathered around him. It was clear that Ling Han had already slain the Boundless Emperor. They were all numb with excitement.","Even an invincible Great Emperor had been killed, so just how powerful was Ling Han?","Unfortunately, it was unknown where the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was cultivating in seclusion, and the Star Moon Empress had disappeared without a trace a very, very long time ago.","They could only wait.","Ling Han guarded the Four Origin Planet, and the world’s martial arts order was well-organized.","Since that was the case, Ling Han no longer interfered in worldly matters. Like the other Great Emperors, he entered into a state of complete seclusion.","He still had two missions, and that was to suppress the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor and Star Moon Empress. However, if these two people were determined to hide, then even Ling Han wouldn’t be able to find them—unless he waited until heaven and earth collapsed to a point.","Thus, Ling Han was waiting.","One million years, two hundred years... ten million years.","Time passed quietly, and Ling Han’s legend slowly became a legend. As for legends? Naturally, people would think that they were exaggerated and had been superimposed.","Meanwhile, the lifespan of Great Emperors was only 10 million years. Because Ling Han hadn’t appeared for too long, people were gradually beginning to think that the once-invincible Heavenly Emperor Han had already died.","Of course, not everyone thought so, causing a great many ambitious people to cower, not daring to act rashly.","In the blink of an eye, another ten million years had passed.","A sign appeared in heaven and earth, allowing a new Great Emperor to attain dao.","This time, everyone was sure that Ling Han had definitely died.","If the old Emperor didn’t die, how could a new Emperor be born?","The heaven and earth welcomed another golden age of cultivation. Geniuses appeared in large numbers, and everyone was engaged in a fierce contest for the position of the new Emperor.","Three thousand years later, a prodigy rose above the masses, and became the Great Emperor. He was respectfully addressed by the world as \"Shatter Wind Great Emperor\".","The heaven and earth had once again entered into an era where the Great Emperor was standing guard. Everything was in order, and the name of Heavenly Emperor Han was no longer mentioned. Everyone only knew that the current ruler of the universe was the Shatter Wind Great Emperor.","Another 4000 years passed in this manner. Boom, suddenly, an astonishing fluctuation erupted in the universe.","\"Ling Han, let’s battle again!\" A booming voice reverberated through the universe.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor appeared!"]},{"number":4905,"title":"Chapter 4905 The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor comes out of seclusion","paragraphs":["The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor had cultivated in seclusion for over 20 million years, and he had finally emerged.","Boom! He was an invincible Great Emperor, and he didn't possess the benevolence for all life in the world at all. With this shout, boundless ripples appeared in soundwaves. Wherever he passed, planets would explode, and the living beings on them would naturally be crushed into pieces.","What was going on?","The Saint in the distance wanted to run over and take a look, but after taking a look at the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, his body exploded, and he was instantly killed.","The terror of a first tier Great Emperor was inconceivable.","\"Ling Han, come out for a battle!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor shouted again. Boom! Another soundwave surged out, rushing in all directions.","Peng, peng, peng! Countless planets were naturally struck with great misfortune, exploding from the shockwaves.","Moreover, this was something that the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor hadn't done deliberately. If he had wanted to, he could have obliterated the entire galaxy in a matter of minutes.","Very far away, the Saints were all watching, not daring to approach at all.","They were all numb with shock. How had such a demonic god-like existence appeared?","This was far too terrifying. He had only unleashed a roar, yet planets had already exploded into smithereens. When the Saint approached... the Saint's body had also exploded into smithereens.","Such might, this was the might of a Great Emperor!","However, shouldn't there be only one Great Emperor? Shouldn't there only be one in each era?","Only in the ancient times, as well as the era of the last Great Emperor, did the situation of multiple Great Emperors standing side by side appear, but as the era came to an end, this kind of situation was gone forever.","However, they had now discovered the existence of what they suspected to be a Great Emperor.","\"Who is this guy?\" a Saint muttered softly.","\"It should be a Pseudo-Emperor, right?\"","\"Probably.\"","\"He has a grudge against that Ling Han, so he went into seclusion to cultivate, and rushed up to the position of Pseudo-Emperor. Now, he is going to seek out this Ling Han for revenge.\"","\"In that case, this Ling Han should be a Saint.\"","\"Is there such a Saint?\"","\"I can't remember.\"","\"It's normal that you can't remember. After all, the majority of Saints use titles, and very rarely use their names.\"","\"That's right.\"","\"However, why do I feel like the name Ling Han sounds a bit similar?\"","\"Yi, so do I!\"","All the Saints nodded, but now that a Pseudo-Emperor had appeared, that had far surpassed the level that they could deal with. They could only watch the excitement from the sidelines. Furthermore, they could not get too close, or they would die without even knowing how they had died.","Fortunately, there was a Great Emperor in this era. If a Pseudo-Emperor wanted to commit evil, there was naturally a Great Emperor to kill them.","Xiu, right at this moment, a golden path spread out, and then a lanky man walked over.","Her face was as beautiful as jade, and his aura was astonishing.","The current Great Emperor, Shatter Wind!","\"En?\" The Shatter Winds Great Emperor frowned slightly as he looked at this burly and majestic man in front of him. As a Great Emperor, he could clearly sense that there was the fluctuation of Imperial Might emanating from this man.","But the problem was that the era of Great Emperors coexisting together had long since passed. He was presently the only Great Emperor in this era, so how could another Great Emperor appear?","\"Who are you?\" the Shatter Winds Great Emperor asked calmly. As a symbol of invincibility, he was naturally calm.","\"Junior, are you seeking death?\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor said in a baleful voice. He didn't differentiate between good and evil, and everything depended on his mood.","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor couldn't help but laugh loudly, \"I am the Great—\"","Peng!","He had not even finished his words, when his whole person had already been sent flying.","\"Noisy!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor withdrew his hand, as if he had only done something negligible.","'Holy f*ck!'","The Saints in the distance all felt their hair stand on end upon seeing this. They were about to go crazy.","That was the Great Emperor, who had just attained Dao 4,000 years ago. Now, he was at the peak of his life, and his battle prowess was naturally at the peak as well.","However, it was precisely this invincible existence that had been sent flying with a single slap.","Everyone could clearly see that there was still Imperial Blood left behind in the galaxy.","Heavens! Not only had he been sent flying, but he had even severely wounded the Shatter Wind Great Emperor!","How could they not tremble in fear?","This, this, this, what kind of terrifying existence was this?","\"Sigh!\" A sigh rang out, as if it was far away, yet at the same time, seemed to be right next to one's ear.","All the Saints were confused, when they suddenly saw a figure appear. This was a young man that looked to be in his twenties, and he was holding a heavily injured man in his hand.","The person who had been wounded was none other than the Shatter Wind Great Emperor!","Yi, who was this young man? He actually just happened to catch hold of the Shatter Wind Great Emperor who had been sent flying.","\"Ling Han, you've finally appeared!\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor shouted.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and the essence of life surged out, instantly flowing all over the Shatter Wind Great Emperor's body. Instantly, the injuries on this Great Emperor's body all disappeared.","\"Wu!\" The Shatter Wind Great Emperor woke up, and couldn't help but look shocked.","What was going on here? He, a dignified Great Emperor, was actually sent flying with a single strike, and had even sustained a serious injury!","How was this possible?","He was the only Great Emperor in the world. He was synonymous with invincibility, so why had he received such a harsh attack?","Moreover, hadn't he been severely injured? How had he suddenly recovered?","He turned his gaze to Ling Han, and once again, a puzzled expression appeared on his face.","This, this was another Great Emperor!","F***, what the hell was this?","He didn't dare to believe this. Shouldn't he be the only Great Emperor in the world? Why had another two appeared? Furthermore, one of them was overwhelmingly powerful.","Ling Han withdrew his hand, and looked at the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor. \"You should have continued to cultivate in seclusion.\"","\"Hahahaha!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor laughed loudly. \"What is it? Are you threatening me?\"","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"I'm just telling the truth.\"","\"Come, let's battle again!\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor's fighting spirit soared as he said this. Boom! His aura was indescribably terrifying.","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor instantly felt suffocated. He couldn't help but widen his eyes in disbelief.","He, a dignified Great Emperor, actually couldn't even block the aura of others?","Heavens, how could he accept this!","Ling Han waved his hand, sending the Shatter Winds Great Emperor into the distance. Then, he looked at the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, saying, \"Let's go to the Primitive Abyss to battle again!\"","\"I don't have the time!\" the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor roared as he charged at Ling Han.","Boom, a punch landed. The fist hadn't even reached him, but due to the shockwave of power, all the stars in the distance exploded.","\"Greetings, Great Emperor!\" All the Saints hurriedly paid their respects to the Shatter Wind Great Emperor. Even if this Great Emperor had suddenly become much lower in status, he was still a lofty Great Emperor. How could they underestimate him?","However, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor was in no mood to pay any heed to this. He looked ahead, and an expression of shock and disbelief spread across his face.","How could there be such a powerful Great Emperor?","No, it should be said that how could a Great Emperor be as strong as this?","He was also a Great Emperor, but in front of these two, he was like a baby, completely unworthy of mentioning.","His eyes widened, as he carved the battle between the two invincible Great Emperors in his mind. He swore that after this battle, he would definitely cultivate in seclusion for a long time, and improve his strength.","\"Ling Han, Ling Han, Ling Han... Ah, I remember now!\" A Saint suddenly slapped his thigh, an excited expression on his face. He felt his scalp go numb."]},{"number":4906,"title":"Chapter 4906 Reappearance of the legend","paragraphs":["\"What have you thought of?\" the Saints hurriedly asked. Even the Shatter Wind Great Emperor showed a hint of interest.","He also wanted to know the origins of these two Great Emperors, who were so powerful that even he was trembling.","\"Ling Han, Heavenly Emperor Han!\" the Saint from before spoke word by word.","When they heard the words 'Heavenly Emperor Han', the Saints immediately came to their senses.","\"Heavenly Emperor Han!\" They all looked captivated.","The Heavenly Emperor Han was the Great Emperor of the previous era, and was also a symbol of invincibility. It was rumored that he had quelled the greatest darkness in history, and was also the leader of all the Great Emperors, leaving behind a longstanding legend.","Of course, many stories were thought to be exaggerated by later generations, but this did not hinder the greatness that the Heavenly Emperor Han possessed in everyone's hearts.","However, what everyone was more familiar with was the Heavenly Emperor Han. On the other hand, Ling Han's name was rarely mentioned.","That was because whoever mentioned the Heavenly Emperor Han would speak of him with great respect, so how would they dare to mention his name?","And now, the legend of the Heavenly Emperor Han was still known to everyone. However, Ling Han's name had disappeared in the long passage of history.","This was normal. Just like in the last era, when everyone knew about the Four Directions Great Emperor, how many people would know the actual name of this Great Emperor?","It was the same even for Ling Han. What would be more memorable about the Great Emperor was his title.","Heavenly Emperor Han!","All the Saints murmured, showing expressions of admiration.","Heavens, they had actually seen this legendary character with their own eyes!","There was no doubt. Aside from Ling Han, who else could such a powerful Great Emperor be?","This was too shocking. How many years had passed? Even a new Emperor had been born, yet Ling Han was actually still alive.","Inconceivable.","This was a living legend.","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor also heard this, and when he saw this, a powerful bitterness rose up in his heart.","As Ling Han's successor, he naturally had always been compared to Ling Han.","Though no one said it, everyone had their own measurements internally, and would make a comparison.","However, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor was unconvinced.","He had advanced into the Great Emperor Tier, so he was also very clear that grasping the Nine Star Regulations was the limit of the Great Emperor Tier. Then, as fellow Great Emperors, who would be weaker than the other?","Thus, he was sure that the majority of Ling Han's legends had been added on by later generations. How could it be so exaggerated?","However, after personally experiencing the battle prowess of the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor, he knew very well that the legends weren't false.","—He had almost been insta-killed by the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor in a single move, and what about Ling Han?","They could fight back and forth, and this was the gap between them. Furthermore, it was as far as the gulf between heaven and earth.","Aside from being stunned, he was also filled with a strong sense of confusion. Why had Ling Han and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor been able to cultivate to such a powerful level?","Boom!","In the distance, Ling Han and the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor engaged in an intense battle.","After so many years, he had always been waiting for this battle. As long as he dealt with the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor and the Star Moon Empress, the universe would truly be at peace. At that time, he could also lead a peaceful life with his wives.","To him, imperial dominance was only a fleeting scene. Furthermore, he still had his own heaven and earth. If he wanted to become an Emperor or an overlord, he could just casually create a bunch of living beings.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The battle between the two Great Emperors was incredibly intense. Ling Han unleashed his full battle prowess, and his iron fists rained down, instantly suppressing the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","\"What!\"","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor felt it was inconceivable. He had cultivated in seclusion for tens of millions of years, and he felt that his battle prowess had increased slightly. Thus, he decided to find Ling Han for a battle. However, he didn't expect that not only had Ling Han's battle prowess improved as well, but the extent of his improvement was practically terrifying.","In his first battle with Ling Han, he had been on the upper hand at first, right until Ling Han unleashed his full power. Only then did he fall into a disadvantage, but it wasn't too far off.","Now, however, once Ling Han became serious, he would only be able to parry.","Hong long long, countless iron fists attacked from all directions. They were simple and violent, but their might was overwhelming, blasting the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor to the point that he was throwing up blood like mad.","All the Saints were numb with shock. Even if they did not understand Emperor Tier battle prowess, they could tell from the comparison that Ling Han was unprecedentedly strong.","The Heavenly Emperor Han truly lived up to his reputation.","\"This was taught by Grandpa Dog.\" An incredibly smug voice rang out.","\"Who is it?!\" All the Saints were shocked. Even the Shatter Wind Great Emperor looked stunned, because he had not discovered when another person had appeared in the vicinity.","Oh, no, it wasn't a human. It was a dog.","There was a large black dog with glossy fur. However, what made people grit their teeth was the fact that this dog was actually wearing a pair of metal underpants, which dazzled with a bright light.","\"How is it? Handsome, right?\" The large black dog wagged its behind on purpose, then put on a narcissistic expression, \"It's really handsome. Grandpa Dog hasn't gotten tired of seeing it for even hundreds of millions of years!\"","F***, this was too painful to the eyes!","This was a despicable dog!","Yi, despicable, despicable dog?","\"You're the Number One Depicable Emperor of history!\" a Saint exclaimed in astonishment.","However, he immediately covered his mouth.","This was a Great Emperor, so how could he slander him?","However, the large black dog didn't mind this at all. Instead, a smug expression appeared on his face, and he said, \"As expected, Grandpa Dog is more awesome. I am recognized the moment I appeared! That's right, the person standing in front of you is the Number One Despicable Emperor of all eternity!\"","It very much liked the word 'Despicable'. This was the motto of its dog life.","This!","All the Saints felt cold sweat pour down their backs. He was indeed very despicable.","\"Friend!\" The Shatter Wind Great Emperor spoke up, his expression slightly bitter.","F***, could it be that all of the Great Emperors of the last era had not died?","He was really too pitiful, wasn't he? He had clearly attained Dao and become the strongest in this era, but people stronger than him appeared one after another. Could he, the new Great Emperor, even have the slightest feeling of superiority?","Wasn't cultivating Dao painstakingly for the sake of becoming the strongest?","Sigh, even a despicable dog could be superior to him. This was too f*******.","\"Brat, are you saying bad things about Grandpa Dog in your mind?\" The large black dog stared at the Shatter Wind Great Emperor.","\"No!\" The Shatter Wind Great Emperor naturally shook his head in denial.","\"He, with your little tricks, you think you can deceive Grandpa Dog?\" The large black dog scoffed.","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor hadn't even finished speaking, when he saw another figure appear.","\"Old Black, you're scaring people again!\" The little azure dragon appeared, followed by Brother Monkey, the Battle Saint Emperor, the Great Emperor Wu Ya, and so on. Practically all the Great Emperors of the previous era appeared.","This was a crucial battle.","There were so many Great Emperors!","All the Saints were about to pass out. With such Imperial Might permeating through the air, the pressure on them increased greatly.","Meanwhile, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor wasn't feeling too good either. The might of the Great Emperors here were all stronger than him, so he was definitely a junior.","How was this possible?","So much time had already passed, so why hadn't these Great Emperors died yet?","In the previous era, there were many Great Emperors, and they were incomparably glorious. Could it be that their glory would continue in this era?","Heavens, he was such a pitiful Great Emperor!","Only the large black dog and the little azure dragon were rivals. They would always bicker, and the other Great Emperors all wore solemn expressions as they watched the fierce battle in the distance. They didn't relax in the slightest.","\"Though Ling Han has the absolute upper hand, Mysterious Clouds is also an existence that has grasped the four elements. As long as he is given the slightest bit of chance, it is absolutely impossible to kill him.\"","\"He must... kill him with a single strike!\""]},{"number":4907,"title":"Chapter 4907: Killing another","paragraphs":["Hearing the words of the Great Emperors, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor was completely baffled.","Four key elements?","And... to kill a Great Emperor?","Heavens, who could do the commentating for him?","\"Seniors!\" he greeted. \"Then who exactly is the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor?\"","\"That’s a long story,\" the large black dog immediately said. \"Do you want to hear it? Are you sure you want to hear it?\"","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor wiped away the cold sweat on his forehead. What was wrong with this dog?!","\"Please go ahead, Senior Dog,\" he said very modestly. These Great Emperors all seemed to have strength that could crush him. He could still tell this fact.","If it were anyone else, they would definitely fly into a rage if they were called a \"dog\", regardless of whether they were addressed as \"Senior\" or not.","However, the large black dog was not anyone else. He very much enjoyed this form of address, and showed a hint of satisfaction. He even said smilingly, \"You can be taught, you really can be taught!\"","’Tell me then!’","The Shatter Wind Great Emperor didn’t dare to rush him, so he could only smile awkwardly on the sidelines.","Thankfully, the large black dog’s despicable nature was mostly reserved for his enemies. Thus, he soon began to talk.","Hearing the large black dog’s words, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor looked stunned.","As it turned out, grasping Regulations was only the beginning for a Great Emperor. The four main elements were the true rise of a Great Emperor.","He secretly decided that when this battle was over, and he had cultivated Regulations to consummate level, he would go to Primitive Abyss. He had to cultivate one of the elements, and advance into the fourth tier.","Because he understood the sequence of events, when he looked at the battle in the distance this time, he couldn’t help but feel a hint of worry.","What if... Ling Han wasn’t able to kill the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor?","This kind of Great Emperor had an undying body, and no matter how serious his injuries were, he would be able to recover with a single thought. Furthermore, if this kind of existence was completely focused on fleeing and hiding, even Ling Han would not be able to find him.","Then, if the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor vented his anger on the universe, he could completely destroy this world.","Thus, Ling Han definitely had to succeed!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han’s rain of iron fists became denser and denser, finally breaking through a critical point, causing the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s recovery speed to slightly slow down. Instantly, Ling Han took the chance, opening his inner heaven and earth to draw in the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was presently healing his injuries, his power dispersed, and under severe injury, his battle prowess definitely dropped drastically. Instantly, he was sucked into the heaven and earth of Ling Han’s body.","\"What is this place?\" Like the Boundless Great Emperor, he revealed an incredibly stunned expression.","His communication with the four elements... had been cut off!","In his eyes, this was inconceivable. After cultivating the four elements, one could maintain communication with the four elements at all times. How could there possibly be an interruption?","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Boundless was killed by me here.\"","\"Huh? Boundless is dead?\" The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor faltered for a moment before shaking his head and saying, \"So what if he’s dead? I’ve never liked this person anyway.\"","This reaction!","Seeing Ling Han’s startled expression, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor couldn’t help but laugh loudly. \"Do you think I’m stupid? You can kill Boundless, so you can naturally kill me as well.\"","\"I do indeed have such intentions.\" Ling Han nodded.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor shook his head, and said, \"After living for so long, I don’t care about life or death anymore. However, I’m curious... Is this the heaven and earth you have created?\"","\"That’s right,\" Ling Han admitted. After entering this place, he would be the one in charge.","\"How is that possible?\" A puzzled expression appeared on the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor’s face, and he said, \"The three of us have also studied this before. It’s impossible.\"","\"I came from the Stone of Life, and from the Primitive Abyss. Of course, it’s possible,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor pondered for a moment before shaking his head and saying, \"Impossible! Even if you were nurtured by the Stone of Life, this is still an impossible feat.\"","Yi, his reaction was the same as that of the Boundless Great Emperor. He was certain that even the Stone of Life wouldn’t be able to nurture a freak like him.","\"However, the fact that I’m standing here is clear proof,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was still pondering over this. Indeed, Ling Han had truly constructed a new heaven and earth, allowing the impossible to become reality. However, he truly couldn’t understand this. After so many Stacked Eras, how many experiments had they done?","Ling Han didn’t speak any more nonsense. With a thought, a divine sword slashed towards the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","In this internal heaven and earth, Ling Han was the absolute ruler. No matter how powerful the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was, he would ultimately be killed.","However, a Great Emperor was a Great Emperor, after all. The Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor was clearly already at the end of his rope, yet showed no signs of begging for mercy. In fact, he did not even bother to temporarily feign civility, and had no intention of even escaping.","He was going to battle, right until the last drop of blood flowed out.","Ling Han had to admit that though Boundless and Mysterious Clouds were ruthless, their moral character was still present.","Those who could become Great Emperors were all proud and unyielding.","Oh, the prerequisite was that this Great Emperor was one that had cultivated on his own, and not something like the old Divine Beast.","Too bad, this kind of Great Emperor was undying and indestructible. He had lived for too long, and was trapped for too long, and forcibly turned into a maniac. He posed a threat to all life, and had no choice but to be eliminated.","Ling Han retreated out of the inner heaven and earth, and returned to his own mind.","\"Dealt with another one.\" The large black dog approached, whistling, \"There’s still one more to go, and we’ll be able to remove our armor and return to the fields, and go back to civilian life.\"","The little azure dragon looked at the iron underwear on the large black dog’s body and shook its head, saying, \"As Grandpa Dragon sees it, you won’t be able to remove your armor for the rest of your life.\"","The large black dog glared at him, \"Are you coveting Grandpa Dog’s treasure?\"","\"Get lost!\" The little azure dragon kicked him.","Meanwhile, the Shatter Winds Great Emperor arrived in front of Ling Han. He bowed first, and said, \"Junior pays respects to Heavenly Emperor Han! Thank you for helping me, Heavenly Emperor Han.\"","If Ling Han hadn’t been here, it was possible that he would have died from his severe wounds.","Ling Han raised his hand, \"No need for such formalities.\"","In the distance, those Saints were also rushing over. This was the Heavenly Emperor Han. Thus, they naturally had to pay their respects and admire the graceful bearing of the Great Emperor.","However, right at this moment, an incredibly powerful aura swept over, instantly causing those Saints to tremble and prostrate in the galaxy.","A breathtakingly beautiful figure appeared, standing proudly in the galaxy, domineering yet enchanting.","The Star Moon Empress had finally appeared.","Ling Han found this strange. Why had the last invincible Great Emperor appeared at this time? Why hadn’t she appeared earlier?","If it had been earlier, she might have been able to save the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","—With the two invincible Great Emperors \"joining forces, one inside and the other outside\", Ling Han really might not be able to continue imprisoning the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor.","The atmosphere instantly became tense again.","Another invincible Great Emperor appeared. This was an existence that could destroy the universe at the slightest provocation.","Ling Han looked at Star Moon Empress, and Star Moon Empress also gazed at him, as if she was deeply in love with him.","However, everyone knew that once the two sides started fighting, it would be world-destroying.","\"Ling Han, you have not disappointed me.\" Star Moon Empress smiled beautifully.","What was the meaning of this?","Ling Han was unconcerned. Previously, he had been worrying. If the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor and the Star Moon Empress did not appear all this while, he would not be able to deal with these two great calamities either. But now, these two people had actually appeared, one after the other.","It was time to end the turmoil eternally."]},{"number":4908,"title":"Chapter 4908: Star Moon Empress","paragraphs":["\"Come battle!\" Star Moon Empress took a step, and instantly left.","Ling Han hurriedly followed behind her. He naturally wouldn’t let her escape.","The Star Moon Empress actually went to the Primitive Abyss, and it was the Imperial Island at that.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t hesitate. He also stepped onto the Imperial Island.","However, the large black dog and the others weren’t as quick. They were blocked by the sea of death, so they needed to slowly make their way over.","\"Ling Han, let’s go all out in battle here!\" the Star Moon Empress shouted. She was already charging toward Ling Han.","Ling Han’s expression became serious.","The Star Moon Empress had clearly seen the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor die by his hand, yet she still dared to appear for a battle. It was clear that she was extremely confident.","This was the first invincible Great Emperor in the world, so he couldn’t be careless.","Of course, Ling Han had already formed his own heaven and earth. He was the true undying and indestructible one. Thus, what he couldn’t be careless about was preventing Star Moon Empress from having the chance to escape.","Boom!","The two of them immediately began a fierce battle.","This was the Primitive Abyss, and the Imperial Island at that. The structure of heaven and earth was incredibly sturdy, and even if the two invincible Great Emperors were exchanging blows, it only caused cracks to appear on the ground, and did not shatter instantaneously.","However, if this battle continued, it was possible that Imperial Island would be destroyed as well.","Fight, fight, fight!","Ling Han unleashed his full battle prowess, unleashing a furious barrage of attacks at Star Moon Empress.","The Empress was unafraid, and countered with her terrifying battle prowess.","In terms of quantity of the four elements, she was far inferior to Ling Han. However, in terms of proficiency in using them, she was superior.","This was the first invincible Great Emperor in history, so her use of the four elements had naturally reached a state of perfection. Even the combined efforts of the Boundless Great Emperor and Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor couldn’t compare to her.","However, the problem was that Ling Han’s advantage in numbers was far too great, reaching the point where he could disperse all techniques with his own strength.","No matter how good your technique was, it was useless. In a head-on confrontation, they were not on the same level at all.","Ling Han attacked her madly, while the Star Moon Empress dodged left and right. If she took a blow head-on, she would definitely be severely injured.","Of course, she wasn’t afraid of severe wounds either. This was the Imperial Island, which was filled with element of life in the first place, so it could immediately heal her.","In this place, the undying and indestructible nature of a first tier Great Emperor had been greatly strengthened.","Ling Han had to admit that the older one was, the more knowledgeable one would be. It was less likely for him to suppress this Empress if they battled here.","However, he had to battle.","Fighting here would have the least impact on the outside world. Otherwise, if they fought in the universe, who knew what kind of terrifying casualties would be caused.","The Star Moon Empress displayed the graceful bearing of an invincible Great Emperor. She was clearly at an absolute disadvantage in terms of power, but through the perfect use of the four elements, she was not always on the back foot, but could still organize a decent counterattack, causing Ling Han to bleed a little.","This was a tug-of-war, and the battle was incredibly difficult.","Several years later, the large black dog, the Great Emperor Wu Ya and even the empress and the others all rushed over.","That was because this would be the final battle.","If they could destroy the Star Moon Empress, the universe would enjoy eternal peace. Otherwise, an invincible Great Emperor might cause trouble at any time. Just the thought of it was enough to make one’s scalp go numb.","A thousand years, ten thousand years, a hundred thousand years!","This battle was incredibly drawn out. When the battle began on the Imperial Island, the battle prowess of the two Great Emperors had both been boosted, especially the Star Moon Empress. It was equivalent that she too possessed an endless supply of the four elements.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was the one who had formed his own heaven and earth. In truth, there was already no need for him to draw on the four fundamental elements from the outside world. Thus, when they battled on the Imperial Island, though he also had some battle prowess boosted, it was practically negligible.","Although they had battled for 100,000 years, the two of them were in the same state as when they had started fighting.","Indestructible and undying, their energy was also eternally abundant.","Just how long would this battle continue for?","However, right at this moment, the Star Moon Empress actually revealed a weakness!","This was a very big flaw, and with her strength, this was a super mistake that she should not have made.","Could it be that after a long battle, she had developed a feeling of boredom, and that was why she had made such a low-level mistake?","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t miss this opportunity. He immediately launched a series of powerful attacks, causing the Star Moon Empress to violently vomit blood and suffer severe wounds.","Even if this place was filled with the element of life, it would still take ten thousandth of a heartbeat to heal her injuries, but for Ling Han, this little bit of time was enough.","He spread out his inner heaven and earth. Xiu, he had taken in the Star Moon Empress.","\"This is... the heaven and earth that has been constructed!\" After the Star Moon Empress entered into Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth, she did not show the slightest bit of shock. Instead, she looked him up and down curiously, as if this had satisfied a great wish of hers.","Ling Han was astonished. It should be known that after the two Great Emperors, Boundless and Mysterious Clouds, entered this place, they immediately exclaimed in shock and even called out ’impossible’.","When it came to Star Moon Empress, it became a kind of admiration, as if... she was admiring her own work.","\"Don’t you think that this is impossible?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Why would it be impossible?\" Star Moon Empress countered with a smile.","This!","A strange feeling rose up in Ling Han’s heart. It was as if all of this was under the other’s control, but the problem was this was his heaven and earth.","In his heaven and earth, even an invincible Great Emperor could only bow down in submission.","\"Ha!\" the Empress shouted, and once again charged towards Ling Han.","However, in Ling Han’s heaven and earth, who could hurt him?","Ling Han attacked randomly, and Star Moon Empress was blasted quite badly. Soon, blood dyed her whole body. Without the replenishment of the element of life, it was only a matter of time before she died in battle.","However, this Empress was not angry, nor was she dissatisfied. She was only calm.","This made Ling Han feel even stranger. However, no matter how strange it was, he couldn’t stop.","Of the three great calamities, only one was left. He had to deal with her.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Under Ling Han’s full-power attack, the Empress was severely injured, and her vitality was severely depleted. Death was close at hand.","\"Finally... freed!\" Star Moon Empress showed a hint of joy, her expression calm, without the slightest fear of facing death.","Ling Han frowned, and said, \"You’ve come to seek death!\"","No wonder she had walked out even though she had clearly seen the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor being killed. It wasn’t because she believed that she could defeat Ling Han, but rather because she wanted to seek death.","The Star Moon Empress cracked a smile. Her blood was bright red, and she was both beautiful and poignant.","\"For this day, I’ve set up arrangements for a total of seven Stacked Eras, and I’ve finally succeeded.\"","F***!","Ling Han hurriedly said, \"Hey, hey, hey, tell me clearly!\"","\"Did Mysterious Clouds and Boundless tell you that this inner heaven and earth can’t be constructed?\" Star Moon Empress countered.","\"Indeed,\" Ling Han said with a nod.","The Star Moon Empress nodded, and said, \"Ordinarily speaking, this indeed can’t be constructed! However...\" She wore a haughty expression, and she continued, \"It’ll be different if I participate!\"","\"What do you mean!\" Ling Han asked, suddenly feeling a headache coming on.","\"Several Stacked Eras ago, I already didn’t want to live anymore. However, after cultivating to this level, I can’t die even if I want to,\" the empress said calmly. \"Since I can’t kill myself, I’ll nurture someone who can.\"","F*ck!"]},{"number":4909,"title":"Chapter 4909: The True Number One","paragraphs":["Even Ling Han couldn’t help but inhale sharply.","He had only heard of some people nurturing disciples, while the more freakish ones were nurturing future wives and husbands. However, he had never heard of anyone nurturing enemies to kill them.","However, in the case of the Star Moon Empress, it was understandable.","She was undying and indestructible, and even if she wanted to commit suicide, she could not.","Thus, she could only nurture an even stronger person to help her end her life.","It was logical, but Ling Han felt extremely frustrated.","\"I’m that person?\" Ling Han asked in a solemn voice.","At first, he had not believed it, but after he had dragged Boundless and Mysterious Clouds into the inner heaven and earth, that kind of shock and disbelief could not be faked. They were really shocked, and really thought that no one could form the inner heaven and earth.","These two people were qualified to make such a judgement, because they were invincible Great Emperors, and who knew how many Stacked Eras they had stayed on this cultivation level for.","Thus, in terms of understanding of the four main elements, as well as the heaven and earth, they were definitely far superior to Ling Han.","Thus, they refused to believe that Ling Han could construct heaven and earth within his inner world, even though they were inside Ling Han’s inner world.","Star Moon Empress broke into a smile, \"That’s right!\"","She paused for a moment, then continued, \"I tried countless times, and finally, there was one time that I successfully preserved a stone seed at the end of a Stacked Era. It was wrapped by my spiritual mark, and endured the change of heaven and earth.\"","\"Repeating Stacked Era after Stacked Era, I nurtured it with the four elements of my body, allowing this stone seed to possess the ability to manifest heaven and earth.\"","\"Then, in this Stacked Era, I released it.\"","\"You have not disappointed me. You have walked out of the stone seed, and constructed your own heaven and earth!\"","Ling Han gritted his teeth. In other words, the old Divine Beast had been released by these three people, and the release of the Stone of Life was also the handiwork of this character. She had been imperceptibly influencing the Great Emperors.","Why did the Great Emperors not sense anything?","This was not impossible. Just look at how the old Divine Beast was acting. He only knew to excavate the caves of the four elements, but if he really had to explain the reason, he was actually a little muddled. He only had a feeling that he wanted to do so, and it became the motivation that supported him, and he pursued this goal for hundreds of billions of years.","All the Great Emperors had been living on the Imperial Island all this while, so it was really too easy for them to be influenced unknowingly. After all, the Star Moon Empress was a first tier existence.","Additionally, when the three invincible Great Emperors had appeared, the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor had initially wanted to kill him. However, he had been stopped by the Star Moon Empress.","—A Great Emperor, who was indifferent to all life in the world, would actually deliberately dissuade him?","This was originally a very small and unreasonable action, but it could also be understood as the Star Moon Empress being in a good mood because she had just appeared, and that was why she had stopped the Mysterious Clouds Great Emperor from attacking.","And now, this new explanation was even more logical.","Ling Han was the person that Star Moon Empress had painstakingly nurtured to kill her, so how could she allow him to die first?","\"Since you have such thoughts, it means that you still have the heart to do good. Why do you want to bring calamity to the world?\" Ling Han asked solemnly.","\"Hahahaha!\" The Star Moon Empress laughed madly, \"No, no, no, after being trapped for so many years, I have long since lost all feelings. I am merely tired of living like this!\"","\"To us, so what if it is all the living beings in the world? So what if it is all the living beings in the universe? It is just a cycle of repeated destruction. Whether it is damaged or not, whether it is destroyed or not, there is no difference in the final fate.\"","\"Rather than that, wouldn’t it be more meaningful to be our playthings to help us pass some time?\"","Ling Han shook his head. At first, he still had a sliver of pity and wanted to spare the Star Moon Empress, but now, his killing intent was firm again.","\"Since that is the case, I will send you on your way to the afterlife!\" he said word by word.","\"Young man, don’t underestimate your enemy!\" Star Moon Empress said haughtily. \"I was the first person in the world to grasp the four fundamental elements. In fact, Mysterious Clouds and Boundless were able to reach this level thanks to my secret guidance. If you want to kill me... it won’t be so easy!\"","\"Though I have nurtured you to kill me... I will not stretch out my neck and wait to be beheaded either. You have to have absolute strength to be able to do that!\"","Boom!","The Star Moon Empress launched a counterattack, with astonishing power surging out of her body. The four elements appeared, solidifying and fusing together to form a heavenly spear.","The Empress brandished her spear, and swept it towards Ling Han.","Ordinarily, weapons that were suitable for women were short swords, daggers, scimitars, and so on. However, the Empress wielded a spear, and her domineering aura was unparalleled, possessing an indescribable beauty.","Ling Han clenched his hand into a fist, and shot out a punch.","Peng!","Fist and spear clashed, and blood actually spurted from Ling Han’s fist.","He was a soul now, so it naturally wasn’t true blood. Instead, it was a sliver of damage to his soul.","So powerful!","Ling Han couldn’t help but nod. As expected of the Star Moon Empress, the invincible Great Emperor that had lived the longest. If it was Mysterious Clouds and Boundless, after they entered into the heaven and earth of the inner world, they would be completely no match for Ling Han.","However, the weapon that the Star Moon Empress had manifested with the four elements could wound him. This was indeed extraordinary.","However, this was Ling Han’s inner heaven and earth!","Boom!","Ling Han swung his fist again and again. Similarly, there were four elements entwined around his fist, and it was as if a black film had been plated on the surface of his fist, exuding a cold metallic texture.","The Empress brandished her spear and clashed. Peng, the four elements instantly clashed fiercely.","Obviously, Ling Han had the upper hand in terms of quantity of the four elements. In the exchange of a single blow, the spear was instantly shattered, and the iron fist penetrated deeply.","\"Plunder!\" the empress shouted. She forcefully extracted the four fundamental elements from Ling Han’s heaven and earth, transforming them into a divine sword that charged at Ling Han.","Peng!","The heavenly sword shattered, but cracks also appeared on Ling Han’s iron fist. After exchanging another blow with the empress, the four elements that were wrapped around it were completely dispersed.","F***!","Even with Ling Han’s composure, he was still stunned internally. The Star Moon Empress was actually able to forcibly plunder the four elements inside his body, as if she was still in the outside world.","This was truly an unparalleled prodigy. Compared to her, Mysterious Clouds and Boundless were clearly much inferior.","If it was not for the fact that the first tier was the finishing line, he believed that this empress would still be able to leave others behind in her dust, and reach a height that others could not even look up to.","Furthermore, she had also said that the fact that Boundless and Mysterious Clouds had been able to grasp the four key elements was also thanks to her guidance.","—Without her guidance, there would be no new invincible Great Emperor among these 34 Stacked Eras.","As for Ling Han?","The Stone of Life was nurtured by her invincible martial intent, and she had already branded it with her mark from the very beginning.","Hence, this Empress was the number one person throughout the innumerable Stacked Eras!","You see, it was possible that there were already over a hundred, or even several hundred, Stacked Eras in which heaven and earth had evolved, but it was only in the thirty-fourth Stacked Era that an invincible Great Emperor like her appeared.","Afterward, it was because of her that three invincible Great Emperors had appeared.","Now, though Ling Han was stronger, he had to admit that in terms of natural talent in cultivation, he was really inferior to this person."]},{"number":4910,"title":"Chapter 4910: A battle at the end of the line","paragraphs":["Ling Han was indeed stronger than the Star Moon Empress now, but this strength was based on the fact that the Star Moon Empress had nurtured him for a few Stacked Eras..","Standing on the shoulder of a giant, and added with his similarly outstanding natural talent, how could he not surpass his predecessors?","In truth, it was the Empress’s disadvantage that she was the first person to become an invincible Great Emperor. Otherwise, if there was someone to help her, she would definitely be able to construct her own heaven and earth.","Even though they were enemies, Ling Han was still filled with admiration.","\"If you don’t work hard, you won’t be able to kill me!\" the Star Moon Empress said calmly. \"I’ll give you one year. If you can’t kill me within one year, I’ll charge out of here and destroy this heaven and earth!\"","She said the last few words very casually, as if it would not be difficult for her to break through and escape.","This was something that even Boundless and Mysterious Clouds couldn’t do, but Ling Han was very sure that this Empress wasn’t exaggerating.","This person’s natural talent in cultivation was truly indescribably strong.","Merely from the fact that she could forcibly plunder the four elements inside Ling Han’s body, it was clear that even if she was limited by the upper limit of heaven and earth, she could still do what others could not.","With a soft exclamation, the Empress charged towards Ling Han. With a light wave of her slender hand, at least a few hundred Heavenly Swords appeared, shooting towards Ling Han.","Each Heavenly Sword was made up of four elements, and was filled with destructive power.","In Ling Han’s heaven and earth, of course, nothing could hurt him — as long as he willed it.","However, the Empress had forcefully snatched his four fundamental elements and turned them into weapons to attack him. This had become a situation that could not be resolved, and could only be repeated endlessly.","How was he supposed to kill her?","To say nothing of one year, he wouldn’t be able to do it even if it was 100 million years or a Stacked Era.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. This was the first time he had been so helpless.","Boundless and Mysterious Clouds were both invincible Great Emperors, but the moment they entered into the heaven and earth of his inner world, they had already confirmed the time of their deaths, but in the case of this Empress, that was completely not the case.","This was undoubtedly the most powerful Great Emperor.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The Empress’s counterattack became stronger and stronger. She plundered the four elements and turned them into her weapon, using Ling Han’s own power to attack his own defence. She herself was completely unaffected, as if she had transcended.","One month, two months, three months... Time flew by, yet Ling Han still couldn’t find a countermeasure.","He was already in his strongest state, and he had even trapped the Star Moon Empress in the heaven and earth of his innver world. If he still couldn’t kill her, what else could he do?","\"Ling Han, you disappoint me!\" the Empress said with a shake of her head. \"There are still nine months. If you still can’t kill me, I won’t play with you anymore!\"","There was a subtle change in her expression, and she was exuding a murderous aura.","This kind of her had a bit of austerity, but it did not decrease her beauty in the slightest. Instead, she had an additional air of martial arts and dominance, which would make others submit even more.","Boom!","The Empress delivered a series of strikes with both hands. The four fundamental elements were freely manifested in her hands, and she attacked Ling Han in a myriad of ways.","Ling Han took a deep breath. If this continued, it was destined to be an irresolvable cycle.","He definitely wouldn’t allow the Star Moon Empress to go out and destroy this world. Thus, he definitely had to suppress her.","Then, the first step would be to sever her communication with the four elements.","—At first, he had thought that it would be fine once he entered into the heaven and earth of his inner world, but now, he discovered that this empress was practically ten times stronger than even Boundless and Mysterious Clouds added together, oh no, a hundred times stronger!","However, he still had to think of some way to solve this problem. If this problem was not resolved, there was no need to mention anything else.","Ling Han pondered as he fought. Finally, he showed a hint of ruthlessness.","He was going to give it his all!","With a soft exclamation, his whole person actually began to solidify.","’Hmm?’","He was originally a spiritual body, but because this was the heaven and earth of his inner world, a single thought from him was equivalent to the highest level of heaven and earth’s will. Thus, there was absolutely no difference whether he had a physical body or not.","Why had he suddenly materialized?","The Empress was also slightly taken aback. Then, a look of understanding appeared on her face, \"You used yourself as a prison, and locked the four elements, forcibly imprisoning them.\"","Pa, pa, pa! She clapped her hands, and said, \"Not bad, not bad. This is a very good idea. I indeed can’t extract any more of the four elements.\"","\"However!\" The Empress revealed a baleful expression, \"That goes for you too!\"","Ling Han used the four elements to form his body, and his original body was a prison, locking in the four elements. This determined that even Ling Han himself could not possibly extract more of the four elements. Once they were used up, they would be gone.","Hence, this became a battle to the death.","Without the replenishment of the four elements, an invincible Great Emperor would also die.","Ling Han had already made up his mind. He smiled slightly, \"You have the heart to die, and I too have the determination to fight to the death!\"","\"Good!\" The Empress laughed loudly, \"These words are finally a little domineering!\"","With a soft exclamation, she once again charged towards Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two Great Emperors battled fiercely. This time, it was really a close-combat battle after they ran out of ammunition. Neither of them had the supplies of the four elements. In that case, they had to be extremely careful. Not only did they have to decrease the expenditure of the four elements, they also had to be careful not to sustain heavy injuries, or even light injuries.","Because one would have to expend the element of life to recover from injuries, it would have an effect on battle prowess.","\"You are contending with me in the use of the four elements?\" The Empress shook her head, \"You overestimate yourself!\"","When it came to the use of the four elements, she was undoubtedly number one.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","\"Since you can’t kill me, I’ll kill you and destroy this world!\" The Empress’s killing intent became even more intense.","Being trapped for a few Stacked Eras at the drop of a hat, even the most sane person would go crazy. Even this supreme Empress was no exception.","—I have spent so much effort to nurture you, yet you are still unable to kill me?","’Then go die!’","The Empress was furious, and her battle prowess increased madly.","Ling Han faced her calmly. Since he had sealed himself off, he was already prepared.","A Great Emperor would definitely not be affected by any factor once he had developed some kind of self-awareness.","’Die!’","He clashed fiercely with the Empress, greatly exhausting the latter’s power of elements.","Six months, nine months.","When it was the twelfth month, even if these two people were both invincible Great Emperors, they were now at the end of their rope.","In the past eleven months, they had both been battling fiercely, and were continuously injured. Thus, they had expended a great amount of the four elements.","At this moment, they couldn’t fight any longer.","At first, the Empress had a head of raven black hair, but now, because she had expended too much energy, it had completely turned into silver silk. This gave her an unusual grace.","Unfortunately, Ling Han had absolutely no intention of admiring her beauty. To him, this was an incredibly difficult battle.","Now, they had all reached the end of their line, and both of them were only left with a single breath. It would depend on who could persist more.","\"Die!\" The Empress moved, her sword slashing out, still as domineering as before.","Ling Han faced this attack head-on, not backing down in the slightest.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","They exchanged blows fiercely. Both knew that the battle was already drawing to a close, and would end with the death of one of them."]},{"number":4911,"title":"Chapter 4911: Curtains drop","paragraphs":["Fight, fight, fight. The two of them were only left with their last breath.","The Empress showed an expression of pride, and stretched out a finger to point at Ling Han, \"Plunder!\"","She wanted to snatch the last of the four elements from Ling Han. Though there was only a little bit of the four elements left on both sides, as long as she could snatch it, then there would be no doubt about the outcome.","She felt that it was a pity that she hadn’t been able to attain death even though she had schemed for so long.","—Just wait helplessly for death?","Heh, how could someone like her do such a thing? She naturally had her own pride. Even if she died, she would die in battle.","’I’ve already given you the best conditions, yet you’re still unable to kill me. Do you still want me to go easy on you?’","Of course not. Dying in the hands of such a person would be a humiliation!","So, go die!","However, when the Empress stretched out her hand, Ling Han also stretched out his hand, \"Plunder!\"","What!","The Empress faltered upon hearing this. She actually hadn’t been able to extract the four elements!","What was going on?","In an instant, she came to a realization, and couldn’t help but laugh loudly. \"Not bad, not bad. Your learning ability is really strong. You’ve already grasped the essence of Plunder.\"","Just now, it was Ling Han who had also used Plunder, cancelling out her ability.","However, she was immediately taken aback.","\"Since you have already grasped the ability to plunder, why have you still trapped yourself here?\" The Empress was slightly surprised.","That was because Ling Han could completely trap her in the heaven and earth inside his inner world like how he had done at the very beginning, and use Plunder to resist her ability to Plunder. Then, she would not have the four main elements to replenish herself, but Ling Han could.","In this way, was there any doubt about the outcome of the battle?","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Firstly, I only comprehended this not too long ago. Secondly, I think that this kind of battle is only fair!\"","It could be said that he had only managed to reach this level because of the Star Moon Empress. From the very beginning, the Empress had wanted to make him stronger than herself, and only then would it be possible for him to kill an invincible existence like her.","But the Empress had her pride, and did Ling Han not?","Hence, even if he had grasped the ability to plunder, he did not place himself in a position of definite victory. Instead, he was fighting a fair battle with the Empress.","This was Ling Han’s Dao Heart.","\"Hahahaha!\" The Empress laughed loudly, then revealed an expression of pride, \"All right, as expected of the one I have nurtured myself. Then let us battle!\"","Boom!","She gathered the last of her power, and charged towards Ling Han.","Peng, peng, peng! The two of them exchanged blows, and after every blow, massive wounds were left behind on their bodies.","They didn’t pay any heed to this. Instead, they focused all of their power on their attacks.","As proud as a Great Emperor was, how could they possibly adopt a defensive stance?","They firmly believed that their attacks were the strongest in the world.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After exchanging a few more blows, their bodies were already completely dyed red with blood, covered with fist-sized holes that had completely penetrated through their bodies.","At this time, they no longer had any more element of life to replenish themselves.","\"The last move!\" the Empress said balefully. After exchanging another blow, with their present injuries, they would definitely not be able to withstand it.","That applied to both of them.","Furthermore, with their strength, neither side would be able to dodge this move. Thus, the greatest possibility was that they would die together.","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. Since that was the case, then so be it.","’Come!’","He took the initiative to attack, launching an attack at the Empress.","\"Die!\" The Empress also let out a battle cry, and charged towards Ling Han.","The two of them chose to attack, striking each other’s vital points.","It was over!","Pu!","Ling Han’s fist landed on the Empress’s chest. Under the impact of the terrifying power, it instantly covered the Empress’s body, and there was already no trace of power left in the Empress’s body, so how could she possibly resist?","Her body was glowing everywhere, as if an exquisite piece of porcelain had been shattered, and every crack was spread out chaotically.","However, the Empress’s expression instantly returned to normal. She closed her eyes in satisfaction, and her body began to shatter into pieces.","The invincible Empress had finally died.","Yet Ling Han was surprised, because the Empress’s fist had missed, and stopped right before his left forehead.","This was not a low-level error, but rather deliberate on the Empress’s part.","In this final attack, it should have been the two of them perishing together, but the Empress chose to deliberately miss, so that Ling Han could live on.","At this moment, Ling Han didn’t know what he was feeling.","\"Why?\" he asked.","\"In my whole life, what need is there for others to yield to me, Star Moon?\" The Empress released her final words. Then, her body completely shattered, turning into countless specks of light, that scattered all over Ling Han’s inner world.","Ling Han was stunned. The Empress... was still so proud!","With a thought, the seal immediately dissipated. Endless element of Life surged out, and his injuries immediately healed.","In front of him was the spiritual mark of the Empress, which was presently floating.","As long as it was released, or in fact, as long as Ling Han was willing to use the element of Life to replenish it, this supremely peerless Empress would be able to come back to life.","With such supreme talent, it was really a pity that she had died.","However, Ling Han only hesitated slightly, then stretched out a hand. Pa, the power of the four elements blasted out, completely shattering this soul imprint.","What the Empress wanted was to be freed. Otherwise, if she did not want to die, there was absolutely no way she could be dragged into his inner heaven and earth.","Thus, respecting the Empress’s choice was the greatest respect for this supreme Empress.","Ling Han sighed. One day, would he have nothing left to live for? Would he not be able to die even if he wanted to? Would he become crazy?","With his strength, it was clearly even more difficult to kill him.","\"No, I have an inner heaven and earth. As long as I’m alive, the people I care about won’t die, and as long as they’re still alive, I won’t go crazy,\" Ling Han murmured. This was the greatest difference between him and the Empress.","With a thought, his soul returned to his body.","Weng, he opened his eyes.","\"Ling Han!\" Everyone rushed over. Now that Ling Han had returned, it meant one thing.","The Star Moon Empress had died.","In this way, peace finally returned to the world.","Ling Han nodded, \"It’s all over.\"","All the Great Emperors cheered. Though the last twenty million years could be considered peaceful, the two invincible Great Emperors were still lying in ambush, so they did not dare to be careless at all. But now, they could finally let go of all their worries.","The world went back to normal.","Ling Han once again lived in seclusion. The new Emperor was in charge, overseeing the world.","Eight million years later, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor entered the Primitive Abyss, and began to continue his pursuit of the Imperial Path.","Previously, he had promised Ling Han that he would keep watch over the world and maintain order, and after eight million years, his responsibilities had been fulfilled. He had to continue his own path of cultivation.","Another 15 million years later, the Shatter Wind Great Emperor’s influence on heaven and earth had completely disappeared, and martial arts welcomed another boom. Genius prodigies appeared one after another, and a new Emperor was allowed to attain dao again.","However, in this era, an ancient Pseudo-Emperor appeared, snatching the fortune of heaven and earth, to attain Dao and become Emperor.","This person had been well-known for his viciousness in the ancient times. Afterwards, he had obtained a great opportunity, and suppressed himself. He would reappear in this era, and become the Great Emperor.","Once he became the Great Emperor, he announced all kinds of incredibly harsh rules, treating the world like a toy.","The Great Emperor should have been overseeing the world and maintaining order, yet now, he had transformed into an evil spirit. How could the world not be in chaos?","However, not too many years later, a youth directly charged into the palace of this Great Emperor, and killed this Great Emperor by force."]},{"number":4912,"title":"Chapter 4912: Finale","paragraphs":["When the news spread out, it stunned the world.","Who was this youth? He had actually killed the Great Emperor?","The young man was carefree, and left after succeeding, leaving behind only his name.","—Ling Luochen.","Afterwards, this youth was respectfully addressed as Great Emperor Luo Chen. Every time an evil Saint wreaked havoc in the world, he would appear, and perform the duties of a Great Emperor.","...","Four Origin Planet.","\"Father, it’s time for a replacement!\" Ling Luochen shouted without any care for his image. \"I’ve already guarded the world for a million years, so it’s time for Little Brother Yun, Little Brother Tong and the others!\"","\"Nephew!\" The large black dog immediately approached him. His iron underwear was still shining brightly, and could blind anyone with its brilliance.","A vigilant expression immediately appeared on Ling Luochen’s face. This large black dog was famous for being despicable, and he had even screwed over his own people. Thus, he definitely couldn’t let his guard down.","\"Tsk, tsk, tsk, what kind of expression is that!\" The large black dog immediately said in displeasure, but very soon, he ignored it and continued, \"Grandpa Dog has recently gained quite a bit of insight in the comprehension of the element of Creation. You see, when this is used on the Transcendent Weapon, it can strengthen the effects of the Transcendent Weapon.\"","\"No, no, no!\" Ling Luochen revealed a panicked expression. This unreliable elder was obviously going to use him as a test subject again.","He wanted to flee, but it was too late. Shua, a majestic light lit up, and then rapidly changed.","Red, orange, yellow, green, indigo, not only did the color change drastically, but the brightness was also astonishingly strong.","\"Ah!\" Ling Luochen hurriedly covered his eyes, but his tears couldn’t stop flowing.","\"As expected, Grandpa Dog is really awesome. The improvement is successful!\" The large black dog laughed loudly.","\"Old Black, you’re bullying others again!\" The little azure dragon walked over, accompanied by a heroic-looking woman.","\"Yi!\" When the large black dog saw him, he couldn’t help but feel stunned, \"You, you, you, Grandpa Dog has always thought that you were gay, and deliberately wear iron underwear every day to protect my a**. I never thought that you would actually change your personality?\"","The little azure dragon sneered, \"Before you met me, you’ve always been this perverted!\"","The heroic-looking woman smiled, and said brightly, \"I am Mei Ruonan. Please take care of me.\"","\"I will, I will.\" The large black dog nodded, then rubbed his chin, \"Now that even the Four-Legged Snake has a wife, shouldn’t Grandpa Dog also look for a good-looking female dog?\"","Just as they were speaking, Brother Monkey walked in with large strides, holding the metal rod on his shoulder.","\"Uncle Monkey!\" Ling Luochen hurriedly paid his greetings. Compared to the large black dog and the little azure dragon that were unreliable, Brother Monkey was much more serious.","Brother Monkey nodded, \"Have you discovered any enemies that you can’t deal with?\"","Ling Luochen couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. The line of the Battle Saint Emperor was either in battle or on the path of battle. Don’t you think that now that the world is peaceful, you should go and find a female monkey?","\"We’re here!\" Amidst laughter, seven babies appeared at the same time.","The Calabash Brothers were still the same. They didn’t grow up, but they didn’t age in the slightest.","They were not living creatures in the ordinary sense, but rather Source Treasures that had been birthed from the Primitive Abyss. They were completely capable of absorbing the element of Life, and possessed an endless lifespan.","\"Yi, why have even the babies come?\" Lin Luo descended from the skies. Behind him were Zhou Heng and Chu Hao. The three of them had long since reached the level of Pseudo-Emperor, and had attained Dao at Imperial Island.","\"Is it a big day today?\" Zhou Heng asked with a smile.","One after another, more people appeared, such as Jing Haoran, Shui Qingchang, Great Emperor Wu Ya, Ancestral King Lingtian, and so on.","It could be said that all the Emperor Tier-level powers had once again gathered.","At this time, Ling Han walked out, his expression slightly solemn.","This shocked everyone greatly. With Ling Han’s current strength, what else could trouble him?","Only Brother Monkey looked excited. \"Second Brother, has a new enemy appeared?\"","Ah, ah, ah! His metal rod was already hungry and thirsty for battle.","Ling Han said, \"I can sense the changes in heaven and earth, and it vaguely makes me feel a little apprehensive.\"","All the Emperors were shocked. It should be known that with Ling Han’s present strength, he was definitely the strongest in history, but even he had this kind of feeling, so what kind of great event would happen?","Boom!","As if to illustrate Ling Han’s words, Purple Qi rose up from the heaven and earth, turning into endless multicolored light.","This!","Ling Han released his divine sense. The entire universe was under his gaze, and he shockingly discovered that Purple Qi was seeping out from all over the universe.","Was an unknown being about to appear?","Right at this moment, a maidservant hurriedly ran over, panting heavily.","The Emperors were all a little nervous. When they suddenly saw her run over with a flustered expression, they all thought that something big had happened, and immediately looked over.","Being stared at by such powerful Great Emperors, the maidservant was almost scared to death.","Thankfully, she was a maid of the Ling Clan after all, so it was impossible that she did not have the slightest bit of resistance. She hurriedly said, \"Lord Ling, Lady Han has given birth!\"","Lady Han, of course, was Chi Menghan.","Ling Han faltered for a moment before exulting in delight. Chi Menghan had already been pregnant for millions of years, yet she still hadn’t been able to give birth. He was about to die of anxiety.","This was because a Pseudo-Emperor only had a lifespan of five million years, yet this little guy had stayed in its mother’s womb for millions of years. It could even outlast several batches of Saints dying.","She had finally given birth!","He hurriedly ran towards the inner courtyard.","The Emperors also faltered for a moment before bursting into laughter. It was no wonder that Ling Han would feel so apprehensive. He had a premonition that his child was about to arrive in the world. Their bloodlines were connected, so he would definitely be moved.","However, what the hell was this Purple Qi?","However, they were too embarrassed to go to the inner courtyard, so they could only wait for Ling Han to come out again.","Ling Han ran into the inner courtyard, only to see Chi Menghan lying on the bed with a tiny infant in her arms.","\"You gave birth?\" he whispered.","\"Yes, it’s a daughter,\" Chi Menghan said. She then handed her daughter over to Ling Han.","Ling Han carefully accepted it. No matter how many times he became a father, when a new life appeared, he would always be filled with surprise.","This was an incredibly beautiful girl. Though she had just been born, it could already be seen that she would grow up to become beautiful.","\"My precious daughter!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The infant was not the slightest bit afraid, and smiled mischievously at Ling Han. She even stretched out two chubby little hands, and grabbed at Ling Han’s face, as if she wanted to touch his face.","However, when she raised her hands, Ling Han shockingly discovered that there was actually Purple Qi circulating between the baby’s fingers.","This, this, this, this!","As it turned out, the existence that made him shudder with fear was actually this little infant!","At birth, it was enough to shake the entire universe, and Purple Qi descended. How astonishing was that?","Hold on!","Ling Han looked at this little girl, and suddenly felt a sense of familiarity.","Right at this moment, the infant burst into tears. This was because she had kept trying to grab onto Ling Han’s face. However, she had been unable to do so.","Ling Han hurriedly leaned over, allowing the little girl to grab onto his face.","\"Gegege.\" The little girl immediately laughed.","\"Give her a name,\" Chi Menghan said gently from the side.","Ling Han felt a little awkward. In terms of naming, he had always been incompetent. He was just about to push this mission to Chi Menghan, when a thought flashed through his mind.","\"His name is Ling Xingyue.\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, he couldn’t help but be startled. Why had he come up with this name?","Er!","He suddenly trembled, and finally came to a realization. Why did this little girl give him a familiar feeling?","The Star Moon <anno data-annotation-id=\"8400ce29-c336-4730-962f-e70d39f9e498\" data-title=\"Empress\">Empress 1 </anno>!","This supreme Empress... had actually reincarnated as his daughteer","No, no, no. The soul imprint had already been destroyed, so it was impossible for her to reincarnate.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and came up with a possibility.","—Star Moon Empress had died in Ling Han’s heaven and earth, but she was too strong. It was possible that a sliver of her intent had also fused into Ling Han’s body, and afterwards, it had entered Chi Menghan’s body, turning into a new life.","If that was not the case, what infant in the world would need to a pregnancy period of several million years?","Was this supreme Empress going to reappear in this world?","And as his daughter at that?","Ling Han looked at his daughter’s small face, a gentle smile appearing at the corners of his lips.","This was his daughter, and he would protect her with his life!","...","As time passed, generation after generation of new Emperors appeared and died, and the collapse of heaven and earth had finally come to an end.","In the last moments of this Stacked Era, the heaven and earth began to shrink at an astonishing speed. It was like the great explosion when the heaven and earth was first created, so fast and furious.","The stars exploded one after another, forcibly crushed by the boundless power of heaven and earth. Practically all life in the entire universe was exterminated in an instant, and the power of heaven and earth retreated to a point.","And at this point, Ling Han also turned into the size of a mustard seed, using the same power of heaven and earth to resist the compressive force of the entire universe.","It was a perfect balance.","The heaven and earth inside his body was brimming with vitality.","The large black dog, the little dragon, the empress, Hu Niu, Chi Menghan, and so on all entered the inner heaven and earth, avoiding the cycle of heaven and earth this time.","However, there were also a great many Great Emperors that had not entered into the inner heaven and earth.","They chose to return to heaven and earth, having no intention of entering the next Stacked Era.","Regarding this, Ling Han expressed his respect, and did not interfere.","Countless years passed. Boom! A huge explosion suddenly took place in heaven and earth. Endless matter and energy surged out from a single point, and the universe rapidly expanded, forming an embryonic form.","A new Stacked Era had arrived!","Countless particles rapidly expanded, turning into multiple stars, and one of them took the form of a human figure.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly snapped open.","—End of Part Two","—End of the book","...","Thank you!","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">’Xingyue’ literally means ’Star Moon’.</annotations>"]},{"number":4913,"title":"Chapter 4913: Side Story -- City 01","paragraphs":["I know that I am Ling Han, but aside from this name, why are my other memories completely blank?","Ling Han stood at the school gates in a daze, staring blankly at the words \"Third High School of Zhou Su City\".","\"Ling Han, what are you standing here for? Let’s go in!\" A seventeen or eighteen year old young man walked over and said to Ling Han.","He was... Yang Qi.","A name immediately popped up in Ling Han’s mind. Then, even more information appeared. This was his seat mate, and also his best friend.","\"We have worked hard for so long. Whether or not we can enter the martial arts academy will depend on our performance today!\" Yang Qi said.","\"Martial arts academy?\" Ling Han murmured, then the information in his mind suddenly exploded.","Fifty years ago, an astonishing change had suddenly taken place in their world. Wild beasts had mutated, and they were extremely terrifying. There were panthers that could snap an alloy in half with a single bite, golden condors that were even faster than a plane, and giant bears that had shattered a mountain with a single palm strike.","In front of such terrifying Foreign Beasts, humans appeared fragile and powerless. Unless they used nuclear weapons, even missiles could do nothing against the stronger ranks of these Foreign Beasts.","However, the heavens did not exterminate humans. This kind of mutation had happened to wild beasts, and changed humans as well. Numerous powerful cultivators had appeared, and they too could break mountains with a single punch, and firearms were ineffective against them.","After fifty years of conflict, the residential areas of the humans had already shrunk to one tenth of their original size. Only then had they barely managed to defend their territory, and the majority of their territory had been occupied by the Foreign Beasts.","Because only cultivators could stand against Foreign Beasts, the status of cultivators rose steadily. Though they were few in number, they had become the hope of humans, and occupied the dominant position.","Schools also went with the trend and increased the number of martial arts classes. As long as one performed outstandingly, they would be able to enter the martial arts academy and more elites would be nurtured for humanity.","And once one became a cultivator, that meant a great increase in social status. Thus, the students nowadays were all filled with yearning to become a cultivator.","Today, for Ling Han and the other high school students, it was the day of the martial arts test. Once they passed, they would be able to enter into the martial arts academy, and from then onwards, start a completely different life.","If they failed, they could only continue their studies. In future, if they became a white-collar worker or something, they would still be able to live a peaceful life.","If one wanted to enroll into the martial arts academy, they would have to meet all three criteria, which were power, speed, and reaction speed.","Today, students like them would undergo these three tests.","In Ling Han’s case, he was hovering around the passing line for these three indicators. Thus, whether he could pass or not would completely depend on how he acted on the spot. If he was nervous or something, which led to poor performance, he would definitely have no chance of passing.","\"Alright,\" Ling Han said with a nod. He then entered the academy with Yang Qi.","They had not walked too far, when they heard a commotion behind them.","\"Wang Hanchen!\" A girl screamed shrilly, as if she had seen some superstar.","And in truth, Wang Hanchen was indeed not much different from a superstar in the Third High.","Firstly, he was extremely handsome, and was publicly acknowledged as the campus beau of the Third High.","Secondly, his old man was a deputy with real power in a certain branch of the city, and his uncle was even more impressive. He was a Level One cultivator!","There were a total of nine levels for cultivators, with Level One being the lowest and Level Nine being the highest. However, as long as one could become a cultivator, even Level One would be superior to ordinary people, and was considered a special class.","With the guidance of this uncle, Wang Hanchen also far surpassed his peers in the three indicators. It was a sure bet that he would be able to enter the martial arts academy.","With such a background, Wang Hanchen was naturally publicly acknowledged as being tall, rich and handsome.","\"Ling Han, don’t be rash.\" Yang Qi hurriedly grabbed onto Ling Han.","’Hmm?’","Ling Han faltered for a moment. Then, new information surged into his mind. As it turned out, there was actually a grudge between him and this Wang Hanchen.","—Before the New Year, Ling Han still had a girlfriend, but Wang Hanchen had only used a little trick, and managed to steal his girlfriend away.","If that was all, Ling Han could only blame himself for being blind and falling for a materialistic girl. However, Wang Hanchen actually deliberately came over to mock him. This completely enraged Ling Han, and he came to blows with Wang Hanchen.","In terms of abilities, it was definitely Wang Hanchen that was stronger, but before he became a cultivator, this kind of strength was also limited. Furthermore, Ling Han directly exploded with fury, and actually managed to fight Wang Hanchen to the point that both sides were severely wounded.","This matter also alerted Wang Hanchen’s father, who used his authority to force Ling Han to apologize. Otherwise, the school would expel Ling Han.","Ling Han’s parents were only ordinary employees, and had no background at all. For the sake of his future, Ling Han was forced to bow his head.","From then onwards, every time Ling Han heard Wang Hanchen’s name, he would become quite agitated.","Hence, Yang Qi naturally had to hold Ling Han back, to prevent him from going up and putting his life on the line.","Today was a big day for them, so no matter what, they had to choose to endure.","Ling Han saw Wang Hanchen, and sure enough, he was tall and slender, handsome and confident. However, he clearly detested this person very much, but now, he only felt a kind of indifference, like a lion looking down on a lamb.","No matter how much you, a lamb, provoke your fellow beasts, how could a lion care?","He could just kill him directly.","He couldn’t help but find this strange. He wasn’t a high-ranking official with great power, nor was he an elite who could shatter a mountain with a single punch. Why did he feel that Wang Hanchen was extremely insignificant? Why did he not even have the right to be hated by him?","Where did he get this feeling of superiority from?","Wang Hanchen also saw Ling Han, so he deliberately turned around and walked over.","\"From today onwards, I will enter the academy, and as for you—\" Wang Hanchen showed a mocking smile, \"I know that you are only hovering around the passing mark in the three indicators. My uncle has already issued instructions, and it is guaranteed that you will fail. There is no difficulty at all.\"","\"Additionally, don’t even think of taking the path of arts, because your results for the National Higher Education Entrance Examination would also be a mess!\"","\"Are you going to ask me how I managed to do it?\"","\"It’s very simple, because my uncle is a cultivator!\"","\"Do you understand cultivators? Killing you is as simple as killing an ant!\"","He said many things in a single breath, and an excited expression appeared on his face.","He had been born with a silver spoon in his mouth. Not only did his parents treat him like a treasure, but even his uncle, who had no time to marry and have children because he had been cultivating, treated him like his own son. He doted on him extremely much. When had he ever been beaten to the point of having to go to the hospital to get stitches?","How could he easily forget this enmity?","Thus, he had indeed accepted Ling Han’s apology at that time. However, he hadn’t planned to let Ling Han off the hook at all. He had only done this to make Ling Han lose hope.","\"Wang Hanchen, you’re far too despicable and shameless!\" Yang Qi shouted in anger. Was this really a high school student?","Just because of a fight, he was going to ruin someone’s future?","The martial arts exam, the national exam, these were two great events that would decide the fate of a young man for the rest of his life, but Wang Hanchen was about to destroy Ling Han.","It should be known that in the previous fight between the two of them, he had indeed been injured, but Ling Han was not much better off either. Furthermore, he was forced to apologize to Wang Hanchen, and pay some compensation. How could this matter still not be forgotten with that?","At the end of the day, it was also because Wang Hanchen had not only pried away his girlfriend, but also boasted proudly in front of him. Who would be able to tolerate that?"]},{"number":4914,"title":"Chapter 4914: Side Story -- City 2","paragraphs":["Ling Han, on the other hand, was incredibly calm. That strange feeling came again. No matter how Wang Hanchen jumped around in front of him, in his eyes, he was like an ant. No matter what, he could not anger him. Worse come to worst, he would just stomp him to death.","\"Ling Han, I will go and take a look at your test. Haha, seeing your expression with my own eyes at that time should be very exciting!\" Wang Hanchen continued to add fuel to the fire, \"After four years, I will definitely be able to become a real cultivator, and you, hoho, would only be able to live at the lowest level of society!\"","\"You would only be able tlook up at my back, tremble, and feel extreme regret for the mistakes that you have once made!\"","\"You shouldn’t have offended me!\"","Ling Han finally spoke up, and asked calmly, \"Are you done with your performance?\"","Performance?","’Do you think I’m acting for you?’","Wang Hanchen was instantly enraged. He had the urge to make a move, but he immediately suppressed the urge.","Today was the day of the martial arts test, so he definitely couldn’t allow a scandal to arise. Otherwise, even his uncle wouldn’t be able to protect him.","\"You’re going to cry later!\" he threw down these words, then strode off.","\"How detestable!\" Yang Qi said with a wave of his hand. Just then, he couldn’t help but want to charge over to pummel this b*stard.","Yet Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Just a clown, no need to take it to heart.\"","An indescribable memory surged in his mind, and he also felt that a power was presently growing in his body, surging like the tide.","\"That’s right. Don’t take it to heart,\" Yang Qi said with a nod. \"Just focus on the test. If you panic, you’ll truly fall into his trap! Ling Han, Wang Hanchen! was definitely bluffing. Although his family has some power, it definitely won’t affect the martial arts test.\"","Ling Han merely smiled, and said, \"All right, I know.\"","They entered the track and field area, where the martial arts test would be held.","Test tools had already been set up here. Because there were many people, they had to be tested in batches. One batch would be tested for power, another batch would be tested for speed, and the last batch would be tested for reaction speed.","Ling Han was first scheduled to undergo the power test, but even though they were divided into batches, there was still a long queue.","\"Luo Qi, Ma Dong, Hang Xiaoming...\" The examiner called out their names, and those who were called all stepped out. There were a total of ten people, and each walked to stand in front of a machine.","This was a strength tester. As long as one’s attack landed on the strength tester, the power index would immediately appear on the display screen.","\"Begin.\"","Following the examiner’s command, the ten people immediately began to accumulate power. Then, they would either throw punches or kicks. Peng, peng, peng! A series of heavy blows were heard, and the numbers on the display screen kept changing.","As long as they didn’t stop, they could continue to attack, and the machine would only record the highest value.","\"Stop.\" The examiner called out again, and the ten people stopped one after another. The majority looked disappointed, and only one person looked pleased.","He was the only one who met the standard.","However, it was still too early to be happy. Firstly, all three tests had to be passed, and secondly, the number of students enrolled in the martial academy was fixed every time. If there were too many people who passed the test this time, then they could only be accepted based on those who achieved the highest scores.","\"Next batch, Han Yue, Zhao Tian...\" The examiner was expressionless, and began to call out names again.","This martial arts test was indeed difficult. There were already sixty people who had completed the test, but there were only a mere two people who had reached the standard. Taking into account the two tests of speed and reaction speed, the passing rate might not even be 1%.","This was very normal. The enrollment rate from Third High over the years was only 1%.","When it was the ninth batch, it was finally Wang Hanchen’s turn.","Once he took the field, everyone couldn’t help but discuss. After all, this was an influential figure in the school.","Peng!","Wang Hanchen’s attack was launched, and a number immediately popped up on the display screen: 13.","Was this very low?","According to the official standards, as long as the value of 8 was given, that was the average power of an ordinary eighteen-year-old man, and when it reached 10, it would cross over into the lowest standard for the martial arts academy assessment.","13, this was an outstanding result. Even in the entire Zhou Su City, it could be ranked among the top.","Wang Hanchen also revealed a satisfied smile. He was not like others, who needed to fire a lot of punches, because his uncle was a real cultivator, and had taught him a fist technique. He only needed one punch, and he would be able to perfectly unleash the power in his body.","13, this was indeed his peak-level power.","He didn’t throw another punch. Instead, he caught sight of Ling Han in the crowd, and a mocking smile appeared on his face.","Just see, just how terrifying my power is!","As expected, everyone looked at Wang Hanchen with reverence. At present, they were still classmates, but not too long after, he would become a cultivator, and from then onwards, would be superior to ordinary people, and completely pull away from them.","However, seeing Ling Han’s expressionless face, Wang Hanchen couldn’t help but reveal a hint of disappointment.","En, he must be pretending to be tough.","Wang Hanchen nodded, thinking too highly of himself.","Fine, let’s see how long you can last.","Wave after wave of people underwent the test, and finally, it was Ling Han’s turn.","He and the other nine students stood in front of the strength tester at the same time. Then, with a command from the teacher, they could begin.","Peng, peng, peng! A great many people launched their attacks.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry to attack. He raised his fist, and an unfamiliar memory reverberated in his mind.","In his memories, when he threw a punch, stars would be easily shattered, as if they were made of paper.","He pushed out his fist, and his speed was very slow, it he headed towards the strength testing board.","\"What is he doing?\"","\"Is he putting on a show?\"","\"Such a slow attack, is he hitting an ant?\"","A great many people saw Ling Han’s actions, and they all laughed loudly.","Even if you clearly know that you can’t, and have given up on yourself, you don’t have to do this, right?","Even the invigilator at the side was slightly displeased. He had never seen someone treat the exam so passively.","Meanwhile, Wang Hanchen smirked coldly. In his eyes, this was a very normal reaction from Ling Han.","Under extreme disappointment, wasn’t it very normal to do such a thing?","However, do you think I will let you go just like that?","Wrong, I will continue to suppress you. Unless the day comes when you can no longer bear it and commit suicide, I will definitely not stop!","He was the type to seek revenge for the smallest grievance.","Right at this moment, Ling Han’s fist finally touched the strength testing board.","He really did come into contact, and did not make the slightest sound.","However, the following scene caused everyone’s eyes to pop out of their heads.","Ling Han’s fist merely touched the strength tester lightly, yet the strength tester flew up, drawing a beautiful arc in the air. Only then did it crash heavily into the sandpit, raising sand that filled the air.","There was dead silence.","’Holy f*ck! This is far too terrifying!’","How heavy was a Strength Testing Tool?","Furthermore, this thing was fixed to the ground after it had been planted. Looking at the four metal bars left behind on the ground, those were the four metal bars that were used to stabilize the strength tester, and just how wide and long were they!","What kind of power was needed to send the Strength Testing Tool flying with a single punch?","No, no, no, it wasn’t sent flying with a punch. It was just a light touch.","This was practically f***."]},{"number":4915,"title":"Chapter 4915: Side Story -- City 03","paragraphs":["The fist shot out, and everyone was stunned.","Had he f*cking been possessed by a cultivator, and that was why he possessed such terrifying power?","A high school senior student!","At this age, everyone’s strength was usually around 8. Those who could reach 10 had a chance of entering the martial arts academy.","But now, he had sent the Strength Testing Tool flying with a single punch. What kind of monster was this?","Meanwhile, Wang Hanchen was dumbfounded. He could not believe his eyes at all.","How could this kind of power appear on a high school student? What was even more unacceptable to him was that this student was actually Ling Han!","Am I seeing things? Am I seeing things?","That must be the case, that must be the case.","He rubbed his eyes, but what made him despair was the fact that the strength tester was still lying in a sandpit in the distance.","’Is this real?’","Heavens, heavens, was this still the Ling Han that he knew?","Impossible, he definitely could not accept this.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked towards his teacher, \"How should my results be calculated?\"","The teacher was speechless. He didn’t know whether to call this brat naive or show off.","However, he immediately became troubled. Ling Han’s power had definitely surpassed the standard of entering the martial arts academy. However, how should he fill in this number?","He thought for a long time, and finally filled in the value of 99. This was the limit of the Strength Testing Tool. If it was further than this, it would reach the standard of a cultivator.","Ling Han smiled, and also walked back. He saw that every student was looking at him in shock, as if they had seen a ghost.","Indeed, this kind of performance from him was too frightening.","\"W-what medicine did you take?\" Wang Hanchen jumped out and pointed at Ling Han’s nose as he asked.","He definitely did not believe that Ling Han could suddenly become so powerful. He must have taken a forbidden medicine.","Ling Han humphed, and directly threw a punch.","Peng! This punch was very heavy, and Wang Hanchen instantly collapsed to the ground.","\"Ling Han, you—\"","Peng!","Wang Hanchen had just gotten up, and wanted to rebuke Ling Han angrily, but in the next second, he was once again beaten to the ground.","\"You b@stard...\"","Peng!","He got up again, but was once again beaten to the ground.","\"You’re bullying me too much—\"","Peng!","Every time Wang Hanchen got up, he would be knocked down by Ling Han. Everyone gritted their teeth at this sight.","Ling Han was far too domineering. He didn’t waste his breath, instead directly pummeling him.","This was a completely disdainful expression. ’I can’t even be bothered to talk to you. If I don’t like you, I can just beat you up.’","After seven consecutive times, Wang Hanchen finally learnt his lesson. He lay on the ground, neither daring to get up nor daring to speak.","His heart was filled with humiliation. His indicators had already surpassed the admission criteria of the martial arts academy, and he could be called a reserve cultivator, yet now, he had been beaten into a retard by Ling Han.","How could he accept this!","However, was that the end?","Ling Han raised his foot, peng, peng, peng, and began to kick.","On one hand, his mentality was high and lofty, and did not take Wang Hanchen seriously at all, but on the other hand, he still remembered the humiliation and pain that Wang Hanchen had caused him. How could it be resolved with a mere seven punches?","\"All right, all right.\" The teacher at the side could no longer bear to watch, and came over to mediate.","Ling Han looked towards him. His eyes were indifferent, but there was an indescribable pressure exuding from him, causing that teacher to shiver in fear, and be unable to say another word.","He continued to pummel him.","Peng, peng, peng! Every step was incredibly firm, and Wang Hanchen could not bear it any longer. He began to wail.","At this moment, he was really scared out of his wits. He had completely lost all fighting spirit, and was like a child.","When everyone saw this, they could only inhale sharply.","This guy was too terrifying. In the academy, he publicly thrashed someone, and even the teacher did not dare to persuade him otherwise.","\"How is he supposed to persuade him? Didn’t you see how Ling Han sent the Strength Testing Tool flying with a single punch? This is power that is close to the strength of a cultivator. That teacher of ours has a strength value of 20, at most. The gap is too wide.\"","\"But if he publicly beat someone up in the academy, would he still be enrolled into the academy?\"","\"You don’t understand. An eighteen-year-old pseudo cultivator, just how amazing is his natural talent? When the martial arts academy knows, they’ll definitely suppress this matter and turn a big problem into a small one, and a small problem into nothing!\"","\"True.\"","Ling Han directly turned around, and walked towards the second examination location.","However, it was impossible for Wang Hanchen to go. He was severely injured by Ling Han, so what was the point of continuing the test!","The school immediately called the medical staff, and sent Wang Hanchen away. Then, they began to have a headache.","If it was just an ordinary fight, it would be easily resolved, but now?","There was no need to mention Wang Hanchen’s background. He had a father with real power, and an even more awesome uncle who was a cultivator. It was absolutely impossible that he could be allowed to be beaten up for nothing.","However, in Ling Han’s case, he was actually so powerful that he could send the Strength Testing Tool flying with a single punch. That was power on the level of a pseudo cultivator!","If they offended a future cultivator, how difficult would their future days be?","After much consideration, the higher ups of the academy still decided to give Wang Hanchen’s father a call first, and see what he planned to do.","—If the other party was also wary of the identity of cultivator that Ling Han was about to obtain, and was willing to settle the matter peacefully, then it would be easy. After all, Wang Hanchen could repeat his studies for a year, and it would be the same for him to go to the martial academy next year.","Moreover, Wang Hanchen’s uncle was also a cultivator. Who knows, he might be able to open a back door for Wang Hanchen. When he recovered from his injuries, he would arrange another examination for him.","However, when Wang Hanchen’s father, Wang Jun, heard that his son had been beaten, he immediately jumped up. He directly hung up the phone, and charged towards the school.","When he arrived, it was not Ling Han’s turn yet to undergo the second test of speed.","\"Where’s the little beast that injured my son?\" Wang Jun roared.","Instantly, everyone’s eyes turned towards Ling Han.","Though not everyone was familiar with this Deputy Wang, but aside from Wang Hanchen’s father, who else would come so aggressively at this time?","\"It’s you!\" Wang Jun stared at Ling Han, looking like he wanted to eat him alive.","On the way here, he had already found out about his son’s situation. He knew that his son’s injuries were very serious, and he would definitely miss this martial arts assessment. This was also another reason for his thunderous fury.","Once they missed the martial arts exam, they would have to wait another year, and at Wang Hanchen’s age, how could he afford a gap of a year?","And if he had to use his relationship with Wang Hanchen’s uncle, he would definitely have to use up some of his favors. That would be a great loss.","Thus, he was extremely furious. He definitely had to severely punish the person who had hurt his son.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked towards the invigilator, \"Now is the time for the exam. Shouldn’t such people who disturb order be chased out?\"","\"You are really arrogant!\" Wang Jun strode over, \"I am the deputy of the Heaven’s Gate Division, and you actually dare to make me — what are you doing?\"","He hadn’t even finished speaking, when Ling Han picked him up and tossed him out.","\"To say nothing of the fact that you are only a mere Deputy Minister, even if the Chief of Zhou Su City came, he would not be able to interfere with the examination of the students!\" Ling Han said calmly to him.","\"You—\" Wang Jun’s eyes almost popped out in anger.","’You wounded my son, yet you’re still so calm?’","’You’re far too arrogant!"]},{"number":4916,"title":"Chapter 4916: Side Story -- City 04","paragraphs":["Wang Jun naturally couldn’t tolerate this. He immediately rushed back aggressively, as if he wanted to kill.","However, he had just arrived in front of Ling Han, when he was kicked out by the latter. Peng, he turned into a rolling gourd, and instantly rolled back.","This... was too humiliating.","Wang Jun did not dare believe it. A few months ago, this young man was still trembling in fear in front of him, but just how much time had passed? He actually dared to make a move on him?","He touched his face, and saw that there was blood on his hand!","His nose was broken.","He pointed angrily at Ling Han, but did not make a sound.","What was the point of threatening him now? He was clearly unafraid of him, so no matter what he said, he would only be asking for his own humiliation.","\"Good! Good! Good!\" He stomped his foot, then took out his phone and began dialing.","He was going to find someone to deal with Ling Han. He did not believe that he would not be able to deal with this young man.","Meanwhile, Ling Han acted as if nothing had happened, and said to the invigilator, \"The harrasser has been dealt with, so I can continue, right?\"","\"Continue, continue.\" The invigilator looked at him in shock, both impressed and worried.","Ling Han was definitely the first person to dare to go against a clan of cultivators like this. However, did he really have that much confidence?","The speed test itself was very simple. It was to run 100 meters, and one would reach the standard if they could achieve that within 10 seconds.","However, the difficulty of passing was much higher. It was not easy for even a professional jock to run the distance in less than ten seconds, what more high school students like them. Without an outstanding foundation of speed, how could they be qualified to become a cultivator?","Ling Han stood on the track, with seven other people beside him.","\"Ready, run!\"","With the command, Ling Han instantly charged out. Then, on the other side, the invigilator in charge of keeping time saw that Ling Han had already charged past the finishing line.","’Holy f*ck! Not even a second has passed!’","Looking at the track again, even if he had been in a daze for a while, the fastest of the other seven students had only covered one third of the distance.","Just how wide was the gap between them?","One second.","He wrote down the results under Ling Han’s name, and this was definitely not an accurate number, because he had not reacted in time at all.","It was all right. This result naturally could be enrolled into the martial academy. At that time, the academy could just do another accurate test for him.","Ling Han walked back, and naturally received a large number of stunned gazes.","This young man... was going to defy the heavens!","His power and speed had both reached the standard of cultivators. Although his reaction speed hadn’t been tested yet, who would suspect that Ling Han wouldn’t be able to pass?","Hehe, this was going to be interesting. Wang Hanchen had always strutted around in the academy, and this time, he was finally going to meet his match.","Ling Han moved towards the third testing area. Wang Jun watched helplessly, but did not stop him.","He was here, and there was no way he could escape. Furthermore, he had no wish to deal with this brat again. That guy was young and rash, and did not take authority seriously. It was best that he did not seek his own humiliation.","Ling Han arrived at the third examination area, where reaction speed was tested.","It was very simple, and that was to thrash the gophers. If he managed to hit ten of them within a minute, he would be able to reach the standard.","And how many times did gophers appear in total?","100!","In other words, he only had to hit one-tenth of the total. This requirement was really not high.","But looking at the speed at which the gopher stretched out its head and retreated, it was guaranteed that no one would say it was easy anymore.","—The time for the gopher to appear was only 0.1 seconds!","In other words, in this short 0.1 seconds, the examinee not only had to clearly see where the gopher was poking out from, but also had to strike with the hammer in his hand in the shortest time possible. Whether it was vision, brainpower, or speed of movement that could not keep up, he would only hit empty air.","Thus, this stage not only tested one’s reaction speed, but also one’s mentality. Thus, it became the stage with the highest elimination rate.","\"Ling Han!\" Yang Qi had just finished this test. He waved at Ling Han, then excitedly said, \"I passed, I passed. What about you? Have you taken the test for power or speed first? Have you passed?\"","Ling Han broke into a grin, \"I have passed both tests, and now I am only missing the final test of reaction speed.\"","Yang Qi clapped his hands, and said, \"Haha, I knew you could do it! Your mind wasn’t disturbed by that guy, Wang Hanchen!\"","This caused the people on the sidelines to grit their teeth. Wang Hanchen was disturbing Ling Han?","You probably don’t know, right? That guy had already been sent to the doctor. Even his old man had been thrashed by Ling Han.","\"We’ll celebrate after the test,\" Yang Qi said.","\"All right.\" Ling Han nodded.","Yang Qi left, while Ling Han queued up, preparing to undergo the final test.","This time, he didn’t have to wait for long before his name was called. He walked in front of the gopher machine.","He held a hammer in his hand, and there was no need for him to make any preparations. He tapped the start button, and instantly, the machine began to operate. A gopher popped out of one of the holes in the three-by-three grid.","Pa, Ling Han moved like lightning, and struck the gopher. The number on the counter immediately jumped, turning from zero to one.","Xiu, another gopher appeared, but Ling Han immediately struck it with his hammer.","2.","Then, three, four, five... the numbers on the counter changed rapidly, and Ling Han’s right hand danced as if it was flying. In the eyes of an ordinary person, it was as if he had a dozen over arms, forming overlapping shadows.","Soon, a minute had passed, and the number on the counter stopped at 100.","Full marks!","This naturally stunned everyone again, but because Ling Han had already displayed terrifying abilities twice previously, everyone was prepared this time. Instead, they were not as stunned as they had been the first time they saw Ling Han send the strength tester flying.","The school immediately called the martial academy to inform them that a prodigy had appeared from their school.","Why were they in a rush to call?","Wasn’t this because Wang Jun had come? Merely the higher-ups of the Third High School would definitely not be able to deal with Wang Jun. They would have to mobilize the people from the academy. As long as any random cultivator came, they would be able to immediately make this Deputy Minister become an obedient child.","Moreover, this matter also involved Wang Hanchen’s uncle. That was indeed a matter between cultivators. When it was a clash among the higher-ups, they naturally could not afford to trifle with them.","Not long after, Wang Jun’s reinforcements arrived first.","This was a young man who looked to be in his mid-twenties. He was tall and slender, but he wasn’t thin at all. Every muscle was filled with explosive power.","\"Hengming, you’re here.\" Wang Jun nodded, looking relieved.","This young man’s name was Li Hengming, and he was the disciple of his younger brother, Wang <anno data-annotation-id=\"de542c3c-fd2c-48fa-8ec2-032cd30729db\" data-title=\"Jun\">Jun 1 </anno>. Though he had not yet stepped into the threshold of cultivation, the gap was already very small. Furthermore, Li Hengming had been training outside the city with Wang Jun, and had killed a great many Foreign Beasts. In terms of actual battle prowess, there were some students in the martial academy that had become cultivators that were no match for him.","Li Hengming smiled, and said, \"Master is presently at a crucial moment in his attempt to break through to become a Level 2 cultivator. It is possible that he would be able to succeed today, or even tomorrow, so he has sent me here to solve the problem.\"","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">The characters for ’Jun’ are different, but their names sound the same.</annotations>"]},{"number":4917,"title":"Chapter 4917: Side Story -- City 05","paragraphs":["Wang Jun was instantly overjoyed.","His younger brother had long since become a cultivator, but after so many years, he was still unable to rush up to Level 2.","It should be known that with every difference in cultivation level, the gap in strength was like the gap between heaven and earth, and that was the same for social status.","If Wang Jun advanced to Level 2, then he, as the Deputy Minister, would immediately become the Minister!","Of course, this was a matter for the future. The priority now was to deal with that little beast.","\"How is Little Brother Chen now?\" Li Hengming asked.","Wang Jun instantly looked furious, \"Hanchen should not be able to enter into the academy this year.\"","Li Hengming smiled and said, \"Uncle, don’t worry. As long as Master advances to Level 2, it won’t be a problem for Little Brother Chen to undergo a separate make-up exam.\"","\"En.\" Wang Jun nodded, \"Hengming, come with me. It is very possible that that little bastard is already a pseudo-cultivator, and cannot be underestimated.\"","The so-called pseudo-cultivator was a little inferior to the cultivator, but was incredibly close.","Yet Li Heng Ming smiled confidently, \"There is no small number of Level 1 cultivators that have been defeated by me, and in this kind of comfortable place like the city, I would be able to fight five such pseudo-cultivators alone!\"","\"That’s good.\"","The two of them walked side by side, looking for Ling Han.","At this time, Ling Han had already arrived at the school gates. When Yang Qi came out, the two of them went to celebrate.","Wang Jun and Li Hengming searched everywhere, but they didn’t expect Ling Han to be at the school gate. Thus, when they circled a few times and confirmed that Ling Han wasn’t in the school and was about to set out in pursuit, they suddenly saw Ling Han.","\"That’s him!\" Wang Jun gritted his teeth as he pointed at Ling Han.","\"Ling Han!\" At this moment, Yang Qi also finished his examination and came out. There was shock written all over his face, and he said, \"Heavens, this must be fake! I heard that you sent the strength tester flying with a single punch during the power test?\"","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"It’s true.\"","\"How is this possible?\" Yang Qi asked in disbelief. Others might not know, but how could he not be familiar with Ling Han?","He had become a cultivator overnight?","Wasn’t this a joke?","\"You’re the criminal who injured Wang Hanchen?\" A young man walked over and asked Ling Han. However, his tone was very polite.","’Criminal?’","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle coldly. This was truly a poisonous snake.","On the surface, he was very polite, but in truth, he had laid a trap in his words. If one was not careful, even if he was beaten up by him, it would be Li Hengming that was in the right.","—You are a criminal, so shouldn’t I have hit you?","Ling Han didn’t answer, but instead asked, \"Who are you?\"","Li Hengming smiled. This brat actually didn’t fall for it. Looks like his reaction speed was quite fast.","\"My name is Li Hengming, and Wang Hanchen is my Junior Brother,\" he said calmly. \"You hit my Junior Brother, so it’s not unfair for me to seek you out for an accounting, right?\"","\"Cultivator?\" Ling Han asked casually.","Li Hengming shook his head, \"I’m still a little short. However, I have killed quite a number of Level 1 Foreign Beasts.\"","Hiss!","Yang Qi couldn’t help but inhale sharply upon hearing this.","With the same level, the Foreign Beasts should be even stronger, because Foreign Beasts were born with sharp teeth, claws, and thick skin, and in the case of cultivators, whether it was weapons or armor, they would have to be prepared, and the construction cost of such items was exorbitantly high. It was definitely not something that every cultivator could possess.","Thus, since Li Hengming could kill a Level 1 Foreign Beast, he was completely capable of killing a Level 1 cultivator as well. In fact, it would be even easier.","He hadn’t become a cultivator yet, yet he could actually kill a cultivator?","\"You’re from the army?\" Yang Qi asked in a trembling voice.","The students of the martial arts academy weren’t that fierce. Only the army, who bathed in blood and fought fiercely every day, could nurture such fierce people.","Li Hengming didn’t even glance at Yang Qi. Such a measly mortal wasn’t even worthy of garnering his attention.","\"Come with me.\" He only looked at Ling Han, and said calmly, \"Don’t force me to make a move. Otherwise, you will not have a good time.\"","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"I’m going to celebrate now, so I don’t have time to deal with you.\"","Li Hengming couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, \"Don’t you have ears? Like I said, I want to take you away.\"","Ling Han turned to Yang Qi, and said, \"Whatever you want to say is up to you, but whether you can do it or not will depend on your own abilities. Where are we going later?\"","Yang Qi couldn’t help but feel astonished. ’You’re actually thinking of going somewhere now?’","That was a soldier of the army, an existence that was just a step away from Level 1. Could you not be so careless!","\"Humph, you really don’t know what’s good for you!\" Li Hengming sneered, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han’s shoulder.","\"We’re not familiar with each other, so don’t put your hand on another’s shoulder!\" Ling Han said, as he stretched out a hand to slap the hand that Li Hengming had grabbed out with.","Pa!","How fast was his reaction speed and speed of attack? He accurately slapped onto Li Hengming’s hand, and instantly sent it flying.","\"En?\" Li Hengming couldn’t help but reveal a hint of surprise. He had not thought that Ling Han would move so quickly, and actually managed to slap his hand away.","Looks like he could not underestimate this young man too much.","\"You asked for this,\" he said with a slight bow. He clenched his left hand into a fist, and his right hand into a palm. His entire body tensed up, and he was like a cheetah ready to pounce at any moment. He was brimming with explosive power.","\"Ling Han, be careful!\" Yang Qi hurriedly warned. The soldiers of the army were completely different from the students of the martial academy. The students were like flower buds that had grown up in a greenhouse, and as for the soldiers of the army? They had become stronger step by step through slaughter and bloodshed.","Peng, Li Hengming suddenly bounced off his feet, and his figure instantly shot out, his speed astonishingly fast.","Ling Han also started to move. Memories flashed through his mind, and he naturally knew how he should face such a situation.","Li Hengming attacked repeatedly, but was more and more surprised. He had thrown so many punches, yet none of them actually hit Ling Han. In fact, there wasn’t even any physical entanglement.","Furthermore, after this burst of power, his physical power was greatly exhausted. If he could not deal with Ling Han in a short period of time, he would definitely be unable to maintain the intensity of this kind of attack.","He was very experienced in battle. The moment he realized that he could not deal with Ling Han in a short period of time, he immediately slowed down the rhythm of the battle.","However, the moment he slowed down, Ling Han became even faster.","Boom, he delivered a vicious punch, the speed of his punch astonishingly fast.","Li Hengming had just slowed the rhythm, so how could he possibly immediately speed up? Thus, faced with this punch, he could no longer dodge, and could only throw out a punch to parry.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. Could it be that Ling Han had calculated this before?","If that was the case, that would really be terrifying. He was a soldier that had been on the battlefield for a long time.","Peng!","Their fists crashed into each other. Li Hengming had raised his fist in a rush, and definitely couldn’t use his full strength. Instantly, he retreated continuously, his face flushed red.","Ling Han didn’t press his advantage. Instead, he said calmly, \"I said it would have to depend on your abilities. It’s clear... that’s not enough!\"","Li Hengming took a few deep breaths to adjust his condition. A solemn expression appeared on his face. This young man was very strong, and did not seem like a student at all. He was very experienced in battle.","He could not be careless, or it was really possible that he would fail."]},{"number":4918,"title":"Chapter 4918: Side Story -- City 06","paragraphs":["Li Hengming bent his body, like a cheetah that could suddenly attack at any time, his whole body filled with a feeling of power.","He was a pseudo-cultivator, and was only a line’s breadth away from becoming a true cultivator. However, he had rich battle experience, and had walked all the way through slaughter. In terms of sparring, he may not be as good as some Level 1 cultivators, but in terms of killing... he could crush the majority of Level 1 cultivators.","He was searching for an opening. Once Ling Han revealed the slightest bit of weakness, he would move, and knock Ling Han down with lightning speed.","\"Ling Han, be careful!\" Yang Qi was on tenterhooks.","This was a soldier of the army, and could be considered a killing machine. Who knew how much blood his hands had been stained with.","Ling Han looked towards him, and even nodded.","It was now!","Li Hengming immediately charged out, exploding with astonishing speed in an instant.","50 meters per second? Even faster than that!","Yang Qi was astonished. He wanted to scold Li Hengming for being despicable, yet at the same time, he also wanted to scold himself for speaking up at this moment. This had distracted Ling Han instead.","\"It’s over now.\"","Xiu, Li Hengming had already rushed in front of Ling Han, and shot out a punch, aimed directly at Ling Han’s ribs and waist.","If this punch landed solidly, it was guaranteed that Ling Han would immediately lose all ability to resist, and would only be at his mercy.","Right at this moment, Ling Han actually turned around and smiled at him.","Li Hengming was instantly numb with shock.","You actually have the time to turn your head around at a time like this?","How had he been able to do this in time?","Instantly, his whole body was covered with cold sweat, and an extremely ominous feeling rose up in him.","Countless battle experience told him that this was too strange.","However, it was too late for him to change his move now, so he could only forge head-on.","Peng!","The punch landed solidly, and Li Hengming couldn’t help but smile again, as if a heavy burden had been lifted from his shoulders.","He was filled with confidence in himself. As long as one was hit by his punch, and it was in a position like the ribs and waist, then even a Level 1 cultivator would immediately lose the ability to resist.","So it turned out that he had worried for nothing.","However, he immediately discovered that something was off.","Something didn’t feel right.","His fist had landed on his ribs and waist, but this didn’t feel like it.","He looked down, and saw that his fist had shockingly landed on the palm of Ling Han’s hand — no, it should be said that Ling Han had grabbed his fist with his hand.","Hiss!","’How did you do it?’","Ling Han smiled, and his right hand began to exert force. Ka, ka, ka! Li Hengming’s fist bones immediately groaned.","\"Wu!\" Li Hengming groaned in pain, but his battle experience was extremely abundant. In the face of danger, he did not panic. Immediately, he shot out a fist, and delivered a punch right at Ling Han’s temple.","If this punch landed solidly, it would not be as simple as making Ling Han lose his mobility. He could possibly die on the spot.","\"You’re seeking death!\" Ling Han’s eyes turned cold, and with a tightening of his right hand, ka, ka, ka, the sound of bones breaking rang out repeatedly.","\"Ah—\" Li Hengming screamed tragically, even his tears spurted out. The fist he had thrown out instantly missed its target.","Ling Han gave him another push, and Li Hengming stumbled backwards.","Like a boneless snake, Li Hengming’s right arm hung down. In reality, this was also the case. With Ling Han’s move just now, the bones in Li Hengming’s entire right arm shattered into at least a dozen pieces. How could he still raise it up?","Seeing this scene, both Yang Qi and Wang Jun could not believe their eyes!","Previously, though Ling Han’s test results were very kickass, and had reached the height of pseudo-cultivator, Li Hengming was also a pseudo-cultivator In fact, he had even killed a Level 1 Foreign Beast before, and according to battle prowess, he should be able to crush Ling Han.","But what was the result?","It was Li Hengming that had suffered a terrible defeat.","Looking at the other’s right arm, it must have been broken into a great many segments, and that was why it was drooping to this extent.","Heavens, the result of this battle would actually be so one-sided. Who could believe this?","\"You, you—\" Li Hengming pointed at Ling Han, yet could not speak a complete sentence.","How was this possible?","He was only a high school student, so why was his battle prowess even fiercer than his?","\"Scram!\" Ling Han said calmly. His eyes turned to Wang Jun, and he strode over.","\"You, what do you want to do?\" Wang Jun showed a hint of fear. Though he had an official position, his abilities were mediocre, and could not even be considered a pseudo-cultivator. Now that he saw Ling Han approach him, how could he not be afraid?","\"I am the Deputy Minister. If you dare touch a single hair on my head, that would be considered a rebellion!\"","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, \"You think you’re worthy!\"","He threw a punch. Peng! Wang Jun instantly collapsed to the ground, his face covered in blood.","\"Ling Han!\" Yang Qi walked over, his face filled with both excitement and worry.","He was naturally happy because of Ling Han’s strength, but Ling Han had also gotten into trouble.","—Hitting Wang Jun was actually a small matter, but offending a cultivator was a big issue.","Cultivators were high and noble, belonging to the true privileged class.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Don’t worry, I know what I’m doing!\"","Right at this moment, an off-road vehicle raced over, scaring the students at the school gate so much that they scattered like birds. Just as it was about to crash into the main gate, the off-road vehicle made a beautiful drift and stopped steadily.","A young man in martial arts attire walked down from the driver’s seat. His expression was sloppy, and he looked very much like a ruffian.","He looked at Ling Han and the others, and said with a smile, \"Let me ask you guys, do you know a student called Ling Han?\"","Yang Qi was still pondering whether this person was friend or foe, when Ling Han said, \"I am.\"","\"Oh, so you’re Ling Han.\" The young man nodded, and said, \"I’m Shu Zhengyang from the Zhou Su Martial Arts Academy. I heard that you encountered a small problem, so I specially came to help you deal with it.\"","The academy!","A look of delight spread across Yang Qi’s face upon hearing this. He bowed to Shu Zhengyang, and said, \"Hello, Senior Brother. My name is Yang Qi, and I’m Ling Han’s friend. We’ve indeed come across some trouble.\"","He spoke very quickly, and related the process of how Ling Han and the Wang Clan had become enemies. Though he did not know all the details, he was naturally on Ling Han’s side. His words were incredibly partial towards Ling Han.","Unfortunately, both Wang Jun and Li Hengming were powerless to refute. Otherwise, they would definitely curse loudly. They were the real victims, all right?","When Shu Zhengyang heard this, he revealed an uncaring expression, \"It’s fine. Putting aside the fact that it is only a Level 1 cultivator, even if it was a Level 6 cultivator, he would not dare enter into the martial academy to demand someone! Thus, Junior Brother Ling, you come to the academy tomorrow. With your natural talent, the academy would definitely not mind having you enroll ahead of time.\"","\"Of course, you still have to undergo another test.\"","Yang Qi was overjoyed, and he hurriedly pushed Ling Han, saying, \"Thank you, Senior Brother Shu!\"","Wang Jun and Li Hengming also heard this. They had secretly said that when they returned later, they would inform Wang Jun of this matter. Tomorrow, they would intercept Ling Han outside the martial academy. They definitely wouldn’t allow this guy to hide inside the martial academy.","\"Senior Brother, why don’t we have a meal together?\" Yang Qi invited earnestly.","\"Sure!\" Shu Zhengyang rubbed his stomach, \"I just happen to be a little hungry.\"","He beckoned with his hand, \"Get on.\"","\"All right!\" Yang Qi hurriedly pulled Ling Han into the car. This was the Senior Brother Disciple of the martial academy, so it would definitely be useful to maintain a good relationship with him."]},{"number":4919,"title":"Chapter 4919: Side Story -- City 07","paragraphs":["Ling Han and Yang Qi boarded the car, and Shu Zhengyang began speeding his car again.","He was a Level 1 cultivator, and after advancing into the level of a cultivator, his reaction speed and speed far surpassed ordinary people. Thus, though he had driven the car to above 150 km/h, there was only scares but no real danger.","In the meantime, a great many police officers began to pursue them, but they were easily thrown off their tail.","They chose a hotpot restaurant, sat down, and began to eat.","Even in the dire situation of the Foreign Beasts besieging the city, food was still everyone’s keenest interest. There were the most restaurants in the city, and they had all kinds of food.","At the dining table, the three of them chatted a lot.","Actually, it was mostly Yang Qi who was asking the questions, and Shu Zhengyang was answering. These questions were mainly related to the matters after entering the academy.","When they were almost done eating, Shu Zhengyang took his leave.","He was very polite towards Ling Han, because an eighteen-year-old pseudo-cultivator was really too rare. His future prospects were boundless.","Ling Han and Yang Qi returned to their respective homes. When Ling Han’s parents found out that he had passed the martial arts test, they were all extremely excited.","This meant that Ling Han had a chance of becoming a cultivator — though this hope was very vague, and once he became a cultivator, it meant that Ling Han would become one of the privileged.","They didn’t know that Ling Han’s current strength had already reached the level of a pseudo-cultivator. Otherwise, they would definitely be even more pleasantly surprised. This meant that it was already a sure bet that their son would become a cultivator.","After passing the martial arts test, there was no need for him to go to school to attend classes anymore. Added with the fact that they had a previous agreement with Shu Zhengyang, Ling Han met up with Yang Qi on the second day, heading to the academy.","They took a bus, and after several stops, the two of them alighted. They only had to walk another 200 meters to reach the academy.","The two of them arrived at the entrance of the academy. Looking at the words \"Zhou Su Martial Arts Academy\" on the plaque, they both felt rueful.","In the future, they would become one of these people.","\"Hey, two country bumpkins, what are you looking at?\" A voice rang out from behind them.","’Hmm?’","Yang Qi immediately turned around, only to see a young man standing behind them. He was only a few years older than them, and his arms were crossed before his chest. There was a look of disdain on his face.","He was naturally defiant, and hurriedly said, \"Could it be that we can’t just stand here and look?\"","\"This is the martial academy, a place that you can only look up to in your whole lives. Stop daydreaming.\" The young man waved his hand dismissively, wanting nothing more than to write the words ’disdain’ on his face.","Yang Qi was young and impetuous, so how could he withstand such provocation? \"We’re third year high school students, and we’ve already passed the martial arts exam. We’ll be able to enter this place soon!\"","\"You have only passed the assessment, and have not been accepted into the academy.\" The young man scoffed, \"Let me tell you, the quality of students nowadays is getting higher and higher year after year. Thus, if you have only just passed the assessment, there is at least an 80% chance that you would not be able to pass the assessment this time round!\"","What!","Yang Qi couldn’t help but gape in shock and anxiety.","He indeed knew that passing the martial arts test was only the first stage. Next, enrollment in the academy would be based on merit.","If it was really as the other party had said, then he was in a tight spot.","Unlike Ling Han, who was already a pseudo-cultivator, no matter how high the standards set by the academy were, he could still pass.","\"So, a piece of trash like you had best extinguish your desire to enter these doors as soon as possible,\" the young man said calmly. \"You can’t! You’re not worthy! You’re not qualified!\"","Yang Qi’s confidence had been shattered, and his expression was extremely dejected.","Ling Han shook his head, and pulled Yang Qi behind him, saying, \"Whether my friend is qualified to enter this door or not isn’t up to you, nor is it any of your business.\"","\"What is it? You want to stand up for him?\" The young man glanced at Ling Han, his eyes filled with provocation.","Ling Han’s expression was calm, and he said, \"We don’t know each other, yet you provoked us the moment we met. Thus, if you’re not under someone’s command, there’s something wrong with your brain.\"","The young man couldn’t help but feel his heart skip a beat. His guess was extremely accurate. He had indeed been commanded by someone, and that was why he had deliberately waited for Ling Han and Yang Qi today, deliberately provoking them.","He naturally would not admit it, and said calmly, \"If you have the guts, then fight me. If you don’t, then just shut your mouth obediently, and be a coward!\"","\"Ling Han!\" Yang Qi hurriedly stretched out a hand to pull Ling Han back. With Ling Han’s reminder, he also realized that there was something off with this young man. He was deliberately angering him.","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"Fine, let’s fight. If you lose, apologize to my friend!\"","\"All right.\" The young man nodded first, \"Then let’s sign a life-and-death contract, in case I can’t stop myself, and kill you, and still have to pay with my life!\"","When Yang Qi heard this, he hurriedly went to pull Ling Han back. At this point, if he still couldn’t tell that this was a trap, then he would really be too stupid.","Ling Han’s eyes froze over. He only had to apologize to Yang Qi, yet the latter was clearly trying to take his life.","\"All right!\" He nodded.","The young man smirked coldly, took out a tablet computer, and handed it over to Ling Han, \"Sign.\"","Yang Qi leaned over to take a look, and couldn’t help but feel even more furious. This life and death contract had already been prepared in advance, so wasn’t it still deliberately targeting him?","\"Ling Han, you can’t fall for it,\" he advised.","\"Don’t worry.\" Ling Han patted his shoulder, and said, \"The mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind. Right now, we still don’t know who the hunter is!\"","He stretched out a finger and signed his name on the tablet computer.","\"Hey, hey, hey. It seems like there’s going to be a duel over there.\"","\"What, with Ruan Zhiping?\"","\"He’s a third-year senior, and he’s also officially become a cultivator. Isn’t dueling with him courting death?\"","\"Which idiot would actually duel with Ruan Zhiping?\"","At the school gate, many people saw this scene, and they were all discussing spiritedly.","Hearing everyone’s words, Yang Qi couldn’t help but feel anxious. Pointing at Ruan Zhiping, he exclaimed, \"You are too treacherous!\"","If they had known that he was a cultivator, Ling Han wouldn’t have agreed to a duel with him.","Though Ling Han possessed the strength of a pseudo-cultivator, but compared with a real cultivator, the gap was definitely obvious.","\"Believe me!\" Ling Han said to Yang Qi. \"I think... I can do it!\"","\"Have you finished your last words?\" Ruan Zhiping asked coldly. The life and death contract had already been signed, so there was no need for him to pretend any longer.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"At first, I had only planned to have you bow your head and admit your mistake, but since you are so determined to seek death, then I shall oblige you.\"","\"Hahaha, your boasting is quite big.\" Ruan Zhiping sneered, and crooked a finger at Ling Han. \"Come on then.\"","Yang Qi still wanted to persuade him, yet Ling Han resolutely pushed him aside.","He was pacing around in panic, and only now did he suddenly recall Shu Zhengyang. Hurriedly, he took out his phone and began to dial.","Meanwhile, Ling Han looked at Ruan Zhiping. With every second, unfamiliar memories would appear in his mind, and his strength was also increasing at an astonishing speed.","Today, he was at least ten times stronger than yesterday.","\"Come on!\" Ling Han also crooked a finger at him.","How arrogant!","Ruan Zhiping humphed, and strode towards Ling Han.","He could kill a mere pseudo cultivator with a single punch."]},{"number":4920,"title":"Chapter 4920: Side Story -- City 08","paragraphs":["A fight was about to break out, and it was a duel at that.","All of a sudden, the martial academy’s students all gathered around, preparing to watch the excitement.","Ruan Zhiping didn’t unleash his full speed, but he didn’t slow down either. He quickly approached Ling Han, then suddenly threw a punch at Ling Han.","This punch was aimed directly at Ling Han’s head. This was obviously aiming to take his life.","Bursting his head with a single punch!","In this instant, countless memories appeared in Ling Han’s mind. Then, his eyes suddenly lit up, as if a bolt of lightning had flashed across a sunny day.","Ruan Zhiping was actually shocked by this gaze, and involuntarily stopped.","Then, he flew into a humiliated rage.","He was a Level 1 cultivator, and he had killed Foreign Beasts outside the city before, so his hands were covered in blood.","But now, he was actually intimidated by a single look from Ling Han. This was really utterly humiliating.","Aside from feeling angry and embarrassed, he also did not understand why an ordinary high school student would actually possess such a terrifying gaze.","At this moment, Ling Han threw a punch at Ruan Zhiping.","This punch looked very ordinary in the eyes of others, extremely ordinary, but Ruan Zhiping’s feeling was completely different.","He felt as if all his paths of retreat had been cut off, and he couldn’t even parry.","It was as if this punch was destined, and the only thing he could do was take this punch.","Peng!","With this punch, Ruan Zhiping seemed to have become stupid. He did not know how to dodge, nor did he know how to parry. Naturally, he could only be hit by the punch. His whole person was sent flying, and he was sent flying at an incredibly fast speed.","There was a loud bang, and his head crashed into the doors of the academy. A terrifying power exploded, and his head was instantly shattered.","What!","Seeing this scene, the surrounding students were all dumbfounded.","Though signing a life-and-death contract was naturally taking responsibility for one’s own life, the majority of duels would not result in death. As long as one admitted defeat in time, though it was possible that one would be injured or crippled, he was completely capable of preserving his life.","Thus, the sudden death of this person was far beyond everyone’s expectations.","All of this happened too quickly. It was only a single punch, and Ruan Zhiping had already died. The strength of both sides were on completely different levels.","Why?","Ruan Zhiping seemed to have become stupid. He did not dodge or parry this punch, as if he was deliberately giving up his life.","They had seen people who gifted gifts, gave money, or even actually gave their wives away, but to deliberately give their lives... this was really something they had never seen before.","Everyone whispered among themselves, all talking about their own shock. This was really too baffling.","Only Yang Qi wore an expression of pleasant surprise. He hadn’t imagined that Ling Han would not only win, but also win so easily.","He clenched his fists tightly, appearing to be extremely excited.","Though Ling Han had killed someone in public, both parties had signed a life and death contract. This had a legal effect. No one could cause trouble for Ling Han because of this.","However, he was also extremely shocked. Yesterday, Ling Han had only defeated a pseudo-cultivator, yet today, he had easily insta-killed a Level 1 cultivator. Then, would he be able to defeat a Level 2 tomorrow, and a Level 1 the day after?","As Ling Han’s friend, he knew Ling Han best, but it was precisely because of this that he realized that he didn’t know Ling Han at all.","\"To dare commit murder in front of the academy gates of the martial academy, Ling Han, how dare you!\" A voice rang out behind Ling Han, carrying an incredibly harsh tone.","Ling Han looked over, only to see four people walking toward him. However, one of them was sitting in a wheelchair.","That was Wang Hanchen. Aside from him, there was also Wang Jun and Li Hengming — their right arms were heavily bandaged.","There was only one person that Ling Han had never seen before. This person looked to be in his thirties, and was not very tall, but his whole person exuded an indescribable feeling of power.","Wang Jun, Wang Jun’s younger brother, a Level 1 cultivator!","No, he had completed the breakthrough from Level 1 to Level 2 last night, and was already a Level 2 cultivator. It was just that he had not reported this to the military yet.","It was him who had spoken just now, his expression baleful and menacing, filled with killing intent.","Yang Qi hurriedly defended Ling Han and said, \"Ling Han and Ruan Zhiping signed a life and death contract. Even if someone died in battle, that would be their own responsibility.\"","\"Oh, where’s the life-and-death contract?\" Wang Jun asked calmly, but his eyes were incredibly vicious.","Yang Qi hurriedly picked up the tablet computer. However, after flipping through it for a while, his expression changed drastically.","The life and death contract had disappeared!","How was this possible? He had clearly seen clearly just now that no one had approached the tablet at all. It was definitely impossible for anyone to have erased it.","\"What is it? You can’t find it?\" Wang Jun smirked coldly, \"I am a member of the military. When I encounter a criminal who commits murder in public, I can execute him on the spot!\"","\"No, there is a life-and-death contract. Let me search again!\" Yang Qi hurriedly said. He started to search on the tablet again.","\"There’s no need to look,\" Ling Han said. Then, he looked at Wang Jun, and said, \"That idiot just now should have come to provoke us under your command. If I was beaten to death by him, the life and death contract would exist in this computer. On the other hand... you would be able to control it from afar and erase that life and death contract, right?\"","Yang Qi instantly became anxious upon hearing this. This was far too despicable!","Wang Jun faltered slightly. He had not thought that Ling Han would react so quickly.","He naturally wouldn’t admit it. He merely sneered, and walked towards Ling Han.","There was no life or death contract — then it was definitely impossible to find. It had indeed been erased through remote control, and it was definitely impossible to recover. Thus, Ling Han was a murderer. As a member of the military, he naturally had every reason to make a move.","Though Ling Han’s victory had surprised him slightly, and in fact, he had even insta-killed Ruan Zhiping with a single punch, he was still a Level 2 cultivator.","What kind of concept was this?","Completely suppressing a Level 1 cultivator!","Thus, he was naturally filled with confidence, and did not think at all that he would not be able to kill Ling Han.","\"Ling Han, do you regret it now?\" Wang Hanchen said through gritted teeth. \"My uncle officially advanced to Level 2 last night. In front of him, you can’t even withstand a single blow!\"","What!","Yang Qi’s eyes instantly widened in shock. ’Level 2! He’s actually a Level 2!’","In his eyes, a Level 1 cultivator was like an Immortal. A Level 2 cultivator was an unimaginable existence.","Though Ling Han’s performance just now had been extraordinary, faced with a Level 2 cultivator... it was completely impossible for him to have any hope of winning.","Where was Shu Zhengyang? Why hadn’t he come yet?","Now, he could only place his hopes on this Senior Brother.","Ling Han smiled at Yang Qi, and said, \"There’s no need to be so tense. He’s merely a Level 2 cultivator.\"","A mere Level 2?","Wang Jun raised a brow, \"How boastful. In your eyes, a Level 2 cultivator is only worthy of the evaluation of ’merely’! Fine, I’ll let you see how powerful a mere Level 2 cultivator can be!\"","\"Ling Han, regret it in hell!\" Wang Hanchen shouted loudly. At present, his hatred towards Ling Han could not be described with words. Thus, though his injuries were extremely severe, he still insisted on personally witnessing Ling Han’s death.","Wang Jun and Li Hengming both smirked coldly. Wang Jun had moved, and Ling Han’s only fate would definitely be death. Furthermore, Wang Jun was in the right now. Even if he killed Ling Han in public, that would be considered within reason and legal anywhere.","As expected, the older one was, the wiser they were. They had initially thought that it was superfluous for Wang Jun to plant the virus in Ruan Zhiping’s computer, but who would have thought that it would have such an amazing effect now?","By the looks of it now, this step was truly amazing."]},{"number":4921,"title":"Chapter 4921: Side Story -- City 09","paragraphs":["Hearing such boastful words from Ling Han, the students at the entrance were also stunned.","A Level 2 cultivator, what kind of concept was that?","Was it difficult to become a cultivator?","It would be difficult!","Being accepted into the martial academywas only the first step. Moreover, only 30% of the students could become pseudo-cultivators in their second year of university, and only 10% of the students could truly become cultivators in their third year.","It could be said that the majority of students would only be pseudo cultivators when they graduated in their fourth year. They would need to fight in actual battle for many years, and only then would it be possible for them to become a cultivator.","A Level 1 cultivator!","With this in mind, just how valuable was a Level 2 cultivator?","Of course, there were prodigies everywhere. For example, in the academy of Zhou Su City’s martial arts academy, there were also Level 2 or even Level 3 students, but this was really an existence as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns. There were pitifully few of them. Once they graduated, they would definitely directly enter into an important position in the army.","Thus, Ling Han actually boldly declared that he was merely a Level 2 cultivator. How could this not make people laugh their heads off?","’Oh, do you think that just because you killed a Level 1 cultivator, you can look down on Level 2 cultivators?’","How naive. A Level 2 cultivator could completely crush a Level 1 cultivator; there was no comparison at all!","There were nine levels in cultivation, and every difference of a single level was like the distance between heaven and earth.","Wang Jun walked towards Ling Han. His speed was very slow, but his steps were very steady, exuding a terrifying pressure. He was like a fierce tiger that had set its eyes on its prey, causing its prey to not even have the thought of fleeing.","Even the faces of the surrounding students had turned pale, and they all stepped back.","They were shocked. This was a Level 2 cultivator; he was too terrifying.","And it should be known that Wang Jun was not as simple as any Level 2 cultivator. He had also fought his way out of seas of corpses and blood, which naturally formed killing intent. It was almost tangible, and could be intimidating.","He deliberately walked very slowly. This was exerting pressure on Ling Han. If Ling Han’s willpower was slightly weaker, he might even directly collapse from fright.","However, Ling Han remained calm and composed.","In the memories that he suddenly recalled, even a great elite that could shatter a planet with a single punch could only be shattered with a single thought from him. Calling a Level 2 cultivator ’merely’ was really not a boast, but merely the truth.","\"Pretentious!\" Wang Jun sneered, and suddenly sped up, charging towards Ling Han.","So fast!","Everyone felt their vision blur, and saw that Wang Jun had already rushed in front of Ling Han, his fist blasting towards the top of Ling Han’s head.","Hiss, was this the speed of a Level 2 cultivator?","A Level 1 cultivator couldn’t compare at all. If it was any of them, they wouldn’t even know how they had died.","Sigh, Ling Han was definitely done for.","Furthermore, the life and death contract had mysteriously disappeared. Even if Ling Han died, he would have died for nothing. In fact, Wang Jun’s actions to execute him could be considered a meritorious service.","Boom, the punch had already arrived.","Ling Han didn’t even blink as he stared at Wang Jun. This was truly an ant.","The punch arrived, yet it came to an abrupt stop.","—It was blocked by a single finger.","’Holy f*ck!’","Seeing this scene, everyone was numb with shock.","How was this possible?","The attack of a Level 2 cultivator was actually blocked by a single finger.","Was this for real?","’Are you two sure you’re not putting on an act together?’","Wang Jun was also incredibly stunned. He hadn’t used his full strength in this punch, but he had already advanced into Level 2. This punch could still insta-kill a Level 1.","Could it be that... Ling Han was also a Level 2?","Hiss, this guy was pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger. He was really hiding too deeply, wasn’t he?","Wang Jun, Wang Hanchen and Li Hengming’s eyes also widened. They felt like their outlook on life was about to collapse.","Especially Wang Jun and his son. It should be known that a year ago, they had personally witnessed Ling Han humiliatingly apologize to them.","It had only been a year, and this young man had gone from an ordinary person to a Level 2 cultivator?","Who could believe this?","This was practically a freak.","If he had known this earlier, then no matter how lecherous Wang Hanchen was, he would not have had any designs on Ling Han’s girlfriend — to steal the woman of a Level 2 cultivator, just how bold was he?","Wang Jun calmed down, and immediately cast aside the doubts and reservations in his heart.","Now that things had come to this, it was inevitable that the arrow was already drawn.","If he didn’t kill Ling Han this time, just how powerful would Ling Han be in another year or two?","Level 3? Level 4?","Thus, taking advantage of the fact that Ling Han wasn’t especially strong yet, and with the evidence of him \"committing a crime in public\" in his hands, this was the best chance to settle the matter once and for all. Otherwise, in future, the Wang Clan would have to worry about Ling Han taking revenge on them.","’Die!’","He roared softly, and suddenly drew his saber.","This was a curved blade. It wasn’t long, and the blade was only about a foot long. However, it was forged from super-fitted steel, and was extremely sharp. Even the thick skin of a Level 1 Foreign Beast, the Iron Bull Rhinoceros, could be easily sliced open.","Cultivators were very proficient at earning money, and Wang Jun spent most of his income on this saber.","Having spent so much money, it was naturally worth it.","Die!","Shua, a cold light flashed, and the curved saber swept towards Ling Han’s lower abdomen, intending to disembowel Ling Han.","Ling Han still had his hands behind his back, looking calm and composed.","’Haha, you’re far too arrogant and haughty. You’re seeking death!’","Wang Jun smirked coldly. With his incredibly rich battle experience, he was 100% sure that Ling Han was already a corpse.","However, an instant later, he shockingly discovered that his hand seemed to have fallen into iron pincers, and could no longer move.","He looked down, and saw that the thin blade had been caught between two fingers.","Heavens!","He was absolutely stunned, but the countless battles caused him to instinctively react. With a twist of his hand, the blade sliced towards Ling Han’s fingers.","At this moment, it was as if he could already foresee Ling Han’s fingers falling off, one after another.","However, he shockingly discovered that the saber’s blade did not move in the slightest.","Hiss, what kind of terrifying power was this?","It was just a pinch between two fingers, but it was like the blade had grown roots, and could not be moved in the slightest.","How was this possible?","This time, Wang Jun was really shocked to the core. He had used his full strength in that attack just now, and added with the help of his weapon, he actually still did not succeed.","His power could be ranked in the late stage of Level 2, or even Level 3!","A high school student actually possessed such terrifying abilities. Who would believe it? Who would dare believe it?","Not only Wang Jun, but the others were also numb with shock. They could barely believe their eyes.","This was heaven-defying. This was heaven-defying!","Wang Jun resolutely abandoned his saber. At this moment, they were too close, so whether it was his fist or palm, it was not easy to exert force. He immediately bent his arm, and at the same time, took a step forwards with his right foot, using his elbow to crash towards Ling Han’s abdomen.","This was the display of battle experience, making the most correct choice in a split second.","Peng!","However, Ling Han raised his foot, and Wang Jun was sent flying. Then, he fell heavily onto the ground, coughing up large mouthfuls of blood, right until he spat out his internal organs. He collapsed dejectedly, his eyes still wide open.","He had died with remaining grievances. He had definitely died with remaining grievances. It should be known that he had just broken through to Level 2, and had initially been about to walk to a new height. Who would have thought that his life would suddenly end like this?"]},{"number":4922,"title":"Chapter 4922: Side Story -- City 10","paragraphs":["Ling Han’s actions were incredibly simple. He merely stretched out his hand, kicked out his foot, and then a Level 2 cultivator died.","What did this mean?","He was completely overwhelmed by his abilities!","Heavens, then what level was Ling Han?","Late stage of Level 2? Or even... Level 3?","It should be known that he was only a high school senior student.","Everyone was transfixed with shock. They couldn’t believe their eyes.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","Meanwhile, Wang Jun and his son were trembling in fear. Wang Jun’s death was equivalent to Wang Jun having one less pillar of <anno data-annotation-id=\"007e8bea-1803-4e85-a825-213d8314f73a\" data-title=\"support\">support 1 </anno>. The sky was about to collapse.","Why was it like this?","At this moment, Wang Jun really wanted to beat his son to death. Why did this idiot have to become enemies with Ling Han?","Now, it was great. Wang Jun was dead, and Wang Hanchen’s chance of entering the academy this year was also gone. In fact, his chance of entering the academy would be gone forever. Then, would the Wang Clan still have any hope of rising?","Without the support of Wang Jun, how long could he continue to be the Deputy Minister?","There were a great many people who were envious and wanted to replace him.","At this time, Ling Han turned his eyes towards this father and son pair and Li Hengming.","\"I have already spared your lives, yet you all are still so overbearing. Do you think that I am an easy target to bully?\" His baleful voice rang out, as he walked towards the three of them.","\"You, you, what do you want to do?\" Wang Jun asked in a trembling voice.","\"I’ll send you on your way!\" Ling Han raised his fist.","\"No, you can’t kill us! To commit a crime in public, you have completely no regard for the law, so don’t even think about living!\" Wang Jun shouted loudly. In order to survive, he had overcome the fear in his heart.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, \"I’ve already committed murder, so what difference does it make if I kill one more or one less?\"","\"Run!\" Wang Jun hurriedly turned around and ran, and Li Hengming’s speed was much faster than his. After all, he was a pseudo-cultivator. However, it was hard on Wang Hanchen. How could he flee in a wheelchair? He could only use both hands to push the wheels.","Needless to say, humans could unleash astonishing potential when they were seeking survival. Wang Hanchen was actually quite fast in pushing the wheelchair.","However, what use was this?","Ling Han made his move. Peng! Peng! Peng! With three punches, Wang Jun and his son, as well as Li Hengming, all collapsed onto the ground. There was an obvious indentation on their backs, and it was obvious that their hearts had all exploded.","It hadn’t been long, and five people had already died by his hand. In fact, there were two cultivators and one pseudo-cultivator among them.","At the entrance, everyone was as silent as cicadas in the cold, completely rendered speechless.","\"How dare you, to actually commit a crime in front of the academy gates!\" A baleful voice rang out, carrying a strong displeasure.","Ling Han turned around, only to see a group of four people walking out the main doors. One of them was none other than Shu Zhengyang.","\"Administrative members of the student union!\"","\"The Vice-President, Zhou Zheng!\"","\"Administrative, Shu Zhengyang.\"","\"Administrative, Lin Ce.\"","The students spoke one after another, looking reverent.","The student union of the martial arts academy would be completely different from the student unions of other academies. The requirements for acceptance were much higher.","First of all, only cultivators were qualified to enter, and this alone was enough to make 90% of students not qualified to enter the student union even until graduation. As for other requirements, there were even more.","In short, being able to enter into the student union represented outstanding strength.","Thus, the vice-president and staff members of the student union were naturally even more awesome.","Shu Zhengyang was also stunned, as well as feeling very awkward.","Previously, when he had received news from Yang Qi, he had coincidentally been in the student union for a meeting. Thus, he had not paid much attention at first. It was only when Yang Qi had announced that someone was about to die, that he ran out.","He was afraid that he wouldn’t be able to suppress Wang Jun, so he also brought out the Vice-President and the others. In the end, he saw Ling Han committing a crime.","How could he bear with that?","Ling Han looked towards Zhou Zheng. It was him that had shouted at him just now.","\"These people are scheming against me. You’ll find out after some investigation,\" he said calmly. \"Before finding out the truth of the matter, don’t use your own justifications to randomly accuse others.\"","\"Impudence! No matter how many reasons you have, you are not allowed to commit murder in front of the academy gates!\" Zhou Zheng said balefully. \"Are you going to surrender yourself, or do I have to move to apprehend you?\"","\"Senior Brother Zhou is about to make a move!\"","\"In the academy, it is already very rare to see Senior Brother Zhou making a move.\"","\"Hehe, Senior Brother Zhou is a Level 3 cultivator. Aside from Li Chenghai, the student union’s President, who else in the academy is a match for him?\"","\"Senior Brother Zhou was famous for being merciless in the past. If Senior Brother Zhou really makes a move, this guy would definitely be in trouble.\"","The students began to discuss spiritedly again, all of them optimistic about Zhou Zheng, even if Ling Han had just kicked a Level 2 cultivator like Wang Jun to death.","There were no more than five students who had reached this level in the academy of Zhou Su City. In fact, some teachers with weaker abilities were only Level 3.","Ling Han shook his head, \"I won’t choose either!\"","\"Humph, that is not up to you to decide!\" Zhou Zheng shouted lightly, and was just about to make a move.","\"Old Zhou, give me some face!\" Shu Zhengyang hurriedly stepped out to stop him, then winked at Ling Han. \"Junior Brother Ling, when it’s time to admit defeat, you have to bow your head!\"","\"Ling Han!\" Yang Qi also ran over, and said, \"That’s a Level 3 cultivator! You definitely can’t be rash again!\"","\"I think... I can,\" Ling Han said to Yang Qi. He was brimming with confidence.","This line again!","Yang Qi didn’t know what else to say. Previously, Ling Han had also said that he could do it, yet in the end, he had beaten Wang Jun to death. Now, he was saying this again. Could it be that he was going to perform another miracle?","\"Shu Zhengyang, get lost,\" Zhou Zheng said coldly. Previously, he had given Shu Zhengyang face, yet Ling Han did not know what was good for him at all. Thus, he was now furious, and wanted to apprehend Ling Han.","Shu Zhengyang didn’t dare to persuade him anymore. How terrifying would it be for a Level 3 cultivator to be angered?","He did not dare to trifle with this misfortune.","Zhou Zheng strode towards Ling Han. The aura of a Level 3 cultivator fluctuated, forming a terrifying pressure.","He was different from Wang Jun. He had not walked out from a sea of blood. Thus, this intimidation naturally did not possess overflowing killing intent. However, he was a Level 3 cultivator, and his aura was much stronger than Wang Jun’s.","Instantly, the surrounding students felt as if there was a hand gripped tightly around their necks, making it difficult for them to breathe.","Ling Han’s expression was calm, and there was a strong indifference in his eyes as he looked at Zhou Zheng, as if the latter was only an ant.","\"You are really arrogant!\" Zhou Zheng shouted angrily, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Ling Han said calmly. He threw a punch at Zhou Zheng.","Peng!","Instantly, Zhou Zheng was seen stumbling backwards. In terms of power, he was actually no match for Ling Han.","This, this, this, this, this, everyone was dumbfounded, completely unable to believe their eyes.","Someone as powerful as Zhou Zheng was actually no match for Ling Han?","That was a Level 3 cultivator!","\"F***, this is too freakish!\" Shu Zhengyang muttered. He knew that Ling Han was very freakish. At eighteen years old, he already possessed the strength of a pseudo cultivator.","But to be honest, even in the academy, this could only be considered very strong, but he was definitely not the only one. For example, Zhou Zheng had also become a pseudo cultivator in his third year of high school.","Thus, he had a very high opinion of Ling Han, but definitely had no intention of betting his entire family and life.","But now... he realized that he had far underestimated this future junior.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">The ’Wang Jun’ refers to the cultivator, and the second ’Wang Jun’ refers to the Deputy Minister. Their names have different Chinese characters, but sound the same.</annotations>"]},{"number":4923,"title":"Chapter 4923: Side Story -- City 11","paragraphs":["Zhou Zheng did not dare believe this.","He was the vice-president of the student union, and was more so a Level 3 cultivator. Yet, he was actually blocked by a young man who hadn’t even entered the martial academy yet.","How could he endure this?","Did he not care about his pride?","\"You do have some abilities. No wonder you dare to be so arrogant!\" he said through gritted teeth. He was already truly angered, his aura burning fiercely, as if he wanted to devour someone. \"However, the stronger you are, the more I want to take you down. Otherwise, since you dare to kill in public today, you would dare to rebel against humanity tomorrow!\"","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. \"I’ve only killed a few people who wanted to harm me. Is there any need to go so far?\"","Zhou Zheng humphed coldly, \"Tell these words to the people in the security office!\"","With a leap, he charged towards Ling Han.","He definitely had to capture Ling Han, and only then would he be able to redeem his name.","Ling Han shook his head, and stretched out a hand to control the air. A terrifying scene appeared, and Zhou Zheng seemed to have been suppressed by some kind of power. With a bang, he knelt heavily onto the ground.","This kneel actually shattered his knees, and the sound of bones breaking could be heard clearly. Blood was also seeping out from his knees.","Hiss!","A dead silence instantly fell over the area.","That was Zhou Zheng!","Not only had he been defeated, he had been defeated in such a humiliating manner. What was even more shocking was the fact that Ling Han had not even touched him. He had merely stretched out a hand and pressed down, and Zhou Zheng had been forced to kneel by the power he exerted from afar.","Are you a demon?","\"Capable of unleashing power outside the body, Medium Grade cultivator!\" At this moment, a senior student said in a trembling voice, feeling an indescribable excitement.","Not many people knew about the words \"unleashing power outside the body\", but every student knew what Medium Grade cultivator meant.","Level 1, Level 2, and Level 3 cultivators were also called Low Grade cultivators, while Level 4, Level 5, and Level 6 cultivators were Medium Grade cultivators. Low Grade cultivators and Medium Grade cultivators were two completely different concepts. Taking this step was as difficult as ascending the heavens.","Similarly, Level 7, Level 8 and Level 9 cultivators were also called High Grade cultivators. This was another level of existence, and the number of High Grade cultivators on the entire planet could be counted.","Releasing power outside the body was the symbol of Medium Grade cultivators.","Everyone was dumbfounded as they looked at Ling Han. None of them could speak.","Fifty years after the mutation of heaven and earth began, there were only a total of three students in the academy of Zhou Su City who had reached Level 4 upon graduation, and advanced into the ranks of Medium Grade cultivators.","Ling Han was the fourth.","But the point was, those three students had only reached Medium Grade after graduating, and what about Ling Han? He hadn’t even enrolled into the martial academy yet!","Then what level would he be able to reach when he graduated?","Level 5? Or even Level 6!","If he advanced another step further, and reached Level 7... Heavens, a High Grade cultivator!","Zhou Zheng had also forgotten his pain. He raised his head to look at Ling Han, his face filled with disbelief.","This was actually a Medium Grade cultivator!","Heavens, with such a young Level 4 cultivator, as long as he did not rebel against humanity, even if he killed a few more people, the government would still think of ways to turn a big issue into a small one, and turn a small issue into nothing.","He was too prodigious. If he was properly nurtured, it was very possible that he would become the saviour of the entire human race.","However, it was also a fact that he had committed a crime right in front of the academy gates of the martial academy, which made all the students feel embarrassed.","\"Ling, Ling Han!\" A high voice rang out, and a young girl dressed fashionably appeared. She had taken a cab here, and had just gotten out of the car, and was currently looking around with an inconceivable gaze.","Dead people!","In broad daylight, and at the entrance of the martial academy at that, a considerable number of people had actually died. Wasn’t this just a dream?","Ling Han looked over, and couldn’t help but feel slightly surprised, because this young girl was his ex-girlfriend, Zhu Yan.","Why had she come here?","\"I called her over,\" Yang Qi said. \"She said she didn’t believe that you entered the academy, so I told her to come see for herself and make her regret her actions!\"","Ling Han was unconcerned.","In his eyes, Zhu Yan was already a thing of the past, and was no longer worthy of a second glance from him.","However, when he was called, he was called. He would not deliberately avoid her, or chase her away. He couldn’t even be bothered to say anything mocking.","Zhu Yan didn’t believe that Ling Han had become a pseudo-cultivator at all, but she had just gotten off the carriage when she heard the discussions of others. Ling Han was actually a Medium Grade cultivator!","Medium Grade cultivator, what kind of concept was that?","That was an existence that surpassed all others. Furthermore, he was an eighteen-year-old Medium Grade cultivator, so where would his future limit be?","High Grade?","Once he became a High Grade cultivator, Ling Han would be superior to tens of thousands of people.","In comparison, what was Wang Hanchen worth?","\"Ling Han, I was wrong. I still love you. Let me return to your side, all right?\" She immediately adjusted her emotions, a pitiful expression appearing on her face.","\"Are you worthy?\" A cold voice rang out, and a woman in white walked over.","She was dressed in a white dress, and was as graceful as a celestial maiden. There was not a single ornament on her body. Her raven black hair naturally hung down, and her feet were bare, as white as jade. However, her beautiful face was breathtakingly beautiful.","The strange thing was that her feet were clearly bare, but her jade-like feet were incredibly white, without the slightest bit of dust.","\"The Empress!\"","\"The Empress has actually come out.\"","\"My Empress!\"","The students all looked like they were about to go crazy. They wanted nothing more than to kneel down and worship the woman in white.","Ling Han also looked over. When his eyes swept over the beautiful face of the woman in white, endless memories instantly exploded in his mind. He remembered everything.","\"Who are you?\" Zhu Yan asked the woman in white, and couldn’t help but look stunned.","She was so beautiful that she felt inferior.","The empress walked over. Pa, with a slap, Zhu Yan was sent flying, like a kite with a broken string.","What was going on?","Everyone was surprised, because they had never seen the empress actually make a move to hit someone!","In their impression, the empress was an incredibly proud existence. In fact, she was so proud that even hitting others would dirty her hands.","And it was this empress that had actually struck a woman?","Inconceivable! This was too inconceivable. This was really something that could only be seen after living for a long time.","\"Are you worthy of such an outstanding man?\" the empress asked coldly. Then, without another glance at Zhu Yan, she quickly walked towards Ling Han.","What was the meaning of this?","How could it be!","No!","Everyone wanted to shout loudly. The empress was a teacher that had just entered into the academy, but the moment she entered into the academy, she had won the admiration of all the teachers and students, and her attraction did not differentiate between men and women.","But now, the empress was charging towards Ling Han. What was the meaning of this?","At this moment, Ling Han also spread open his arms and embraced the empress.","The two of them embraced tightly.","No!","Seeing this scene, everyone wanted to cry. This was the goddess of everyone in the academy, yet now, she had thrown herself into the arms of a man.","So hateful! So hateful! So hateful!","In just a short while, Ling Han had become everyone’s public enemy. They wanted nothing more than to castrate him, inch by inch.","Ling Han embraced the empress, and all his memories returned.","He came from the last Stacked Era, and watched the birth of this universe in this Stacked Era. He would also watch the destruction of this universe in this Stacked Era, while he himself was eternally indestructible.","Because he was invincible and bored, he chose to seal his memories and run to this planet to become an ordinary person. Now, his memories had completely returned."]},{"number":4924,"title":"Chapter 4924: Side Story -- City 12","paragraphs":["\"Are we going back?\" the empress asked.","This time, they didn’t set out with their entire family. Instead, a limited number of people secretly ran out for a small trip.","\"Since you’re already here, why don’t you stay for a few more days and settle the matters here?\" Ling Han said, a sharp look in his eyes.","After this Stacked Era began, Ling Han secretly spread his knowledge of martial arts and formulated the corresponding Regulations.","High level civilizations could not interfere with the evolution of low-level civilizations. This was an ironclad rule.","But now, he discovered that the evolution of this planet had been disturbed.","—The sudden change was the result of man-made interference.","This planet had not experienced any kind of ancient war, but rather was very poor by nature in terms of Spiritual Qi. Theoretically speaking, there shouldn’t have been any evolution of martial arts, and could only take the path of technology.","But now, the Spiritual Qi had suddenly increased tenfold or a hundredfold, causing both wild beasts and humans to evolve. Naturally, there was a mastermind behind all this.","With Ling Han’s abilities, as long as he released his divine sense, he would be able to envelop the entire universe. However, since he was already engrossed in this game, he naturally wouldn’t mind playing.","\"All right.\" The empress nodded gently, and snuggled into Ling Han’s arms, as obedient as a cat.","How detestable!","Everyone wanted nothing more than to rush up and take a few bites, and dismember Ling Han.","This was too much of a b@stard. That was everyone’s goddess, so how could you blaspheme her?","At this time, the leaders of the police and the academy were also alerted, and appeared one after another.","Logically speaking, Ling Han should have returned to the police station to record his statement after committing murder in public. However, he had already proven his strength.","A Level 4 cultivator!","This was too awesome, breaking the record of the Zhou Su City’s martial academy. When he graduated, what heights would he reach?","Hence, the academy naturally had to do their utmost to protect this kind of prodigy. With a personal call from the headmaster, Ling Han was allowed to stay in the academy for the investigation.","What level was the Headmaster of the martial academy?","The weight of a High Grade Level 8 cultivator was far too heavy.","Thus, the police force had no choice but to give face to this high-ranked cultivator. They only said that before the results of the investigation were out, they definitely could not allow Ling Han to leave the city.","In truth, the area outside the city was filled with wild beasts, so where could one go outside the city?","Soon, the results of the investigation were out. It was indeed deliberate targeting from the Wang Clan, including the records of the transfer of funds from Wang Jun to Ruan Zhiping.","Thus, Ling Han had only received some verbal reprimands. He shouldn’t have been too ruthless, but as for other things... he was completely fine.","This was the special privilege of cultivators.","Compared to a Level 4 cultivator who had boundless future prospects, what was a mere Level 2, Level 1 or pseudo cultivator worth?","At Ling Han’s request, Yang Qi was also accepted into the martial academy in advance. He had been in a daze the entire day; how had his childhood friend suddenly become so powerful?","And Ling Han had also become a legend of the academy all of a sudden.","—He had not even officially enrolled into the academy, and was already a Level 4 cultivator. This was practically unprecedented, and would never be seen again in future. Furthermore, what was even more enthralling was the fact that he had courted the goddess of the academy the moment he appeared. This was what made people feel the most bitter and hateful.","Less than two days later, someone from the military suddenly came, wanting to join forces with the academy to destroy the lair of a high-level Foreign Beast.","This was also a training trip for the students. Thus, the main force was high-ranked cultivators, but they would also bring a lot of low-ranked students.","After some discussion, the leaders of the academy agreed to this joint mission.","The candidates were quickly chosen. Though Ling Han was a pseudo-new student, because his cultivation level was as high as Level 4, he had naturally entered into the main list of candidates. Accompanying him was the empress. She was presently a High Level teacher of the academy, and the cultivation level that she had reported had reached Level 6, which was considerably higher than even Ling Han.","Soldiers were naturally swift and resolute in their actions. On this side, the moment the academy prepared itself, the military immediately sent out personnel, who arrived at the entrance of the academy.","This time, the academy had mobilized 12 students. Aside from Ling Han, a pseudo-new student, the others were all elites, and had reached at least Level 1. Additionally, there were also five teachers, and the one in charge was the vice-principal, Ge Hui, a Level 7 High Grade cultivator.","And in the case of the army, they had similarly mobilized twelve young soldiers, and there were also five Medium and High Grade cultivators standing guard among them.","\"Principal Ge, long time no see,\" a military elite greeted Ge Hui. He was about forty years old, and was at the peak of his life. His vitality was extremely vigorous.","\"General Tan!\" Ge Hui also greeted him. His name was Tan Yuan, and he had the military rank of a major general. He was a Level 7 High Grade cultivator, and was of the same level as himself.","The two big shots began to chat casually, and the others also greeted each other.","\"I heard that your academy took in a prodigy who even killed two soldiers of our army!\" a young man from the army suddenly said.","Though he had used the word \"heard\", his eyes were fixed on Ling Han.","Obviously, he had seen Ling Han’s information before, and had directly locked onto his target.","Though Wang Jun and Li Hengming were the culprits, to the military, the fact that these two people had been killed by Ling Han was still an extremely great humiliation.","Thus, this young warrior could not wait to draw his sword.","—Wang Jun and Li Hengming indeed deserved to die, but the military had to get their pride back.","Ling Han glanced at this young man, then shifted his gaze, treating this person like air.","\"How arrogant!\" That young soldier smirked coldly, \"My name is Xiao Hu, and my current military rank is Second Lieutenant, a Level 3 cultivator. Do you dare battle me?\"","Level 3 cultivator!","This cultivation level was a little scary. In the martial academy, this cultivation level could squeeze into the top ten. Obviously, the military had also sent out elite recruits this time.","However, the strength that Ling Han had displayed to the outside world was Level 4, and the gap between Level 3 and Level 4 was a qualitative leap. Xiao Hu would definitely be aware of this fact, yet still dared to challenge Ling Han, so what kind of backing did he have?","\"Hehe, it is inevitable that young people would be competitive,\" Tan Yuan said with a smile. \"However, we cultivators grow through fighting. If we don’t have that kind of fighting spirit, all of us should just become clerical staff!\"","\"Headmaster Ge, let the two youngsters spar for a while.\"","He was a Level 7 High Grade cultivator, and since he had spoken, anyone would have to give him some face.","Thus, Ge Hui only paused slightly, then nodded, \"All right.\"","Though he felt that it was illogical for a Level 3 cultivator to challenge a Level 4 cultivator, he himself was a Level 7 cultivator, and knew very well just how massive the gap was between Level 4 and Level 3.","Thus, as long as Ling Han wasn’t too careless, he would definitely win this battle.","Since he would definitely win, he naturally would not mind a battle.","Xiao Hu immediately jumped out, pointed at Ling Han and said, \"Come!\"","Yet Ling Han had absolutely no intention of making a move. He stated calmly, \"You are unqualified!\"","Unqualified?","Xiao Hu was naturally enraged. Just how much was he looking down on him?","\"Young man, it’s just a fight, so it won’t take too much time,\" Tan Yuan said to Ling Han. He then joked, \"Just treat it as giving me some face?\"","\"Why should I give you face?\" Ling Han retorted directly."]},{"number":4925,"title":"Chapter 4925: Side Story -- City 13","paragraphs":["’What?’","Hearing Ling Han’s words, everyone was first taken aback, and then inhaled sharply.","Who was Tan Yuan?","To say nothing of the Hua Nation, even in the entire world, a High Grade Level 7 cultivator was still a lofty existence.","Ling Han was indeed very freakish. He had already reached Level 4 at the mere age of eighteen, but compared with Tan Yuan, they were on two completely different levels.","Thus, what right did Ling Han have to not give Tan Yuan face?","Tan Yuan was also filled with disbelief. He had only been joking casually, and Ling Han had actually rebuked him so harshly.","He couldn’t help but show a baleful expression, but did not show his anger. Instead, he looked towards Ge Hui, and said, \"Headmaster Ge, the students of your esteemed academy are really well-defined, showing off their abilities!\"","These words were definitely not meant to praise Ling Han.","Ge Hui hadn’t expected Ling Han to be so arrogant either. ’You’re only at Level 4, so how do you dare to face a Level 7 elite so head-on?’","’Do you have any brains?’","Did he really think that just because he was an eighteen-year-old Level 4 cultivator, he could do as he pleased?","Did he really think that everyone in the world would cherish him?","In this era, martial arts was the most important. Level 7 elites could crush Level 4. No matter how bright your future was, before you became the strongest, you had to adhere to the rules of the mortal world.","\"Ling Han, since General Tan has spoken, why don’t you spar with him?\" Ge Hui said.","Ling Han looked towards him, and shook his head, \"Not interested.\"","What right did he have?","He was not a clown that was entertaining the masses. Oh, just because you said to spar, he should agree?","Now that he had been rebuffed, Ge Hui’s expression also changed drastically.","What was going on?","This student was really too arrogant. He did not even take his words to heart?","It should be known that Tan Yuan was a higher up in the military, but indeed, he could not control the matters of the academy. However, he, Ge Hui, was the vice-principal of the academy, and was Ling Han’s direct superior. What right did Ling Han have to disobey him?","\"You—\" He took a deep breath, and looked furious.","No matter how freakish Ling Han was, and no matter how much of a star of hope he was, he was still so rebellious. He definitely had to teach him a good lesson about his temper. Otherwise, if he really became a supreme elite of the human race one day, yet did not seek benefits for the human race, and instead harmed them, that would really be raising an ingrate.","\"Ling Han, you don’t have to go to this training camp. Go back and put yourself in confinement. Reflect on yourself!\" he said in a deep voice.","\"Do you want to die?\" the empress asked. There was a haughty look on her face, and it was as if Ge Hui were an insignificant speck of dust.","What was going on?","Ge Hui’s expression was filled with shock as he looked at the empress.","He naturally knew of the empress, who wasan influential figure. She was incomparably beautiful, and was the goddess of the entire martial academy. However, because of his status, he naturally would not court her like the youngsters did. In fact, he had never faced the empress head-on before.","Now that he had seen her, she was indeed incomparably beautiful, making him feel as if he had come back to life.","However, in comparison, he valued his reputation more.","’I’m the vice-principal, and you’re just an ordinary teacher. Yet, you’re actually talking to me like this?’","\"Teacher Luan Xing, please watch your words!\" he warned.","How could the empress possibly care? Even if this was just a game, she was still high and noble, and definitely could not allow herself or Ling Han to suffer the slightest bit of grievance.","With a casual swipe of her hand, peng, Ge Hui’s whole person was sent flying, crashing through a wall. Then, peng, peng, peng sounds rang out endlessly, and at least a dozen over walls had been penetrated.","Er!","There was dead silence.","Had they... seen wrongly?","Ge Hui had actually been sent flying with a single slap?","’F*ck! That’s a High Grade Level 7 cultivator, not some random person!’","Then, everyone looked at the empress with terrified gazes. In fact, even their souls were trembling.","Level 8!","This woman was at least a Level 8 elite. Otherwise, how could she have sent Ge Hui flying with a single strike?","The problem was, she was too young!","Go and take a look; what high-ranking cultivator wasn’t over thirty years old?","Especially above Level 7. That was really as difficult as ascending the heavens. If you rushed up to Level 7 at thirty years old, then you may not be able to reach Level 8 even at forty years old. Now, those Level 9 elites had all gotten an astonishing fateful encounter, and ingested mutated spiritual fruits, and added with their own talent, they managed to rush up to the highest level.","Now, a woman in her twenties was actually showing the strength of Level 8.","This, this, this, this was practically going to scare them to death.","In comparison, Ling Han, an eighteen-year-old Level 4 cultivator, wasn’t freakish at all.","\"You, apologize to my husband!\" The empress pointed at Tan Yuan, her aura incredibly powerful.","Tan Yuan was shocked, and involuntarily knelt down.","Only after kneeling down did he come to his senses. He hurriedly stood up again, but his expression was already extremely ugly, as if he had eaten countless flies.","How humiliating! As a High Grade Level 7 cultivator, he had actually knelt in public! How could he face others in the future?","However, could it be that it was going to use force with the empress?","She was a great elite of Level 8!","He couldn’t afford to offend. He couldn’t afford to offend.","He spat out a mouthful of blood. Meanwhile, the others were about to go crazy. Initially, they had all been incredibly jealous of Ling Han. Now that they discovered that the empress was actually a High Grade Level 8 cultivator, they were naturally so jealous that they wanted to vomit blood.","Why? Why? Why!","Ling Han smiled, and pulled the empress into his arms. He asked, \"Can we set out now?\"","\"Let’s go, let’s go.\"","The group set out. After leaving the city, they headed towards the lair of that high-level Foreign Beast.","Their main goal this time was to annihilate that newly advanced Level 7 Foreign Beast. At the same time, they would also eradicate the low-level Foreign Beasts on their way, so that the youngsters could gain some experience.","Precisely because this high-level Foreign Beast was newly advanced, they only needed to send out two High Grade Level 7 cultivators.","Of course, there was one less Ge Hui now, but the empress was stronger, and was enough to fill the gap.","They swept through the Foreign Beasts on their way, and after a whole three days, they finally arrived at the lair of that Foreign Beast.","This newly advanced high-level Foreign Beast was a Crimson Flame Tiger, and it had been mutated from a fierce tiger. Not only was its power immense, its speed astonishing, but it could also spit out fiery flames that were powerful enough to melt alloys. It was truly terrifying.","Hence, this kind of Foreign Beast had to be eliminated at the first instant. Otherwise, when it became Level 8 or even Level 9, it would spit out a mouthful of fiery flames, and half the city could possibly be directly destroyed.","\"Yi?\" Tan Yuan let out a surprised exclamation, and looked ahead.","They saw that there was actually another group of people walking over.","\"Principal Li!\" he immediately greeted.","\"General Tan?\" The leader of the other team also appeared very surprised, \"You guys have also come to hunt the Crimson Flame Tiger?\"","\"Haha, what a coincidence,\" Tan Yuan said with a laugh.","The two teams walked together, and introduced themselves to each other.","As it turned out, the other group had come from the Demon Sea City Martial Arts Academy, and had the same goal as Ling Han and the others.","The Demon Sea City was adjacent to the Zhou Su City, so once the Crimson Flame Tiger grew to Level 8 or even Level 9, the Zhou Su City would be threatened, and so would the Demon Sea City.","Hence, it was not strange for the Demon Sea City to make a move as well. Coincidentally, two teams had actually arrived at the same time.","Very quickly, the eyes of the Demon Sea City team focused on the empress.","She was too beautiful."]},{"number":4926,"title":"Chapter 4926: Side Story -- City 14","paragraphs":["\"General Tan, since everyone is here, why don’t we work together?\" the Vice Principal from the Demon Sea Martial Academy said.","His name was Li Xiong, and he was also a High Grade Level 7 cultivator.","Tan Yuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Please.\"","\"Please.\"","The two Level 7 elites made way for each other modestly, then walked side by side, heading forwards.","A long time ago, this was a popular sightseeing area, but since fifty years ago, this place had been completely abandoned. Without the interference of humans, the vegetation here was flourishing. Large trees rose from the ground, their leaves dense, blocking sunlight.","The members of the Demon Sea team clearly did not know how strong the empress was. Seeing that she was as beautiful as a fairy, they all tried to strike up a conversation with her.","The empress was so proud, so she naturally ignored them completely. She merely walked side by side with Ling Han, causing the members of the Demon Sea team to feel incredibly jealous. They wanted nothing more than to kill Ling Han with their eyes.","—This brat was too young. Clearly, his cultivation level was low, so how could he be worthy of such a beautiful celestial maiden?","\"Celestial maiden, let’s be friends.\"","\"This beauty, how should I address you?\"","\"My name is Mo Hai. Beauty, it seems like I’ve seen you before somewhere!\"","They all used their respective abilities, wanting to win the empress’s attention.","Tan Yuan was well aware of how terrifying the empress was. Upon seeing these people recklessly provoke a High Grade Level 8 elite, he hurriedly chided, \"We’re facing a powerful enemy, so hurry up and focus!\"","Those members of the Demon Sea team had no direct relationship with Tan Yuan. However, now that a Level 7 elite had spoken up to reprimand them, they naturally did not dare to disobey. They all shut their mouths.","However, they immediately gritted their teeth again, because the empress was still clinging onto Ling Han.","F***, why don’t you reprimand them? They were about to get into a fight with the Foreign Beast, and these two people were still so lovey-dovey. Who were they showing off their love for!","Tan Yuan naturally knew this, but did he dare to say it?","Whatever a Level 8 elite wanted to do, was there any need for a mere Level 7 cultivator to interfere?","As they walked, they saw corpses appear by the roadside. Some were complete, and some were only left with parts.","Were these all prey that had been eaten by the Crimson Flames Tiger?","There were burn marks everywhere, as if reminding everyone that this Foreign Beast was an expert in controlling flames.","After walking for a while longer, Tan Yuan and Li Xiong stopped at the same time, their expressions grave.","\"That Foreign Beast sensed us.\"","\"Everyone, get ready!\"","The two of them had just finished their words, when they heard a deafening beast’s roar. A fierce tiger that was completely crimson in colour suddenly appeared. It was as tall as five metres, and as long as about ten metres. Standing in front of them, it was like a small building.","The fur of this fierce tiger were like burning flames, fluttering in the breeze.","\"Let’s go!\" Tan Yuan was the first to charge up.","Li Xiong did not refuse either, and charged towards the Crimson Flame Tiger.","This was a battle among High Grades, and even Medium Grade cultivators weren’t qualified to interfere. Otherwise, they would definitely die if they were struck by the aftermath of these attacks.","However, if Tan Yuan and Li Xiong joined forces, the two of them would be enough.","Tan Yuan’s strength was slightly weaker. He was only in the middle stage of Level 7, but Li Xiong was in the late stage of Level 8. He alone was enough to suppress the Crimson Flames Tiger. Otherwise, he would not have dared to lead a team all by himself.","In Tan Yuan’s case, it was because he knew that the empress, a Level 8 elite, was in the team.","The two of them joined forces, and very soon, suppressed the Crimson Flames Tiger, continuously widening their advantage, but they were still a little bit away from completely dealing with this Foreign Beast.","There was nothing that could be done. The Foreign Beasts had tough hides, and their claws and teeth also possessed great might. Their destructive power was astonishing, and their recovery ability was also astonishing. Thus, Tan Yuan and Li Xiong did not dare to come too close, but rather chose to slowly grind their enemy down.","After a whole half day’s time, this Foreign Beast was finally ground to death. When it collapsed to the ground dead, everyone cheered.","It should be known that though Foreign Beasts were great enemies of humans, they were also full of treasures, especially high-level Foreign Beasts. Even a piece of meat was filled with energy, and had astonishing effects on the cultivation of cultivators.","Thus, even though this Foreign Beast had been killed by Tan Yuan and Li Xiong, those that were with them would still be able to get a share of the loot. At the very least, they would be able to eat two pieces of meat.","Tan Yuan and Li Xiong both looked weary. After battling fiercely for half a day, even with their abilities, they were slightly strained.","Next, it was the distribution of the spoils of battle. This was naturally decided by the two big shots.","However, right at this moment, an incredibly terrifying aura surged over, causing everyone to feel cold all over. In fact, even their hearts were about to stop beating.","This was too terrifying. What kind of powerful existence could possess such an astonishing aura?","Huala, the sound of tree leaves rubbing against each other rang out, approaching from afar.","Very soon, everyone could see that the tree branches ahead of them were moving fiercely, and the commotion was astonishingly huge.","Something was about to come out!","Tan Yuan and Li Xiong both went into a defensive stance. This aura was too terrifying, causing them to feel immense pressure.","Xiu, a black shadow darted out.","Everyone couldn’t help but be taken aback. This aura had already spread out to such a shocking extent, but who would have thought that it was actually a black dog that had scuttled out? It was slightly larger than an ordinary dog, and its fur was smooth and shiny.","However, what made people splutter was the fact that this dog was actually wearing a pair of underpants. Furthermore, they were made of metal, and there was a metallic light flickering on them.","As soon as the large black dog appeared, he leaped to the side of the Crimson Flames Tiger. Then, he grinned at everyone, and taking advantage of the fact that they were all dumbfounded, picked up the corpse of the Crimson Flames Tiger with his mouth and fled.","Even though it was small in size, its power was astonishing. Dragging the Crimson Flame Tiger, it was still extraordinarily fast. In an instant, it had disappeared without a trace.","\"Am I seeing things, or is there really a large black dog wearing iron underwear and stealing all our spoils of battle?\" someone murmured.","\"You’re not seeing things, I saw it too.\"","\"Me too.\"","Only now did everyone come to their senses. Tan Yuan and Li Xiong had even set off in pursuit, but not too long after, they returned in disappointment. Clearly, they had lost track of their target.","\"Have you guys realized that the large black dog is extremely human-like?\"","\"That’s right. It was clearly smiling at us just now, as if it was mocking us.\"","\"Also, it’s actually wearing underpants!\"","\"There should be no sunlight shining here, but why can that pair of underpants still glow? It almost blinded me!\"","Everyone was talking about this matter, all of them incredibly stunned.","Who would have thought that they would actually be robbed by a dog? If this was told to others, it was guaranteed that no one would believe it.","Weng, right at this moment, another terrifying aura pressed over, and the trees in the distance were also swaying violently.","Was the large black dog about to return?","Everyone looked furious. This large black dog was really too despicable. He wanted to humiliate them again?","Humph, this time, they were prepared. They were definitely going to beat this despicable dog until he wet his pants in fright.","Sha, sha, sha! The movement of the branches was getting closer and closer.","\"I’ll go!\" Li Xiong shouted loudly, and charged into the forest.","Peng!","In just an instant, a figure flew out.","It was Li Xiong.","\"Pu—\" As he was sent flying backwards, he was still throwing up blood.","And a fiery red figure also leaped out. It was shockingly a second Crimson Flames Tiger, and it was much larger than the previous one."]},{"number":4927,"title":"Chapter 4927: Side Story -- City 15","paragraphs":["It was another Crimson Flame Tiger, and its abilities were clearly stronger!","What!","Everyone was stunned. Even Tan Yuan and Li Xiong frowned deeply, looking nervous.","They could clearly sense the strength of this Crimson Flame Tiger’s aura, which had reached a level that could overwhelm them.","Level 8!","This was a Level 8 Foreign Beast.","Heavens, they only knew that there was a Crimson Flame Tiger here that had just advanced to Level 7, but they had never imagined that there would actually be an even stronger existence here.","What could they do?","Both of them were only at Level 7, so dealing with the small Crimson Flame Tiger was no problem at all. They were more than enough. However, if it was a Level 8 Foreign Beast, it was completely capable of killing them.","However, compared to Li Xiong, Tan Yuan was still relatively calm.","This was because he knew that the empress was also in Level 8.","Thus, as long as the empress was willing to move, she would at least be able to stop this Crimson Flame Tiger.","The second Crimson Flame Tiger released a low growl, as if summoning the first Crimson Flame Tiger. Naturally, it was impossible to get a response. The aura it exuded became heavier and heavier, and its killing intent also became stronger and stronger.","These humans... all had to die!","\"You guys go, General Tan and I will bring up the rear!\" Li Xiong immediately said.","This was a difficult decision. Ifthey stayed behind to cover their retreat, he and Tan Yuan would have to face an enraged Level 8 Foreign Beast. It was highly possible that they would be killed within a minute!","However, these young people were the future of humanity, so he was willing to make such a sacrifice.","Ling Han nodded internally. This person was responsible.","Meanwhile, Tan Yuan looked towards the empress, his expression filled with hope.","\"Ang!\" The Crimson Flame Tiger leaped out, pouncing towards them. Its massive figure cast a long shadow on the top of everyone’s heads.","A terrifying aura pressed down, and those below Level 7 could not even think of resisting.","This was the crushing advantage of a superior cultivation level.","Oh no, they couldn’t even escape!","Shua, right at this moment, an incredibly brilliant saber light streaked past, slashing out towards the Crimson Flame Tiger.","The timing of this strike was really too ingenious. It just happened to be the instant when the Crimson Flames Tiger pounced out, and there was no way to change its course at all.","However, this Crimson Flames Tiger was a Level 8 Foreign Beast, so it wouldn’t be killed so easily. It still brandished its claws to parry the saber light.","Pu! Blood sprayed through the air.","The saber light swept past, and the Crimson Flame Tiger was actually forced backwards, its claws dripping with blood.","This was far too astonishing. With a single slash, the Foreign Beast was actually wounded.","It should be known that Foreign Beasts had high attack and defense in the first place, and the Level 8 Foreign Beasts were even more terrifying. To say nothing of the fact that they could not be killed by missiles, even if they were bombarded with nuclear weapons, unless they were in the centre of the explosion, they would still be able to survive.","From this, it could be seen with how this saber strike had wounded a Level 8 Crimson Flame Tiger, how astonishing the power of this attack was.","\"Ang!\" The Crimson Flame Tiger landed on the ground, and couldn’t help but release a low roar, appearing both furious and fearful.","At this moment, the person who had drawn the saber also revealed his true appearance.","This was a man who looked to be only in his forties. He was dressed in a tight-fitting suit of green, exuding a heroic spirit.","\"Father!\" In the Demon Sea team, a young man suddenly called out, an expression of wild joy on his face.","His name was Lu Songlai, and he was a prodigy from the Demon Sea City’s martial arts academy. He was only 21 years old, yet he was already a Level 4 cultivator. This could be considered astonishing.","This was because he had a good father.","\"Commander Lu!\" Tan Yuan and Li Xiong exclaimed at the same time. They both looked at him in admiration.","Lu Hao, the commander of the army, a Level 9 elite, and was also one of the strongest elites of the nation. Even in comparison of the whole world, he could be considered one of the top elites.","Lu Hao nodded, but his eyes were still fixed on the Crimson Flames Tiger. His aura had tightly locked onto this Foreign Beast.","The Crimson Flame Tiger roared, and suddenly turned around and fled.","After reaching Level 8, the Foreign Beast had definitely developed intelligence. Thus, when it realized that its opponent was far stronger than it, it immediately chose to flee.","\"Still trying to escape?\" Lu Hao shouted lightly, and immediately charged over with his saber.","Shua, the saber light was like a rainbow.","How fast was the speed of a Level 9 elite?","With a big stride, he had already caught up to the Crimson Flame Tiger. His long saber slashed out, slashing towards the Crimson Flame Tiger.","The Crimson Flame Tiger was exasperated. He suddenly turned around, opened his mouth, and spat out a fiery flame.","This was its strongest killing move, fiery flames that could burn high-grade alloys, which was terrifying.","\"I was waiting for this move from you!\" Lu Hao laughed lightly, and with a wave of his long saber, shua, the head of the Crimson Flame Tiger was forcefully severed.","—With his abilities, dealing with a Level 8 Foreign Beast was actually a very easy matter. The only thing he was wary of was the fiery flames of the Crimson Flames Tiger, which also had strong destructive power against a Level 9 elite.","Thus, he had held back when he had attacked previously. When the Crimson Flame Tiger used this move, he naturally had no more reservations, and dealt with the Crimson Flame Tiger with a single strike.","As expected of Level 9!","Everyone’s hearts trembled as they watched. Then, an incomparable admiration welled up in their hearts.","Previously, when the Crimson Flame Tiger had appeared, it had brought them such despair. Then, Lu Hao had only delivered three strikes, and he had dealt with this beast that they thought was invincible.","How could they not be impressed?","\"This is my father!\" Lu Songlai introduced to everyone. Who cares if you had known before? This was the time for him to show off, \"The strongest elite of humanity, Level 9!\"","Then, he looked towards Lu Hao, and asked, \"Father, why have you come?\"","\"I received news that it is very possible that there is an even stronger Crimson Flame Tiger here. I was afraid that something would happen to you, so I deliberately made a trip.\" Lu Hao said smilingly, as he shook hands with Tan Yuan and Li Xiong, causing the two of them to look overwhelmed by his favour.","That was a supreme elite of Level 9, and he actually took the initiative to shake hands with them, causing them to go numb with excitement, just like a minor cultivator that had just stepped onto the path of martial arts.","Lu Songlai looked at the empress again, and said, \"Miss Luan Xing, are you interested in joining the academy of martial arts of the Demon Sea City? I think that it would be a waste of your talent to stay in Zhou Su City. In terms of future prospects, our Demon Sea City is definitely brighter!\"","This action of publicly poaching one of their own was too much. Didn’t they see that the teachers and students of Zhou Su Martial Arts Academy were all present?","However, Lu Songlai was completely unconcerned. His old man was one of the few elites of the Hua Nation. With such a background, so what if he publicly poached someone? Who would dare have any objections against him?","The empress merely glanced at him coldly, completely having no intention of speaking.","\"Miss Luan Xing, I truly like you!\" Lu Songlai directly confessed. This was a rare opportunity. If they returned to their respective campuses later, who knew when they would meet again.","—Between the two cities, there were innumerable Foreign Beasts, and it was too difficult to even meet once.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, \"She is already taken, so you had best give up.\"","\"Oh, is that you?\" Lu Songlai wore a haughty expression. Who do you think you are? Are you worthy of such a beautiful woman?","Ling Han cracked a smile, and ignored him.","F***!","Lu Songlai looked furious. He did not think that the empress had disregarded him. Instead, he thought that the goddess had a strong personality. However, in his eyes, Ling Han’s disregard was too rude.","\"Do you dare to battle me?\""]},{"number":4928,"title":"Chapter 4928: Side Story -- City 16","paragraphs":["Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Why should I fight you?\"","\"Just say whether you dare or not!\" Lu Songlai used provocation. He was sure that Ling Han was only eighteen or nineteen years old, so he would definitely not be able to take the provocation.","Moreover, he was already 21 years old this year, and he also had a father who was a Level 9 elite. It was because of this that he had been able to advance to Level 4. Who could compare to him?","Thus, as long as Ling Han dared to agree, he would thrash Ling Han to a tragic state. He was sure that the empress would despise this person; how could she still like him then?","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"All right!\"","\"Everyone, step back a bit,\" Lu Songlai said. He was a Level 4 cultivator, and the might of his attack was too terrifying. In fact, even the aftermath of his attack had astonishing destructive power, and there was no shortage of Level 2 and Level 3 cultivators here, so they naturally had to step back a little.","Since the purpose of this trip had been achieved, and there was also a supreme elite of the Level 9 standing guard, everyone was naturally relaxed. They were not in a rush to return, and stepped back a little, to make space for Ling Han and Lu Songlai.","\"I’ll let you have the first three moves.\" Lu Songlai appeared very domineering.","In his eyes, Ling Han was only 18 or 19 years old. At most, he was only a Level 1 cultivator. At most, he was only a Level 2 cultivator. Even if he didn’t use his hands and feet, he could still defeat his opponent.","Ling Han smiled, and asked, \"Are you sure?\"","\"Of course!\" Lu Songlai declared proudly.","Ling Han didn’t say anything else. Instead, he threw a punch.","However, this punch did not land on Lu Songlai. Instead, it landed on the empty area beside him. A majestic light surged out, turning into an incredibly dazzling pillar of light.","Boom!","A terrifying scene appeared. This place had originally been a primeval forest, and there were still some small mountains that had been man-made at that time, but when the pillar of light surged past, everything disappeared.","The area of at least ten kilometers ahead of them had all been razed to the ground.","’Holy f*ck!’","At this moment, everyone was dumbfounded and unable to breathe.","What kind of terrifying destructive power was this!","Even the bombardment of guided missiles could just barely reach this level of destruction, right?","Level 8? Or even Level 9?","At least, Tan Yuan and Li Xiong knew that the might of their strike definitely could not reach this level.","Heavens, this young man was actually stronger than them?","And he was actually a newly enrolled student, no, a pseudo-student that had yet to enter into the martial academy?","An eighteen-year-old Level 8 cultivator?","Ancestors!","Even Lu Hao looked astonished. The might of this attack had reached at least Level 8.","Even if it was only Level 8, that was too shocking, too inconceivable.","Just think, what level had he been when he was eighteen years old?","Level 2, and this was already incredibly freakish. Few people in history could compare to this.","However, how many times over had this record been broken all of a sudden?","Meanwhile, Lu Songlai was shaking greatly.","He turned his head with great difficulty, and looked at the large stretch of flat land behind him. He almost couldn’t catch his breath.","Then, he felt that the inside of his pants was a little sticky. He looked down, and there was actually a large patch of wetness.","—He had wet himself in fright.","This couldn’t be blamed on him. That attack just now was truly shocking. Although he was a Level 4, he didn’t have much actual combat experience, so the impact he suffered was too great.","Ling Han shrugged, and said, \"Sorry, I missed. Let’s do it again, and I promise I’ll improve.\"","Improve your sister!","Lu Songlai hurriedly shook his head. If he had really sustained such an attack, he would definitely not even be able to leave behind any dust.","\"Hehe, you’re a Level 8 cultivator, so what’s the point of bullying a junior like this?\" Lu Hao stepped forward. His son had wet himself in fright, so he was naturally displeased.","He only had one son, and he treasured him immensely.","Moreover, he didn’t think that Ling Han was truly a young man. Instead, he thought that Ling Han had eaten some spirit fruit to maintain his youthful appearance—after the world went through a mutation, this spirit fruit definitely existed.","Thus, Ling Han was bullying the weak with his superior strength, so he naturally had to stand up for his son.","Ling Han was a Level 9?","Bu so what?","The position of commander of the army was not obtained through seniority, but through battle!","Level 9 cultivators were the strongest in the world, so who did he need to fear?","\"You want to stand up for your son?\" Ling Han asked.","\"You’re a bully, so why can’t I uphold justice for my son?\" Lu Hao said calmly.","\"Didn’t you realize that it was your son who provoked me first?\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Lu Hao paused slightly. This was the truth.","It was his son who coveted Ling Han’s girlfriend and took the initiative to provoke him. On the other hand, Ling Han didn’t attack ruthlessly. He only displayed his strength to make Lu Songlai retreat.","If he claimed that he was bullying someone weaker than himself, then he was truly trying to pin a crime on an innocent person.","But the problem here was, Lu Songlai had actually wet himself in fright!","This was something that Lu Hao could not accept.","\"You insulted my son, and this justice must be avenged!\" Lu Hao declared balefully, his whole body exuding killing intent.","The commander of the army had battled all his life, and his killing intent was almost tangible.","Ling Han shook his head. Just as he was about to speak, he heard rustling sounds. The tree leaves were moving again. Something was about to appear.","In an instant, a large black dog dashed out. Its iron underwear shone with golden light, the kind that could blind one.","Yi, that damn thieving dog!","It actually ran back?","\"Was it that b@stard that sneak attacked Grandpa Dog just now?\" The large black dog suddenly stood up on his hind legs, and he was even speaking in human language.","’F*ck!’","Everyone was dumbfounded. Even Lu Hao had forgotten to continue exerting pressure on Ling Han.","This!","The world had changed, and wild beasts had evolved, becoming incredibly terrifying. However, no matter how strong a Foreign Beast was, it would not open its mouth to speak. This was something that everyone knew, and humans were still the only living beings with true intelligence.","But now?","Not only did the large black dog stand up like a human, but he was also wearing underpants like a human. Although this made him look even more vulgar, and he even spoke human language, this had broken the iron rule that humans were the only beings with true intelligence.","This caused the feeling of superiority of humans to completely vanish.","\"Was it you?\" The large black dog stared at Lu Hao.","Lu Hao gritted his teeth. There were so many people here, so why are you targeting me?","He frowned, \"Why can you speak human language?\"","\"Grandpa Dog has already existed since the beginning of the Stacked Era, and is the ancestor of all living things!\" The large black dog mumbled. \"You all were also created by Grandpa Dog. What’s so strange about Grandpa Dog being able to speak human language?\"","\"Insignificant human, are you still not going to kneel down in front of me and show me your respect?\"","Lu Hao humphed upon hearing this. Of course, he didn’t believe a single word of this.","\"This is the first time I’ve discovered this kind of mutated species. It should have great research value,\" he murmured. If there were other Foreign Beasts that could also speak, that meant that aside from the fact that Foreign Beasts looked different from humans, they had already caught up to humans in terms of intelligence level. That would be too terrifying.","Thus, capturing the large black dog and dissecting it to figure out the extent that a Foreign Beast’s intelligence had evolved to was extremely important.","\"Little Han, this guy wants to challenge Grandpa Dog. Say, do you think Grandpa Dog will light a sky lantern for him, or r@pe him and throw him into the toilet?\" the large black dog asked Ling <anno data-annotation-id=\"057e602b-b8a5-401b-8ea7-dab9383442a4\" data-title=\"Han\">Han 1 </anno>.","What, this despicable dog that was exuding an air of vulgarity actually knew Ling Han?","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">’Lighting someone as a sky lantern’ refers to burn someone’s body hung on a stake, either as execution or post-mortem humiliation.</annotations>"]},{"number":4929,"title":"Chapter 4929: Side Story -- City 17","paragraphs":["Ling Han shrugged, and said with a smile, \"Is there any need to lower yourself to the level of such a minor character?\"","A, a minor character?","Everyone had gone mad. Though you are a Level 8 elite, and may even possibly have reached Level 9, Lu Hao was also a Level 9 elite, and not weaker than you, so where did you get such arrogance from?","However, in this place, only Lu Hao could suppress Ling Han, or be his equal. Thus, they naturally had no right to interfere, and could only watch obediently from the sidelines.","Meanwhile, the large black dog chuckled, and said, \"Grandpa Dog wants to show off, so I don’t mind who the target it.\"","\"Do as you like, but be mindful of propriety,\" Ling Han said indifferently.","\"All right.\" The large black dog nodded, and wagged his behind at Lu Hao, \"Come on, come on. You can’t bear to see Grandpa Dog, right? Come and beat Grandpa Dog up. If you can, come!\"","This kind of vulgarity and lowliness was something that no one could bear to look at directly.","Lu Hao was so furious that he started to laugh. He had really had enough. Whether it was Ling Han or the large black dog, they actually treated him like he was nothing.","Who was he?","A supreme elite of Level 9, one of the few ultimate elites in the world!","’Fine, I’ll capture this despicable dog first, then deal with Ling Han.’","He moved. Boom, he stretched out a palm, and an invisible power actually materialized, turning into a massive palm that grabbed out at the large black dog.","\"Look at Grandpa Dog’s trump card, it’s going to blind you!\" The large black dog twisted his behind, and a flash of light instantly shot out from his iron underwear, shooting toward Lu Hao.","\"Wu!\" Even with Lu Hao’s abilities, he could not help but use his hands to shield his eyes, to protect them from being hurt.","Peng!","The large black dog charged forwards, and took advantage of the opening to deliver a kick, which landed between Lu Hao’s legs.","Instantly, Lu Hao’s face became incredibly pale, and his hands involuntarily covered the space between his legs.","Even the great elite of Level 9 couldn’t cultivate that part to the point that it was impervious to weapons, and could withstand heavy blows.","\"You!\" Lu Hao pointed angrily at the large black dog. It was too despicable, too vulgar, and too shameless.","The large black dog shook his behind, and another blinding light shot over, so Lu Hao could only guard his eyes.","Peng! The result was another kick landed between Lu Hao’s legs.","’F*ck! Can’t you switch to another location?’","Lu Hao was about to collapse. His lower body was such a sensitive and fragile part, and he had actually suffered two consecutive kicks. The pain was bone-piercing.","However, he was also incredibly stunned.","Even though the large black dog had intiially used blinding light to force him to use his hands to block the light, thereby exposing his weakness, in truth, if it was someone else whose abilities were slightly weaker, he would completely be able to react in time, and destroy the other party with a single strike.","However, the large black dog kicked him again and again, almost shattering his balls.","This was a display of incomparable strength.","In other words, this despicable dog’s strength was definitely not inferior to his.","A Level 9 Foreign Beast!","However, you are clearly so strong, so why did you have to resort to such underhanded means?","Just how dark was his mentality!","However, a Level 9 elite was still a supreme elite, after all. Lu Hao forcefully suppressed his pain, and with a loud shout, charged towards the large black dog again.","This time, he was on full alert. He definitely wouldn’t be hit again.","However, with a flash of brilliance from the iron underwear, Lu Hao instantly cried out in pain, his figure falling down.","This was f*cking impossible to block.","Everyone was once again dumbfounded. Under the prerequisite that he was already prepared, Lu Hao had actually still been hit. What was going on here?","Could it be that this iron underwear was a legendary treasure?","Lu Hao also looked at the large black dog in disbelief. At this moment, he was completely unable to determine whether it was the large black dog that was inconceivably strong, or whether it was that iron underwear on him that had this heaven-defying effect.","He didn’t dare to continue the battle. He was one of the few elites of the human race. If he fell here, it would be a great loss to the entire human race.","Thus, he immediately let out a battle cry, leaped over, picked up his son, and ran away madly.","The speed of a Level 9 elite was truly astonishingly fast. In the blink of an eye, he had already left without a trace with Lu Songlai.","\"Little Han!\" The large black dog swung its hind legs as it charged over. It spread open its arms and grabbed at Ling Han, but just as it was about to place its paws on Ling Han’s shoulder, it suddenly shot out a leg, kicking out at Ling Han’s crotch.","Peng!","A figure suddenly charged out, crashing directly into the large black dog.","\"Holy f*ck!\" the large black dog howled in agony. His body was instantly sent flying like a meteor.","\"Ling Han, you guys are so mean! You didn’t even bring Niu with you when you went out to play! Niu is very angry, and the consequences are very serious!\" An incredibly beautiful woman appeared, her hands on her hips, looking very angry.","Everyone watched with gaping mouths, not knowing what kind of expression they should have.","Was the large black dog vulgar? Vulgar! However, was he strong? Strong!","Just look, even a Level 9 elite had been scared off by it, which was proof enough.","However, this beauty had only crashed into the large black dog, and the large black dog had already disappeared without a trace. Just how powerful were her abilities?","Heavens, what was going on with this world? Supreme elites had popped out one after another, yet they had never been heard of before. Furthermore, they were all too young.","\"Tsundere girl, you’ve come to snatch Ling Han from Niu again!\" Hu Niu stared at the empress, her fighting spirit beginning to rise.","The empress was proud, and couldn’t even be bothered to pay her any regard.","How long had they been fighting for?","They had already passed through a Stacked Era, but neither of them was willing to concede to the other.","\"All right, all right,\" Ling Han said with a smile. He walked over and pulled Hu Niu into his arms.","Hu Niu’s anger instantly turned into delight, and she hugged Ling Han. At the same time, she made a face at the empress and stuck out her tongue.","The empress was still cold and aloof, and did not even cast a second look at this kind of child-like behaviour competing for favour.","\"Little Han, you have to discipline your wife. She keeps kicking Grandpa Dog like a ball! Thankfully, Grandpa Dog is wearing iron underwear. Otherwise, I would definitely be crippled by the kicks.\" The large black dog suddenly ran over again.","Instantly, the empress and Hu Niu both glared at it.","\"Er, Grandpa Dog didn’t say anything.\" The large black dog stood up on its hind legs, drawing circles on the ground with one of its hind legs.","\"Come, let’s go back first,\" Ling Han said.","\"Sure, where are we going to play?\" Hu Niu immediately asked.","Ling Han smiled, \"There is an idiot that has interfered with the evolution of this world. I am waiting for him to appear.\"","\"Then let Niu capture him!\" Hu Niu volunteered.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"No need. I’ll just play around with him. I’m sure that it’s about time for him to appear.\"","With the current strength of this planet’s Spiritual Qi, at most, it could only nurture out so-called Level 9 elites, and in terms of the cultivation level Ling Han had set out for this universe, that would only be the consummate level, which belonged to the first level of martial arts.","And now, Level Nine had already appeared in this world. Thus, if this mastermind had any ulterior motives, it was almost time for him to appear.","\"Okay!\" Hu Niu agreed without any principles. In any case, she would be happy as long as Ling Han was by her side.","Everyone returned, and the Demon City team naturally parted ways with them, each returning to their respective bases.","Ling Han and the others returned to Zhou Su City. Only two days had passed, and among the fourteen elites of Level 9 from the Hua Nation, five of them had come together.","This naturally was for Ling Han, the empress and the large black dog. En, there was also Hu Niu.","There were so many mysterious Level 9 elites, and there was even a Foreign Beast that could speak human language. They had to investigate thoroughly."]},{"number":4930,"title":"Chapter 4930: Side Story -- City 18","paragraphs":["The supreme elites of Level 9 had arrived, and there were even as many as five of them!","Thankfully, the ordinary people of Zhou Su City did not know. Otherwise, they would think that the Foreign Beasts were going to riot, and join forces to attack the city.","These five supreme elites were Zhou Leyu, Wang Bowen, Wang Jingsheng, Yan Lan and Lu Hao, respectively. They were either high-ranking officials of the government, or high-ranking military officials.","They had come in secret. After making some arrangements, they sent someone to invite Ling Han, the empress, and the others.","Ling Han didn’t mind. He brought the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog to the academy field.","Lu Hao and the others were standing with their hands clasped behind their backs, all of them wearing solemn expressions. Yang Shan, the Peincipal of the Martial Arts Academy, was beside them as well. There were five Level 9 elites, and there was another Level 8 elite. This kind of lineup could be considered terrifying.","\"Ling Han, who exactly are you people?\" Lu Hao was the first to speak. That day, after he had rushed back to the army, and for the sake of today, he had moved around the various departments, which had also caused a commotion among the higher-ups, which led to the scene of five elites coming together.","Ling Han’s background was too important. Why had he become a Level 8 or even a Level 9 elite at such a young age? Why could a Foreign Beast speak? Why did the two of them actually know each other?","Without clarifying this, it would be a great calamity for humans.","\"Also, why can this Foreign Beast speak?\"","The large black dog was displeased, and he said, \"Hey, hey, hey, don’t you know how to speak properly? This is Grandpa Dog! When you address me, you have to use words of respect!\"","Hearing the large black dog speak, Zhou Leyu and the others could not conceal their shock.","As expected, this Foreign Beast actually knew how to speak!","This was too shocking. This was a completely different story.","Lu Hao humphed upon hearing this. He had suffered a loss at the hands of the large black dog, and his b@lls were hurting even now. He was filled with hatred and resentment!","\"Ling Han, you’re a human, so we’re giving you a chance to explain!\" Zhou Leyu interrupted.","\"You need to give us a proper explanation. Otherwise... we will consider you traitors to humanity!\" Yan Lan also said. She was the only female among the five supreme elites. Her hair was completely white, yet her aura was intimidating, and she did not look old at all.","Ling Han was just about to speak, yet he suddenly exclaimed in surprise. A smile then spread across his face, and he said, \"The person I’ve been waiting for has finally appeared!\"","The words had just fallen, when a doorway of light actually appeared out of thin air on the field.","Everyone instantly felt that the space was showing signs of being forcibly warped.","What was going on?","At this moment, a person walked out of the doorway of light. His attire was very retro. He was dressed in brocade, and his hair was draped over his shoulders. It was black and shiny, and every strand of hair seemed to be glowing.","There was an incredibly proud expression on his face. He had one foot on the field, yet it was as if the whole world was crawling beneath his feet.","He was very young, at most in his twenties, but the aura he exuded was not inferior to Zhou Leyu and the others at all.","Behind this person, another figure appeared. He was also incredibly young, but was also astonishingly strong.","What was going on?","Lu Hao and the others all felt their scalps go numb. A doorway of light appeared out of thin air, and multiple people actually walked out from within. What kind of advanced technology was this?","However, if this was technology, then how could the aura exuding from these two people be so terrifying?","Then, a third person appeared, a fourth appeared, a fifth... a total of eleven young people walked out. There were both men and women, but they all had a terrifying aura that could move a Level 9 elite.","\"That’s right. This world has already been completely transformed,\" the first young man said. \"Everyone, let’s begin hunting. A month later, the results will be assessed based on the number and quality of the prey.\"","\"Alright!\" The other anomalies nodded, one after another.","What!","Lu Hao and the others exchanged looks. Judging by their words, it was actually them who had caused their world to become like this!","However, spending fifty years’ time was actually just for the sake of a hunting competition?","Also, prey?","Were they referring to the Foreign Beasts, or... were they included as well?","\"Who are you people?\" Wang Bowen asked darkly. These eleven people were definitely all elites of Level 9, and all of them were too young. This meant that there were even more elites behind them.","\"Your rulers!\" The first young man said, \"I am Han Feng, the son of Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master. Long before I was even born, my father had already modified this planet of yours for me. It was all for today, to provide a hunting ground for me, so that I could train.\"","\"All the resources on this planet are mine, and you people... are both my prey and my slaves!\"","Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master?","Hiss, the mutation of the world was actually engineered?","Then, just how strong was this Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master, to be able to use such a heaven-defying technique?","Zhou Leyu and the others were all trembling. It was as if they had seen an invisible hand interfering in the operations of this world, and this person was so strong that even they could not fathom his abilities.","How were they supposed to block this?","Could they only be reduced to prey, or slaves?","Han Feng’s eyes swept over them, and when he saw the empress and Hu Niu, his eyes involuntarily lit up. \"I really had not thought that I would actually be able to find such beauties on such a backward planet! Haha, this time is really worth it!\"","The other youngsters also looked at the empress and Hu Niu with admiration, then showed expressions of pity.","Though their strength was not inferior to Han Feng, their backgrounds were far too inferior. They were completely unqualified to compete.","\"Humph, the people of Hua Nation would rather die than be dishonored!\" Yan Lan reprimanded, her face filled with fury. She had a strong personality, and was also a female. Thus, when she saw Han Feng and the others actually having designs on the empress and Hu Niu, she was immediately angered.","\"Old hag, get lost!\" Han Feng said nonchalantly, waving his hand dismissively.","Yan Lan despised evil as if it was her natural enemy. She immediately pounced over, brandishing a crimson walking stick in her hands. This was forged from a high grade alloy, and was both hard and heavy. If one was struck solidly by this walking stick, it was completely capable of beating Han Feng into mush.","\"Ignorant!\" Han Feng smiled faintly, and with a casual grab, the other end of the walking stick was grasped in his hand.","This!","Lu Hao and the others all broke out in a cold sweat as they watched. They naturally knew Yan Lan’s strength, but it was precisely because they knew that they were afraid.","Could it be that this guy’s hand was also forged from a high level alloy? Furthermore, just how strong was he to be able to easily stretch out his hand and firmly grab onto the walking stick that was rushing towards him?","Han Feng laughed mischievously, and stretched out a hand in a shove. Peng, Yan Lan’s walking stick instantly slipped from her grasp. The head of the walking stick slammed heavily into her chest, causing her expression to change drastically, and she stumbled backwards.","’So powerful!’","They were clearly both at Level 9, but Han Feng’s strength was more than double that of Yan Lan.","Han Feng looked towards the empress and Hu Niu again, and showed an expression of arrogance, \"Two beauties, you will follow me in future. How about it?\"","Hu Niu giggled, and said, \"If you can block a punch from Niu, Niu will consider it!\"","If it was another woman saying this, Han Feng would definitely be extremely displeased.","What a joke. It is your fortune that I have taken a fancy to you, and you still want to be picky?","However, hearing these words from the mouth of a beauty like Hu Niu, he felt an itch in his heart.","\"All right then,\" he agreed.","Peng! There was a flash of blood, and Han Feng was instantly torn into pieces, turning into a pool of blood."]},{"number":4931,"title":"Chapter 4931: Side Story -- City 19","paragraphs":["What!","Seeing this scene, Lu Hao and the others were shocked to the point of becoming speechless.","Was Han Feng strong?","Yes!","He had severely wounded Yan Lan with a single strike.","But in front of Hu Niu, he was insta-killed.","This, this, this, what was going on with this world?","They were clearly already standing at the pinnacle of the world, but why had they suddenly become no match for anyone?","However, the faces of Han Feng’s ten companions had all turned green.","\"You, you guys have gotten into big trouble!\"","\"Do you guys know who Han Feng is?\"","\"He’s the only son of the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master, and he treasures him immensely!\"","\"And Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master... that is the overlord of this galaxy!\"","\"After killing Han Feng and Feng, you people won’t be able to live, and won’t get an easy death even if you beg for it!\"","These ten people were all trembling in fear. That was because they would also garner the anger of Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master, and would probably be buried with Han Feng as well.","Unreasonable? That’s right, but Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master was just that domineering.","Who asked him to be the overlord of this galaxy?","The entire galaxy was under his rule. Whoever was allowed to live, could live, and whoever was allowed to die, could only die.","Seeing how these ten people looked like they had lost both their parents, Lu Hao and the others were both confused and terrified.","As they saw it, they were already standing at the pinnacle of martial arts, so who could be stronger than them?","However, the ten people on the other side were not the slightest bit weaker than them, but when it came to the Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master, they did not even have the courage to resist.","How could theyaccept this?","The problem was that the fear of these ten people was not faked at all.","Hiss, was there really someone that was strong enough to suppress the galaxy all by himself?","Weng!","Right at this moment, an indescribable pressure enshrouded them, as if the sky was about to collapse, causing everyone to feel a shiver that came from their souls.","In the skies, a human face appeared, its eyes as massive as the sun.","\"Lord Hundred Feather!\"","Those ten people trembled, and plop, plop, they all knelt down, kowtowing towards the face in the skies.","Lu Hao and the others were also rendered speechless. This was the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master?","Heavens, humans could actually be as strong as this!","No wonder those ten people just now, who were obviously all Level 9 elites, were so terrified that they almost wet their pants.","In front of such a majestic existence, what was Level 9 worth?","Not even enough to be considered trash.","\"You actually dare to kill my son!\" The face spoke up, his voice booming out, reverberating throughout the entire planet, causing everyone on the planet to feel his fury.","\"Everyone, die with my son!\"","Boom! A large hand reached over. This hand was even larger than the planet, and it could easily crush this planet into pieces.","All of a sudden, all the living beings felt the arrival of doomsday. The shadow of death enshrouded them, and no one could escape. No one could escape.","This was a crushing power, capable of plucking stars with one hand, and destroying the sun with a single palm.","Lu Hao and the others were all trembling. What use were those as strong as Level 9? In front of such great power, they were completely no different from infants, and could only wait for death.","\"Old b@stard, have you gone blind? You actually dare to hit Grandpa Dog!\" Right at this moment, the large black dog suddenly raised its behind with a roar. Suddenly, a ray of light shot out, striking towards that human face in the skies.","\"Wu!\" This light was too bright. Even if the Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master could suppress the galaxy, so what? This was only a Dao Manifestation that he had manifested, but so what? His eyes still hurt from the light, and the palm strike that he had shot out was instantly withdrawn.","’You can do that?’","Lu Hao and the others all looked towards the large black dog. Who would have thought that the destroyer of the human race was a similar human, while the savior was a wretched, lowly large black dog?","\"Who are you?\" In the galaxy, the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master shouted angrily, \"You were the one who killed my son?\"","No wonder!","He had given his son a protective talisman, which could ensure his son’s safety. Unless — the person who had made the move was as strong as he was, that the protective talisman would not be able to save his life.","Ling Han shook his head, and stretched out a hand to grab him. Peng, a middle-aged man dressed in a green robe appeared out of thin air. Looking at his appearance, he was actually 70% similar to that massive human face in the skies.","He was Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master, and this was his true self.","How was this possible!","Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master wore a dumbfounded expression. His true self was on the incredibly distant Great Prosperity Planet, so why had he suddenly appeared here?","He had formed the Dao Manifestation, and could instantly reach any place that was covered by his divine sense. However, if his true self wanted to traverse the universe, he would still need some time.","But now, his true self had instantly traversed an endless distance, and appeared here.","Most importantly, he had been captured and brought here at that.","Who was it, who was it? This strength was so strong that even he felt a wave of coldness.","But for Lu Hao and the others, the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master was too strong, too strong. Merely the aura he exuded was enough to make their bodies explode.","Was this an existence that could create a manifestation that was even larger than the sun?","If this kind of elite wanted to kill them, a single thought would be enough, right?","But right at this moment, the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master fell to his knees with a plop, \"Lord, Lord!\"","He worshipped Ling Han. To be able to bring him from his lair to this place without him noticing, this person’s strength was definitely on the level of Ultimate Elites of the universe. As a Galaxy Overlord, he was not even qualified to compare.","Pu!","Lu Hao and the others spluttered. An existence like the Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master, a great elite that was tens of thousands or hundreds of millions of times stronger than them, actually knelt down on both knees in front of Ling Han, and called out ’Lord’?","Were they seeing things, or was this world too crazy?","Heavens, and they actually wanted to interrogate Ling Han!","All of a sudden, they held their breaths, fearing that if their breathing was a little heavier, they would startle Ling Han.","\"This junior was blind, and made a wrong move on Milord. Please forgive me, Milord!\" Hundred Feather Spiritual Master said respectfully, \"This junior is a disciple of Ultimate Elite Dongwu. Please spare this junior for the sake of Ultimate Elite Dongwu.\"","What was an ultimate elite?","Strongest in the universe, and below the level of Ultimate Elite, there was Indestructible Galaxy elites, and followed by Galaxy Overlords.","The Hundred Feather Spiritual Master actually had quite a distant rwlationship with Ultimate Elite Dongwu, but now, in order to save his life, he had no choice but to bear this great flag.","Lu Hao and the others were trembling even more violently. Someone as strong as the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master, and there was actually an even stronger existence above him?","Heavens!","Ling Han shook his head and said, \"From the beginning of the Stacked Era, I established the rules. No one is allowed to interfere with the cultivation and evolution of planets. You can cultivate to the level of Galaxy Overlord, so you naturally know this.\"","\"Yet you still knowingly acted. You merely wanted to build a training ground for your son, and thus interfered in the evolution of this planet.\"","\"Commit suicide!\"","The Hundred Feather Spiritual Master couldn’t help but feel his expression change drastically. The rules that all the powerful races in the universe had to adhere to together was actually drawn up by Ling Han?","How was this possible!","The Regulations of heaven and earth were naturally set by Heavenly Dao. Though you are very strong, are you the Heavenly Dao ?","No, the Heavenly Dao wasn’t a specific existence, so how could it possibly be a person?","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible!\" Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master shouted loudly, \"Heavenly Dao is high and noble, transcendent above all else, so how could you possibly be Heavenly Dao’s manifestation!\"","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Heavenly Dao?\"","He stretched out a hand and pressed down. Countless drops of blood condensed, and a person appeared out of thin air.","Han Feng!","Everyone was dumbfounded. Wasn’t he already dead? How had he come back to life?","\"Father!\" Han Feng hurriedly called out, appearing very surprised. Why had his old man suddenly come?","—His memories were still stuck on before he had been killed by Hu Niu.","However, Ling Han pressed his hand down again. Pa! Han Feng once again transformed into a cloud of blood.","Controlling life and death.","This had surpassed the Ultimate Elite of the universe, and only the Heavenly Dao could do this!"]},{"number":4932,"title":"Chapter 4932: Side Story: City 20 (End)","paragraphs":["Everyone’s mouths were wide open. Today, they had already been stunned who knew how many times, but they were still stunned by this scene.","They dared to bet with their lives. That scene just now was definitely not an illusion, but rather incredibly real.","But how was this possible?","Was this a reverse of time? Or a reverse of life and death?","Whichever one it was, they had both surpassed imagination. In fact, they had even surpassed cultivation.","The creator of the Regulations of heaven and earth?","They looked dumbly at Ling Han. This man was actually the Creator?","Otherwise, how could he possibly reverse time or life and death!","But compared to the shock of the others, the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master was practically cursing in his heart.","Oh, you have revived my son, proving your supreme ability, but why beat him to death again?","Are you playing around with me?","His only son had died, and he was already in enough pain. Now, he actually had to experience it again.","How could you do that!","However, Ling Han was far too powerful. In fact, he was so powerful that he had even surpassed the Ultimate ELites of the universe. Thus, what could he do no matter how displeased or furious he was?","He shivered even more. Ling Han had already proven that he had surpassed the Ultimate Elites of the universe. Even if Ultimate Elite Dongwu came personally, he would probably still have to pay his respects to Ling Han. In fact, Ling Han didn’t even need to move, as the Ultimate Elite Dongwu would kill himself first.","\"Grandpa Dog knows how to do it too!\" The large black dog loved to show off and strut around, so how could it be willing to be quiet at this moment? It immediately stretched out a paw.","Instantly, it was as if time had turned around, and blood and flesh reformed, turning into a person.","Han Feng.","\"Father, why are you—\"","Pa! He hadn’t even finished speaking, when he saw the large black dog’s paw descend once more. Han Feng exploded once more, turning into a shower of blood.","This!","He had already died three times.","If he was to be judged as the most tragic person in history, Han Feng would definitely be on the list — dying three times in a row in a single day was probably enough to break any record.","Everyone was once again dumbfounded.","This kind of ability that surpassed the mortal world was something that even a dog could learn?","This was a dog!","Furthermore, this dog was really too vulgar. He was even wearing a pair of iron underwear, which was completely capable of blinding one! Such a vulgar existence actually also possessed the ability of Heavenly Dao?","This, this, this, how could anyone believe this?","And Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master was really about to go mad.","His son had died twice over again!","F***, just how much enmity was there between them? Why did he have to kill his son again?","If you guys want to show off your strength, wouldn’t it be enough to revive others? Han Feng had only stepped onto the first level of cultivation, so what could killing him prove?","\"Niu knows how to too!\" Hu Niu said.","She loved to play, so she was instantly delighted upon seeing this.","She stretched out a hand. Xiu, the rain of blood that had fallen immediately gathered again, and then condensed into a human figure.","En, it was still Han Feng.","\"Father, why have you come?\" Han Feng asked curiously. Wasn’t it just hunting on a primitive planet? He had a protective talisman on him, and no one on this planet could hurt him at all.","Thus, why had his father come?","No one could bear to look at him.","Though this guy should be punished for his misdeeds, he had already died three times, and no one was willing to watch him die a fourth time.","How unlucky.","\"No!\" Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master shouted loudly.","Han Feng was even more confused. Why did his father look like he was about to die of anxiety?","He was a Galaxy Overlord, and the entire galaxy was under his control. What could not be resolved?","\"Hehe.\" Hu Niu giggled, and pressed down with her hand again. Pa! Han Feng died for the fourth time, which was also the second time in her hands.","He was definitely the most unlucky guy in history.","Everyone shook their heads. He had died four times. In future, there should be no one that could break this record.","\"Tsundere girl, do you want to play?\" Hu Niu looked towards the empress.","Among the four of them, three of them had already displayed the terrifying ability to reverse life and death or time. Though the empress had not moved yet, everyone was sure that since the four of them could stand side by side, the empress definitely had this kind of ability as well.","The empress scoffed. She was such a proud person, so how could she possibly do something so childish?","Seeing that she did not make a move, Hundred Feathers Spiritual Masterbreathed a sigh of relief.","\"Big dog, then let’s compete.\" Hu Niu’s interest was piqued, \"After I revive, you come and kill him, and we’ll see if you can do it. Then, we’ll switch.\"","\"Sure!\" The large black dog’s interest was also piqued.","Hu Niu stretched out her hand again, and Han Feng was revived for the fourth time.","\"Father—\"","When he said this, his expression changed drastically, because the large black dog had already stretched out a paw and was pressing down on him.","In an instant, this dog’s paw turned into the size of the sun, indescribably terrifying.","\"Sh*tty dog, you’re so evil!\" Hu Niu said coquettishly. She hurriedly raised her hand, and xiu, Han Feng was sent flying, directly turning into a star.","Under the intense friction, hong, Han Feng instantly combusted, instantly turning into ash.","\"You’ve lost!\" the large black dog said smugly.","Hu Niu’s eyes darted around, and she said, \"According to the rules of the competition, it’s your victory if you kill him. However, Niu was the one who killed him, so this can only be considered a draw. Again!\"","\"Little Han, your wife is still as shameless as she used to be,\" the large black dog said to Ling Han, his expression speechless.","\"Enough! Enough!\" Hundred Feathers Spiritual Master was extraordinarily furious. He roared loudly, \"I will fight you all to the death, and this whole world shall be buried with me!\"","Boom, a terrifying energy suddenly exploded from his body.","He was going to self-destruct and destroy the entire planet.","What!","Lu Hao and the others instantly felt a chill run down their spines. They could sense how terrifying this energy was. It was countless times more powerful than the largest nuclear bomb in existence. It was completely capable of instantly destroying the planet they were on.","They were done for. They were still going to die.","This was the gap in strength. If elites wanted you dead, you wouldn’t even be qualified to resist.","Ling Han smiled, and pressed out his right hand. Boom, the Hundred Feather Spiritual Master’s explosion was confined to a three-dimensional space of less than two meters. Endless seals lit up, shining brilliantly.","After a while, everything returned to calm.","\"Want to play again?\" the large black dog asked Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Forget it. There’s no need for that.\"","\"G-greetings, Lord!\" Lu Hao and the others immediately knelt on the ground. The person in front of them was even more powerful than gods, and was unfathomably powerful.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, \"Since the Spiritual Qi of this planet has already awakened, I’ll leave it at that. Yang Qi is my friend, so please take care of him.\"","\"Yes, yes!\" Lu Hao and the others all nodded, incredibly respectful.","Merely the word \"friend\" meant that they would spare no resources to nurture Yang Qi.","Xiu, a figure appeared out of thin air. It was a slender young man, his aura astonishingly strong.","\"Great Ancestor!\" This man bowed towards Ling Han, then bowed towards Hu Niu and the empress. \"Greetings, great-grandmothers!\" Then, he bowed towards the large black dog, \"Greetings, Grandpa Dog.\"","Ling Han nodded. This was his great-grandson, and also one of the more outstanding descendants. His name was Shi Taigen.","\"What is it?\" he asked.","\"In reply to Great Ancestor, a drastic change has taken place in the Netherworld. It is suspected that something big has happened. Great Ancestor, please go and take charge of the overall situation,\" Shi Taigen said.","Ling Han made a prediction, and couldn’t help but smile.","\"What is it?\" the empress asked.","\"The Son of Destiny of the Netherworld is called Shi Hao,\" Ling Han said. \"He’s a very interesting guy.\"","(—Finished—)"]}]);
